<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">Isai</book>
  <para style="h">Isai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isai</para>
  <para style="mt">Isai</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoz tapa Isai in Judah kumpipa Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz leh Hezekiah te vaihawm lai a, Judah leh Jerusalem tungtang thu a kilakna a muh thu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Vante aw, ngaikhia unla, lei aw, bildoh in, Toupa’n thu a gen hi: Tapate ka khoi a, ka khanglian sak a, ka tung ah lah a hel ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawngtal in a neitu a thei a, sabiltung in leng a pu anpiakna a thei: Israelte’n bel a theikei uh, ka mite’n a ngaihtuah kei uh” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ah! nam gilou thulimlouhna gikpi pua mite, thil hoihlou hihte, gamtat hoihlou pi a gamtate ahi ua: Toupa a paisan ua, Israelte Mi Siangthou a musit ua, kihihtuam in a nungtolhta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bang achia hel semsem a, vuak a om lailai na hi ua oi? Lutang a pum in a chi a na a, lungtang leng a pum in a gimta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khepeknuai a kipan a lutang pha in damlai himhim a omkei; chikeh, vuak sidup ek, meima naila ngen ahi: huaite lah a mekbing kei ua, tuam leng a tuam sam kei ua, sathau leng a nuh kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na gam uh loihin a omkhinta; na khuate uh mei in a kangkhinta: na gam uh gamdang mite’n na mitmuh un a neikhin ua, gamdang mite hihsiat bang in a sekhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zion tanu grephuan a vennabuk bang leh, tangmai huan a buk bang leh, khopi umsuak bang a nutsiat in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hih manthat bang tawmchik hon na sitsaklou hileh Sodom bang in i omkhin ding ua, Gomorrah bang in i omkhinta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sodom vaihawmte aw, Toupa thu za un; Gomorrah mite aw, i Pathian danthu ah bildoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n , “Huai zahzah a na kithoihna uh kei ding a bang ahia a thamatna om? Belamtal haltum a latte leh gan vakthaute thau in a honnimta; bawngpate leh belamnoute leh kelpate sisan ah leng ka kipak kei, a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ma a kilak ding a na hongpai un, ka biakin huangsung intual sik ding kuan a honphut a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thilpiak bangmah loute hontawi nawn kei un; banghiam gimlim kei ading in thil kihhuaipi ahi; kha thakte, khawlnite, khawmpite na kichial khawmte mawkmawk uh ka iplah mahmah; kikhopna thupitak leng thulimlouhna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kha thakte uleh hunbi nei a na ankuangluinate uh ka lungsim in a hua hi: kei adin tunggikna ahi; ka thuak chimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Huchi in na khut uh na zak chiang un leng ka mit k’on humsan dia: ahi, tamveipi na thum chiang un leng ka ngaikhe kei ding: na khutte ulah sisan in a dim ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kisil unla, kihihsiang un; ka mitmuh phaklouh din na thilhihte uh a gitlouhna koihmang un; gilou hih tawpta un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thil hoih hih kisinta unla; vaihawmna diktat zong un, nuaisiahna thuakte panpih unla, pa neiloute vai hawmsak unla, meithai thu gensak un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n , “Hongpai un, ngaihtuah khawm dih veni! Na khelhnate uh sanau bang in om mahleh, vuk bang in a ngou ding; sandup bang in san khin mahleh belam mul bang in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gennop tak leh thumang a na om uleh, na gam thil hoihte uh na ne ding uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh na ut kei ua na hel uleh, namsau nekkhit in na om ding uh: Toupa kam in huai a genta hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangchidan ahia khopi muanhuaitak kizuak a hongsuah maimah, vaihawm diktatna a dim nu hisek hi a! Amah ah diktatna a omsek a, tun lah tualthatmite om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na dangka eksia a hong hita, na uain lah tui toh hel ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na mi liante mihelhat, gutate lawmte ahi uh; michih in golhna a deih ua, thilpiak a delhnak uhi: pa neiloute a hawmsak sek kei ua, meithaite makhua khualna leng a kiang uh a tung ngei sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa , Sepaihte Toupa , Israelte Mihat in hichi in a chi! “Awle! hondoute tung ah ka hehna ka tangtung sak dia, ka melmate tung ah phu ka la ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in, na tung ah ka khut ka kha ding a, na eksia siang sipsip in ka hihmang ding, na sikgawm tengteng ka lamang vek ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan, na sung a vaihawmtute a tung a a om bang un ka omsak nawn ding a, na sung a lemtheimite a masapen a a om bang un ka omsak lai ding hi: Huai khitchiang in, Diktatna khopi, khopi muanhuai, a honchi ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zion vaihawmna diktata hotkhiak ahita ding a, asung a mi piangthak nawnte leng diktatna a hotkhiak ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Himahleh mihelte leh mikhialte hihsiatna a kituakin a om ding a, Toupa paisan mite leng hihman in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na tosaw deihmah mahte uh a zumpihta ding ua, na huan telte uh ziak in zaktatakin na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tosaw a nah vuaite leh huan tui mulou bang phet na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in, mi hattak jija zial bang ahita ding a, a nasep meiek bang ahi ding; huchi in a kang tuaktuak ding ua; kuamah in a phelh kei ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoz tapa Isai in Judah leh Jerusalem tungtang thu a muh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni nanungte ah hichi ahi ding a, Toupa inn omna tang tuh tang lian tungte ah hihkip in a om ding a, tangneu kha khate tung ah leng tawisan in a om ding; huai ah namchihte a hoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, chi tampite a hoh ding ua, Hongpai unla, Toupa tang ah, Jakob Pathian inn ah, i hohtou ding uh; aman a lamte tanchinte a hon sinsak ding a, a lampite ah i pai ding, a chi ding uh; Zion a kipan in danthu a hongpawt ding a, Toupa thu Jerusalem a pan a hongpawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in, aman namchih lak ah vai a hawm ding a, chi tampi tak leng a taihilh ding: a temsaute uh leilehna mukzum di’n a sek ding uh: namdang in namdang tung ah namsau a likta kei ding a, kidou dan leng a sin kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob inkuanpihte aw, hongpai un Toupa vak ah i khosa ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Suahlam a kipan a dan hongpawtta a, a na dim ua, Philistiate bang a aisansiamte a hih ua, gamdang mite tate toh khut a kilet ziak un, Na mi, Jakob inkuanpihte, lah na paisanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A gam uh dangka leh dangkaeng in a dim a, a sumte ulah simseng vual ahi kei; a gam uh sakol in a dim a, a kangtalaite ulah simseng vual ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A gam uh milim in a dim a; a khut ua a sep khiak uh, a khutzungte ua a bawl uh, a besek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi neute hihniam in a om ua, mi liante leng niamsak in a om uh: huaiziak in amau ngaidam ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa kihtakhuaina a kipan leh a kilawmna thupina a kipan suangpi ah lut unla, leivui ah kibu un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing kideihnate hihniam in a om ding a, mite kisaktheihna niamsak in a om ding, huai ni’n Toupa kia tawisan in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa ni lah kingaisang leh kisathei tengteng tung ah leh tawisang a om tengteng tung ah a om ding a; huchi in, niamsak in a om ding uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lebanon tang a sidar sing sang pipite leh tawisang a om tengteng tung ah, Bashan gam a tosaw tengteng tung ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tang lian sangpipite tung ah, tang neu tawisang a om tengteng tung ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Inn sang sangpipite tung ah, kulh bang tengteng tung ah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tarsish long lian tengteng tung ah, thil lim deihhuai tengteng tung ah leng hongom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing kideihnate hihniam in a om ding a, mite kisaktheihna niamsak in a om ding. Huaini in Toupa kia tawisang in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Milimte a mang vengveng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan, lei nakpipi a lingsak ding a a thoh hun chiang in, Toupa kihtakhuaina a kipan leh a kilawmna thupina a kipan in mite suangpi hawmte leh lei kawhawmte ah a lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai ni’n mite’n a dangka milimte uleh a dangkaeng milimte uh, biak ding a a bawlsak uh, buite leh bakte kiang ah a pai ding uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lei nakpipi a lingsak ding a a thoh hun chiang in, Toupa kihtakhuaina a kipan leh a kilawmna thupina a kipan in, suangpihawmte leh kawl suangpi hawmte ah a lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nak vang ua hu om mihing muan tawpsanta un: Banglam ah ahia muantak a hih mahmah uh?
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, Toupa Sepaihte Toupa’n , Jerusalem a kipan leh Judah a kipan a muanpi uleh a chiang uh a muanpi uh an tengteng leh a muanpi uh tui tengteng, a laksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi hat leh kidousiamte toh; vaihawmmi leh zawlnei leh, aisansiam leh, upate toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sawmnga heutu leh, mi zahtakhuai leh, lemtheimi leh, khutsiam leh thugensiamte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in a mi liante kiang ah naupangte ka pe ding a, naungekte’n a tung uah vai a hawm ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in, mite nuaisiah in a om ding ua, michih kinuaisiah in a om ding uh, michih amau invengte toh kinuaisiah in a om ding uh: naupang upa tung ah kisathei tak in a om ding ua, mi thulimloupi nangawn mizahtakhuai tung ah kisathei tak in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi’n a pa inn a unau len in, “Nang silhlehten na nei a, ka vaihawmtu un om inla, hiai siatna na khut ah om heh” a chih chiang in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai chiang in amah a pau khe ding a, “Kei zaw bawlhoihtu in ka omkei ding hi; ka inn ah nekding a omkei a, silhlehten leng a omkei: mite vaihawmpa in n’on bawl kei ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thupina mit vuisak ding a a pau uleh a thilhihte uh Toupa dou lam a hih ziak in Jerusalem a se khin a, Judahte a pukkhinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mel latdan in amau a hek tawm a; a khelhna uh Sodom bangtak in a langsak ua, a im kei uh. A tung uh gik e! thil hoihlou in a kithuk tawm ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi diktat thu ah a hoih ding uhi, chi un; a thilhih gahte ulah a ne sin ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Migiloute tung a gik hi! Lah a se sin ngal ua; a khut ua thilhih thukna a kiang ua piak a hih ding ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mite zaw, amau nuaisiahtute naupangte ahita ua, numeite’n a tung uah vai a hawmta uhi. Ka mite aw, nou honpite’n a hon pikhial ua, na paina lamte a hihse sek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa genpih ding in a hong dingkhia a, mite vaihawm ding in a hong dingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n a mite upate tung ah leh amau mi liante tung ah vai a hawm ding: Toupa Sepaihte Toupa’n , “Noute na hi uh, grephuan negaite; mi tagahte a kipan a sumlak na innte uah ahi a om:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bang achia ahia ka mite na at ua, tagahte mai na gawizan uh?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huailou in Toupa’n , “Zion tanute kisathei tak a a om ua, dak vuauvuau leh mi en loplop a a pai ua, a pai un a pai lohloh ua, a khete uh a suan ging thuapthuap ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa’n Zion tanute luzang ah meima khem a omsak ding a, Toupa’n a zahmohte uleng a dawksak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Toupa’n a kizepna hoihnate uh a laksak ding a, khebulhte, len lukhute, hakkolte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bilbah kai ngiahngiahte, taute, kikhuhna puante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lutang puante, khebulh khainiangte, kawng a tente, gimlim bawmte, kikaunate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Minsawnna zungbuhte, nakbulhte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ankuangluina vante, puanak tualte, puan silhte, kawljalte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Limlangte, puanmalngatte, dialte, kituamhoihna puante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thau namtui sik in thil muat a om ding; kawnggak sik in khauzen a om ding; sam mam sik in talkolh a om ding; puan kilawmtak sik in saiip puan a om ding: melhoih sik in meikang pawn a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na mite namsau vatpaih in a om ding ua, na mi hat mahmahte kidouna ah a puk ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A kulh kongkhakte ah awm kitum in a kap ding ua; a hawm a nutsiat ahi ding ua, lei ah a tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai ni’n numei sagih in pasal khat a len ding ua, “Koumau an ka ne ding ua, koumau silhlehten ka silh un ka teng ding uh; na min lel hon pusak in; ka minsia uh hon lakmangsak in” chi in, a gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai ni’n Toupa hiang kilawmtakin leh thupitak in a om ding a, Israelte damlaite ading in lei a gahte hoihtak leh kilawmtakin a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in, Zion nutsiat a om leh, Jerusalem a omden tuh siangthou chih in a om ding, michih Jerusalem a damlai a min gelhte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaihawmna kha leh katna kha a Toupa’n Zion tanu buahte a sawpsiangsak a, asung a kipan Jerusalem sisan a suksiang khit chiang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Zion tang a omna tengteng tung ah leh a kikhawmpite tung ah sun in mei leh meikhu, zan in meikuang vak a bawlsak ding; thupina tengteng tung ah banghiam zak a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sun in nisa liah ding leh huihpi vuahpi lak a kihumbitna leh bukna mun ding in bawkta ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka itluat thu, a grephuan tungtang thu, ka itluat ading in la in ka sata mai ding. Ka itluat in tang lei hoih mahmah ah grephuan a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kimvel in lei a toukuaka, a suangte a tom sianga, grepgui hoihpen a suan a, a lai ah insang a lam a, huai ah grep sukna khuk leng a tou hi. huchi in, grep gah a gah ding in a lamen a, himahleh grep taklou a gah maimah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuin, Jerusalem a omte leh Judah mite aw, “Hehpih in kei leh ka grephuan kal thu hon ngaihtuah dihve ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua grephuan ah ka hihsa a kan a val a tung ah hih nawn lailai ding bangbang om ahita mai a? Bangziak in ahia, grep gah a gah ding a ka lamet et toh, grep taklou a gah maimah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin ngai un, ka grephuan tung ah ka hih ding k’on hilh ding: a ling dai ka lamang ding a, nekgaih in a om ding; a suangdai ka chimsak ding a, sikden in a om ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan, ka hihse vek ding a; satnou in om ken chin, tohvui in leng omsam ken teh; loulingnei leh khau lingneite a pou zaw ding: meite leng a tung a vuah zusak lou ding in thu ka pe ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa grephuan Israel inkuanpihte ahi a, Judah mite a kung deihhuai ahi uhi; vaihawmna diktat a lamen a; himahleh, ngai in, nuaisiahna a hongom zawta ahi: diktatna a lamen a, himahleh, ngai in, kikou husa a hongom zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gam laizang a amau kia a om theihna ding ua mi om samna ding mun himhim omlou khop hial a inn leh inn kizomsak zel leh, lou leh lou kizomsakte tung a gik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n ka bil ah hichibang in a chi, “Innte tampi, lian pipite kilawm pipi, a teng ding omlou in a hawm vek ngeingei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Grep huan tin sawm mun ah bath khat kia suak ding in a kisa a, buh chi homer khat tuh in ephah khat kia suak ding in lah a kisa ngal a” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zu delh ding a zingkhang pipi a thou a, uain in a khamgawp sak mateng zan sawtpi pi tan a om sakte a tung uh a gik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tumging leh kaihgingte, khuangta leh tamngaite, uain toh a ankuangluina uahte a om sek a, himahleh Toupa nasep a ngaisang kei ua, a khut thilhihte leng, a ngaihtuah ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka mite zaw, theihna a neih louh ziak un, sal a pi in a omta ua: a mi zahtakhuaite uh a gil uh a kial a, a mipite uh dangtak in a dang uh a keu khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in Sheol in a gilkialna a na liansak a, a kam teh vuallouh khop in a kata a: huchi in a thupinate uh, a mipite uh, a thupi mahmahnate un, a lak ua kipaktak a omte toh a lutsuk ngoingoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi neute kunsak in a om ua, mi liante niamsak in a om ua, kisatheite sukniam in a omta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa bel vaihawmna a tawisang in a om zawta, Pathian, Mi Siangthou, diktatna a hih siangthou in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, belamnoute a tatna mun ua a ta bang un a ta diamdiam ding ua, mi thau pipite mun sesa a thilte vakvaite’n a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zuautheihna khaute a thulimlouhna kai a, kangtalai khauzen a kaih bang a khelhna kaisek tung a gik hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I muhna ding in hihmeng henla, a thilhih ding hihkin heh; i theihna ding in Israelte Mi Siangthou lemtheih hongnai in hongtung hen, chi gigete ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil hoihlou thil hoih chi a, thil hoih lah thil hoihlou chi zel a, vak mial a ngai a, mial vak a ngaisek a, thil khum thil kha a ngai a, thil kha thil khum a ngaisekte a tung uh a gik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amau pil a kingaihtuahte leh amau mit muh a teite a tung uh a gik hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uain dawn lam a mi hattak, zu hel lam a thagui nei mite a tung uh a gik!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Golh nek ziak a migilou siamtangsak sek a, mi diktat diktatna laksak sekte ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaiziak in meikuang in buhpawl a liak bei dundun sek bang in leh loupa keu meikuang a a puk zungzung sek bang in a zung uh a muatna bang in a om ding a, a pak uh leivui bang in a tungkah lunglung ding: Sepaihte Toupa dan a deihkei ua, Israelte Mi Siangthou thu a ngaihneu ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa a mite tung ah a heh mahmah a, a tung uah a khut a lik a, a vua a, huchi in tangte ah a ling vonvon ua, a luangte uh kongzing lak ah nin bulom bang in a om venvon hi. Huchitel a a hih in leng a hehna lah a dai kei a, a khut a lik lailai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Namchih gamla tak a mite ading in chiamtehna a tak khe ding a, kawlmong a kipan sam ding in a singsit ding: huchi in, ngai in, amaute kintak in a hongpai pah ding uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amau lak ah kuamah a gim kei ding ua, a kisui sam kei ding uh; kuamah a lusu kei ding ua, a ihmu sam kei ding uh; a kawnggak ulah phelkol in a omkei ding a, a khedap gakna leng a tansam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A thalte uh a zum mahmah a, a thalpeu tengteng uh laisa in a om keukou a; a sakol chinte uh meisah suang a bang a, a kangtalai khete uh leng pingpei a bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A husa ging honhon uh humpinelkai humham bang mai ahi. Humpinelkai lunlai humham bang mai in a ging honhon hi: ahi, a ging honhon a, a samat ding uh a man ua, bittak in a paimangpih ua, kuamah in a honkhe theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huai ni’n tuipi ging hawhaw bang in a tung uah a ging hawhaw ding ua: Huchi in min gam a hon et uleh, ngai in, mial leh mangbatna ngen ahi a, vak lah huai a meite a hihmial in a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Uzziah a sih kum in Toupa mangtutphah sangtak a tawisan a tu ka mu a, a puansilh mong tual in biakin a dimsak vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kiang ah serafte ading ua; kha guk chiat a nei ua, a kha nihte un a mai uh a khuh ua, nih in a khepekte uh a khuh ua, nih in a leng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in, "Sepaihte Toupa a siangthou hi, a siangthou hi, a siangthou hi, lei pumpi a thupina in a dim” chi in, a kikou tuah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in a kikou husa in kongpi bul suangphum nasan in a lingsak dupdup a, inn meikhu in a dimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaitak in, ken, “Muk ninpu mi ka hi a, muk ninpu mite lak a teng ka hih ziak in ka tung gik hina tele! Mangthang ka hita ve; ka mit in kumpipa, sepaihte Toupa , a muta ngal a” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, seraf khat, maitam a kipan taiteh a teh, mei am tawi in ka kiang ah a hongleng a, ka kam hongbi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ngai in, hiai in na muk a sukhata, huchi in na thulimlouhna lakmang ahita, na khelhna leng sawpsiang ahita” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan, “Kua ka sawl dia, kou adia kua kuan ding ahia?” chi in, Toupa aw ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in, ken, “Kei hiai ah ka om, honsawl ve” ka chi hi. Aman, “Kuan inla, hiai mite va hilh in, bil in zaw za unla, theihsiam bel theisiam kei un; muh zaw mu unla, theih bel theikei un, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai chite lungtang thausak inla, a na uh ngongsak inla, a mitte uh mitsi sak in; huchilou in zaw a mit un a mu ding ua, a bil un a za ding ua, a lungtang un a thei ding ua, a hong kihei nawn ding ua, damsak in a om kha ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, ken, “ Toupa bang tan ahi dia?” ka chi a. Aman, hon dawng a, “Khopite a teng ding bei a suksiat a a om a, innte a mi bei a a om a, gam loih sipsip a a om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n mite gamlapi ah a suan a, gamsung a mun paisansa tampi a om masiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, asung ah sawm lak ah khat leng omlai om leh nekkhit in a om behlap ding uhi: himahleh nahhi leh tosaw phukkhit nung a a bul a om nilouh bang in chi siangthou a bul om nilouh ahi” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Uzziah tapa Jotham tapa Ahaz vaihawmlai in hichi ahi. Suria kumpipa Rezin leh Israel kumpipa Remaliah tapa Pekah Jerusalem sim ding in a kuantou ua; himahleh a zou kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Suria leh Ephraim a pangkhawmta uh, chi in David inkuanpihte a hilh ua, huchi in a lungtang leh a khua leh tuite lungtang, gamnuai singte huih in a mutling suausuau bang in, hihlin in a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n Isai kiang ah, “Nang leh na tapa Shearjashub, dil saknung zaw pen tuilakna tawp ah, Puansawpmi gam lamlian ah, Ahaz dawn ding in kuan khia unla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kiang ah, Pilvang inla om kinken in; meisel sum khu lel nih, Suria toh Rezin leh Remaliah tapa hehna thupitak kihta kenla, na lungtang taikek kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suria in, Ephraim leh Ramaliah tapa toh nangmah tung a gitlouh a sawmtak ziak in, chi in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah dou ding in kuantou ni’n, vahihlau ni, eimah ading ngei in i vazou dia, a laitak ah Tabeel tapa kumpipa in i tusak ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n hichibang in a chi: “A thusawm uh a piching kei ding a, a vuaksuak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suria lutang Damaska ahi a, Damaska lutang Rezin lah ahi ngal a: kum sawmguk leh kum nga man ma in Ephraim chi chihtaklouh a om ding in suksiat vek in a om ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan, Ephraim lutang Samaria ahi a, Samaria lutang Remaliah tapa lel a hih ziak in. Na up nopkei uleh hihkip in na omkei hial ding uh” chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n Ahaz a houpih nawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Toupa na Pathian kiang ah chiamtehna ngen in; thukpi ah hiam, tunglam sangpi ah hiam ngen in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahaz in bel, “Ka ngen kei ding, Toupa ka ze-et kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, aman, “David inkuanpihte aw, tuin ngaikhe dih ua; mihing hihgim thil neuchik din na sep uh maw, ka Pathian nangawn hihgim na ut zel uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa mahmah in chiamtehna nou a honpe ding; ngai un, nungak siangthou khat a gai ding a, tapa a nei ding a, a min ‘Immanuel’ a sa ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman thil hoihlou lam deihlouhna dan a theih chiang in leh, thil hoih lam deihna dan a theih chiang in bawngnawi dat leh khuaizu a ne ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naupang thil hoihlou lam deihlouhna dan leh thil hoih lam deihna dan a theih ma in leng kumpipa nih na gam huatte taisan in a om ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ephraim in Judah a nutsiat ni a kipan tung ngei nailou nite Toupa’n na tung ah leh, na khua leh tuite tung ah leh, na pa inkuanpihte tung leh Assuria kumpipa mahmah tung ah a tungsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, Toupa’n Aigupta luinak a thou om leh, Assuria gam a khuai om, sam ding in a singsit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in a hongpai ding ua, avek un guam leh kense lak ah, suangpi hawm ah, loulingnei tengteng leh gantatna mun tengteng ah a dim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Huai ni chiang in Toupa’n mulmettem khel in, Luipi khen gam a Assuria kumpipa om zang in, lutang leh khe mul a met siang ding a; khamul leng a metsiang vek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Huchi in huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, mi khat in bawngla khat leh belam nih kia a vul ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh hichi ahi ding a, nawitui tampi a neih ding ziak un nawitui dat a nesak ding: gamsung a omlai mi’n nawitui dat leh khuaizu a ne chiat ding ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, munchih, grepgui sang, dangka sang man omna peuhmahte loulingnei leh khaulingnei omna lel ahita ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gam pumpi loulingnei leh khaulingnei ngen a hong hihtak ziak in huai ah thaltang leh thalpeu tawi in a pai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in, tang, tupi a tohsa teng ah, loulingnei leh khaulingnei kihtak ziak in na hongpai kei ding a, bawngtalte tatsakna leh belam gamtatna mun ding lel ahita ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Laigelhna pek lianpi la inla, mihing laigelhna in a tung ah Mahershalalhashbaz ading, chi in, gelh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in theipih muanhuai, siampu Uriah leh Jaberekiah tapa Zekariah theihpihpa ding in ka bawl ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, zawlneinu kiang ah ka hoh a, huchi in aman nau a pai a, tapa a neita hi. Huchi in Toupa’n ka kiang ah “A min in Mahershalalhashbaz sa in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naupang in, Nu, Pa, chihna dan a theih ma in leng Damaska hauhsakna leh Samaria a gallak tengteng Assuria kumpipa ma ah paimangpih ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah a gen nawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hiai chite’n Siloah tui awl a luang diahdiah a deihlouh ziak un leh, Rezin leh Remaliah tapa tung a a kipah un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa’n luipi tui, khauh mahmah leh tam mahmah, Assuria kumpipa leh a thupina tengteng, a tung uah a luangsak ding: huchi in a piau tengteng a honglet zoizoi in, a gei tengteng ah leng a let zoizoi ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in, Judah gam tuam in a luang ding a; ngawng tan a tumpha hial ding a; a kha zak in, Immanuel aw, na gam vailam tengteng a khak vek ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chichihte aw, buai vengvungta unla, kitamzak a om ding na hi uhi; gam gamlapi a mi tengteng aw, bildoh un; kigalthuam un, kitamzak a om ding na hi uhi; kigalthuam un, kitamzak a om ding na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thu kikum unla, bangmah hi peuh kenteh; thu gen unla, piching peuh kenteh: Pathian i kiang ah a om ngal a, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n khut hattak in huchi in ka kiang ah a gen, hiai chite lampi a ka pailouhna ding in hon thuzoh eive:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai chite’n, “Sawm a nei uh, a chih teng uh, Sawm a nei uh, chihpih kei un, a kihtak teng uzong nou zaw kihta kei unla, lau leng laupih sam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa , amah mah na hihsiangthou ding uhi; amah na kihtak uh hi henla, amah na lau uh hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, amah Mun Siangthou ading ahi ding a; Israel inkuanpih nihte ading in bel pukna suang leh dalna suangpi ahizaw ding a, Jerusalem a omte ading in thang leh pial ahi lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in mi tampi in huai a sui ding ua a puk ding uh, kitapsak in a om ding ua, a awk ding ua, mat in a om ding uh” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Theihsakna thu zial gak inla, danthu ka sinsakte lak ah bilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, ken Jakob inkuanpihte lak a a mai selpa Toupa ka ngak ding a, amah ka en nilouh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai in, kei leh Toupa honpiak naupangte, Israelte lak ah sepaihte Toupa Zion tang a om lak a chiamtehna a dingte leh thillamdang a dingte i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan, min, “Dawi aisansiam zawl leh bumsiam ham tualtual leh phun nomnomte dong in, a honchih chiang un huchi in dawng un: Min a Pathian uh a dot zawk ding uh hilou hia? Mihingte ading in misi a dong ding ua hia?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Danthu leh theihsakna thu dot ding ahi” chi in. Huai thu bangbang a a gen kei uleh amau ading in khua himhim a vak zok kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lungkhamtak leh gilkial kawm in gam a tuansuak ding ua; hichi ahi ding a, a gil uh a kial chiang in a heh mahmah ding ua, a kumpipa uleh a Pathian uh a hamsiat ding ua, vanlam a nga ding uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in, lei lam a en ding ua, ngai in, lungkhamna leh mialna, lunglauna nguina ahi ding; huchi in mial bikbek ah delhmang in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himahleh lunglau a omkhinnu ading in nguina himhim a omta kei ding. Nidanglai in Zebulun gam leh Naphtali gam simmohhuai in a omsak a, himahleh hun nanung ah zaw thupitak in a omsakta, dil gei ah, Jordan gal ah, namchih Galili mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi mial nuai a vakte’n vak thupitak a muta ua: sihna lim gam a omte tung mahmah ah vak a hongvakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nam na tamsakta a, a nopsakna uleng na khangsakta hi: buhlak lai a nuamsa bang in na ma ah nuam a sata ua, min gallak sum a hawm ua nuam a sak bang mai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A puakgik puakna hakkol leh a liangzang a zawnna zawl, amah nuaisiahte khetbuk mah, Midiante zoh ni bang in na suktansakta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chiak vengvung a mi galthuam a a kithuamna tengteng uleh puansilh sisan toh kidiah niaunuau tengteng, hal a, mei a khul ding phet ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ei ding in naupang a hongpiang a, tapa piak in i omta; vaihawmna a liangzang ah a tuang ding a; a min "Lamdang," "Lemthei,: "Pathian Hat," "Tangtawn Pa," "Lemna Lal" a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David tutphah tung ah leh a gam tung ah a vaihawmna khandan leh lemna in tawpni a neikei ding, hihkip ding leh tua kipan a tangtawn tan a leng vaihawmna leh diktatna tungding ding in, Sepaihte Toupa phatuamngaihna in huaite a hih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n Jakobte gam ah thu a khak a, Israelte tung ah a keta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in mi tengteng, Ephraimte leh Samaria a om, kisatheitak leh lungsim a kiuangsak:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tekleite chim mahleh, suangtak sek in i lemna ding; theipi singte sattan in om mahleh, sidar singte in i kheng ding, chite’n a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n Rezin doumite amah dou ding in a tawisang ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A melma, suahlam a Suriate, tumlam a Philistiate, a tokthou ding; huchi in kam ka in Israelte a nekhin ding uh. Huchi hial a hih in leng a hehna a daikei a, a khut a lik lailai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh mite’n amaute vawpa lam a nga tuankei ua, Sepaihte Toupa lah a zong tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n Israelte a kipan in a lutang leh a mei, tum hiang leh pumpeng ni khat thu in a bantan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Upa leh mizahtakhuaite, a lutang ahi ua; zuauthu sinsak zawlneite, a mei ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiai mipite’n a pikhial nak uhi, a pite uh hih manthat in a om nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n a tangvalte uh tung ah a kipak kei ding a, a tagahte uleh a meithaite uleng a hehpih sam kei ding; avek un Pathian zahlou mi leh thil hoihlou hihmite ahi chiat ua, a kam un thuginalou a gen uhi. Hichi a hihnung in leng, a hehna a dai kei a, a khut a lik lailai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gitlouhna lah mei bang in a kuang luahluah a, lou lingnei leh khaulingneite a kangmang ahi, gammang nonglak a kang luahluah a, a khutou ngoingoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa heh ziak in gam a kang sia a, mite leng mei a khul ding sing bang ahi ua; kuamah in amau unau leng a hawi kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in min a taklam ua mi a suh ding ua, himahleh a tai tuankei ding uh; michih in amau bansa a ne chiat ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Manassehte’n Ephraimte a ne ding ua, Ephraimte’n Manassehte a ne ding ua; a nih un Judahte a dou khawm ding uhi. Huchi lawmlawm a a hih in leng, a hehna lah a daikei a, a khut a lik lailai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hoihlou tak a thupukna bawlte leh diklou tak a gelhmite tung a gik hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meithaite tanding gallak a laksak a om theihna ding uleh, pa neiloute thil laksak bang a a bawl theihna ding un, neizouloute vaihawmna diktat tangsaklou ding leh, ka mite lak a gentheite muh ding mawngmawng laksak tumte!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in, gawtna ni a hongtun chiang leh gamlapi a kipan huihpi a hongtun chiang in, bang na hih ding ua oi? Panpihna ngen ding in kua kiang ah na taita ding ua? Na thupina uh koi ah na nuseta ding ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hentate lak ah a kun ding ua, thahte lak ah a puk ding uh, hiaite lel a tan uh ahita ding hi. Huchi a hih in leng, a hehna lah a dai kei a, a khut a lik lailai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n "Kisa in, Assuria mi, ka hehna khetbuk, ka lungkimlouhna chiang tawi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gallak la ding leh, thil laksak la ding leh, kongzing buannawi bang a ngap ding in amah zaw Pathian zahlou nam dou ding in ka sawl ding a, ka hehna mite sual ding in thu ka pe ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh aman huchibang a tup ahi kei a, huchibang zaw a lungsim in leng a ngaihtuah sam kei; nam tam petmah a tam hihsiat leh hih manthat ahi, lungsim a a neih zawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka miliante tengteng kumpipa ahivek kei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kalno khua Karkhemish khua bang hitalou ahi maw? Hamath khua Arpad khua bang hita lou ahi maw? Samaria khua Damaska khua bang hita lou ahi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka khut in milimte gam, Jerusalem khua leh Samaria khuate sang a milim bawltawm hoihzaw neite leng, a zongkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samaria leh a milimte tung a ka hihtak bang in Jerusalem leh a milimte tung ah ka hih kei dia hia?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi a hih ziak in hichi ahi ding a; “ Toupa’n Zion tang leh Jerusalem khaw sung a a nasep ding tengteng a sepkhit hun chiang in Assuria kumpipa lungsim kiotsakna gah leh a mit kisathei thupina ka gawt ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman, “Ka khut hatna in ka hihta hi, ka pilna toh in; ka kizen ngal a; chichih gamgite lah ka suan a, a vaihawmna uh lah ka suta, mangtutphah a tute mi hangsan hih bang in ka kaikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka khut in chichih hauhsaknate lah vasabu bang in a zongkhia a; min vasa tui a pi loihsansa a la uh bang in lei tengteng ka la khinvekta hi; khazap hiam, kamka hiam ham himhim leng a omkei uhi," a chi vial ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Heipi in thil ehna ding a a zangmi a kisaktheihsan dia hia? Singatna in a atmi a nuaisiah dia hia? Khetbuk in a dommite a lik zawsop diam aw, chiang in sing hilou a lik zawmah bang phet ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa , Sepaihte Toupa’n , “A mi thaute lak ah gawnna a sawl ding a; a thupina nuai ah mei kuang lai lel bang in mei toh in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, Israelte vakna mei a honghi ding a, a Misiangthou mah uleng meikuang ahi ding; huai in ni khat thu in loulingneite leh khaulingneite a kangsak in a hih mangthang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A gammang leh a lei hoih mun thupina leng, kha leh sa nasan in, a hihmang ding; huchi in, chiamtehna tawipen kia hunlai bang ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A gammang a sing omzek laite naupang gelh tham phet a tawm ahita ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai ni’n hichi ahi ding a, Israelte omlaite leh Jakob inkuanpihte lak a a damlaite’n amaute thatpa a muang nawnta kei ding ua; Toupa Israelte Mi Siangthou, chihtaktak in a muangzawta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A omlai, Jakob omlaite, Pathian hattak kiang ah a kiknawn ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na mi Israelte tuipi piaunel zah in om mahle uh, a omlaite kia a kiknawn ding uhi; diktatna luanletna suksiatna tungdinga vaihawmpuk ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa , Sepaihte Toupa’n , tawpna, tawpna tung ngei ding a vaihawmpuk, lei tengteng laizang ah a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa , Sepaihte Toupa’n , hichi in a chi, “Zion a om ka mite aw, Aigupta gam a a hih bang un khetbuka nou honvua in a chiang na tung uah lik mahleh, Assuriami kihta kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sawtlouchik nung in ka lungkimlouhna a hong bei dia, ka hehna leng amaute hih manthatna dia hei in a omta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Oreb suangpi a Midiante a thahlai bang un sepaihte Toupa’n amah sual ding in zepna a pei ding a; a chiang lah tuipi tunglam ah a om ding a Aigupta gam a a pei bang in a pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huai ni’n hichi ahi ding a, puakgik na liangzang a kipan a lakmang in a om ding a, a hakkol leng na ngawng a kipan a lakmang in a omlai ding hi; thaunilh ziak in hakkol lah hihsiat in a omta ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Rimmon a kipan Aiath khua a tungta Migron khua ah a paisuakta; Mikmash khua ah a van a koihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Guam ah a tumta uh; Geba khua ah a giakta uh; Ramah khuate a lingling ua; Saul, Gibeah khote a taimangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gallim tanu aw! na aw in ngaihtak in kikou in; Laish a khua aw! ngaikhia in; Anathoth aw, hehpihhuai na lawmlawm chia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Madmenah khote taimang in a omta uh; Gebim khua a omte taimang tum in a kidelh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuni mah in Nob khua ah a tam dia; Zion tanu tang, Jerusalem mual pawng a khut a sinkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ngai dih, Toupa , sepaihte Toupa’n , thil mulkimhuai tak in a hiangte a satkhe ding a, sangpipite phuk in a om ding a, a dawktuamte leng gawiniam in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sik in gamnuai sing sahte a phuk ding a, Lebanon sidar singte mithupi puk in a puk zuazua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesse bul a kipan in selnou a hongpawt ding a, a zungte a kipan in a hiang a hong khangkhe ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan Toupa kha pilna leh theihtheihna kha, lemtheihna leh hatna kha theihna leh Toupa launa kha a tung ah a tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in a kipahna uh Toupa launa ah ahi ding. A mit a a muh bang in vai a hawm kei ding a, a bil a a zak bang in leng a taihilh sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gentheite diktattak in vai a hawmsak zaw ding a, lei a mi thunuailutte ading in khentuam neilou in a taihilh saklai ding hi; a kam a khetbuk in lei a khen ding a, a muk a hu in migilou saloute a that ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Diktatna a kawnggak ahi ding a, ginomna a taigakna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, ngia leh belamnou a omkhawm ding ua, gialbem kelnou toh a bokkhom ding uh, bawng nou leh humpinelkai tuailai leh ganvakthaute a omkhawm ding ua; naupangnou in a pi zungzung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawng leh vompi a gamta khawm ding ua; a noute uh a bokkhawm tiptep ding uhi; huan humpinelkai in bawngtal bang in buhpawl a ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nau nawitui nelai thangtom kaw gei ah a om hiathiat ding a, nau nawitui nek tawpsa in guldekpak kawgei ah a khut a nga ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tang siangthou ah kihihnat a omta kei ding a, kihihsiat leng a om nawn kei ding, tuipite tui a a dim gige bang in, lei Toupa theihna in a dim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, huai ni’n hichi ahi ding a, Jesse zung michih chiamtehna ding in a om ding a, amah mahmah namte'n a dong ding ua, a khawlna mun a thupi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ni’n hichi ahi ding a, Toupa’n a si val omsun a mite, Assuria gam a kipan, Aigupta gam a kipan, Pathros gam a kipan, Kush gam a kipan, Elam gam a kipan, Sinar gam a kipan leh Hamath khua a kipan leh tuipi tuikulhgam a kipan, a la nawn ding a, a nihveina ding in a khut a zak nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in, namchih a ding in chiamtehna a takkhe ding a, Israel delhkhiakte a pikhawm ding a, Judah dalhte kawlmong li a kipan a pikhawm ding
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in, Ephraimte hazatna a beita ding a, Judahte hihbuai mite hih manthat in a omta ding uh; Ephraimte’n Judahte a haza nawnta kei ding ua, Judahte’n leng Ephraimte a hihbuai nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in, amaute tumlam ah Philistiate liangzang ah lengsukin a va tuang ding ua; suahlam mite a lokkhawm ding uh; Edom leh Moabte tung ah a khut uh a kha ding ua, Ammon suante’n a thu uh a mangta ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n Aigupta tuipi lei a hihse vek ding a, Luipi leng a huihsa huthut in a khut a sinkhum ding a, luita sagihte a bawlhial in a vaw ding a, mite khepek leng kawtlou in a pai galkah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in, Aigupta gam a kipan a paitouh ni ua Israelte ading a lamlian a hongom bang in, a sibang omsun a mite ading in Assuria gam a kipan in lamlian a hongom ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichibang in na chi ding hi, " Toupa aw, kipahthu k’on hilh hi; ka tung ah na hehta mahle chin, na hehna lah a daita, nang hon khamuanta neive.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai in, Pathian hon hondampa ahi a; ka gingta ding a, lau in ka omkei ding; Toupa Jehovah ka hatna leh ka la ahi, hon hondampa ahi," chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in hotdamna tuikhuk a pan nuam in tui na tawi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai ni’n huchi in na chi ding. " Toupa kiang ah kipahthu hilh unla, a min lou un, a thilhihte michih lak ah theisak unla, a min pahtawi in a om chih gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa pahtawi in lasa un; aman thil hoihpente a hihta hi; huai leitung ah theih in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion a omte aw, ngaihtak in kikou unla, kikou vengvung un, Israelte Mi Siangthou na lak ua om lah a thupi ngal a," chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon khaw puakgik Amoz tapa Isai in a muh thu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi liante kongpite a a lut theihna ding un tang mai velvul ah chiamtehna takkhia unla, ngaihtak in amau sam unla, khut in hih ding dan hilh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei mahmah in ka misehte thu ka peta, ahi, ka mi hattak, ka mi kinuamsakte, ka hehna tangtung sak ding in ka samta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua! Tang a mipi husa, mipi a tam a tam husa bang mahmah! Tua! namchih gam a mi omkhawmte chiak vengvung husa! Sepaihte Toupa’n galsual ding a sepaihte kaikhawm eive.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute, Toupa leh a lungkimlouhna vanzat, gam gamlapi a kipan, kawlmong tawpna mahmah a kipan in gam tengteng hihse ding in a hongpai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mau tuaituai un; Toupa ni a naita hi. Bangkim hihthei a kipan a siatna a hongtung bang in a hongtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in khut tengteng a hat kei ding a, mihing lungtang chiteng leng a zulmang ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in, a lau ding ua; damlouhna leh lungkimlouhnate’n amaute a man ding a; numei nauvei bang mai in a chi uh a na ding; lamdang kisa tuah in a om chiat ding uh; a melte uh meikuang mel bang ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai in, gam hihse ding leh huailai a mikhialte asung a kipat a hih mangthang ding in Toupa ni thupitak, thangpaihna leh hehna thupitak toh, a hongtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Van aksite leh aksi munkipte un a vakna uh a suaksak kei ding ua; ni lah a suah lai in mialsak in a om ding a, kha in leng a vakna a vaksak kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, khovel a gitlouhna ziak in ka gawt ding a, migilou saloute a thulimlouhna ziak un ka gawt sam ding. Mi kisathei paukhauh lah ka tawpsak ding a, mi kihtakhuai kisaktheihna lah ka niamsak lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi dangkaeng siangthou sang a leng manpha zaw in ka bawl ding a, mihing mahmah lah Ophir dangkaeng siangthou sang a leng manpha zaw in ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in tung a van ka kisingsak ding a, sepaihte Toupa hehna ziak in, a hehna ni thupitak ni’n, lei leng a omna mun kisuan tham in linsak in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, sakhi delh ek bang leh belam kuamah holkhawm louh bang in michih amau chipihte lamchiat a nga ding ua, michih amau gam lamchiat ah a taimang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Muh a om peuhmah dawt pailet in a om ding a, huan, mat a om peuhmah namsau a satpaih in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A naungekte uleng a mitmuh un zan dimdem khop a leisatna a zat in a om ding uh; a innte uh loh in a om dia, a zite uh leng mawksual in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai in, Mediate amau sual ding in ka tokthou ding a, huaite’n dangka a limsak kei ding ua, dangkaeng leng a kipahpih kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thalpeute un tangvalte a zansak ding a; gil a gahte hehpihna himhim a neikei ding uh; a mit un naupangte a hawikei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan, Babulon, gamchih thupina, Kaldaite kisaktheihpih thil hoihtak, Pathian in Sodom leh Gomorrah a sukman lai bang in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chikchiang in leng huai ah mi a om nawnta kei ding uh, suan omlai siah in leng asung a om a omsam kei ding; Arab mite’n huai ah a puaninte uh a kai kei ding ua; belam chingte’n huai ah a belamhonte uh a kualsak kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gamdai a gamsate huai ah a om ding ua; a innte uh simbute inn in a dim ding a; vasa ngawngsaute huai ah a teng ding ua, sathakte huai ah a mawl leklek ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngiate a insangte uah a ham ding ua, sihalte leng a inpi nuam mahmahte uah a ham ding uh; huan, a gawt hun ding a tung dekta a, a nite leng suksau in a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n Jakobte a hehpih ding a, Israelte tel in amau gam ngeingei ah a omsak ding hi; Huan, gamdangmite’n amau a zui ding ua, Jakob inkuanpihte a lenkip ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in, michih in amau a pi ding ua, a mun ding uh a tun ding uhi; huchi in Israel inkuanpihte’n Toupa gam ah amau salpa leh salnu in a nei ding ua; amau sal a neimite sal in a honman ding ua; amaute simmohte tung ah vai a honhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, na lungkhamna a kipan, na buaina a kipan leh nasep haksapipi a hon sepsakna ua kipan in Toupa’n nang a hon khawlsak ni chiang in hichi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai pau el thu Babulon kumpipa kikoukhum in na gen ding. Bangchidan ahia, simmohhatpa daita na e! Bangchidan ahia, dangkaeng khopi daita na tel e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n migilou salou chiang a hihtanta, vaihawmmite lalchiang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Michih hehkawma vaw zialzial zel, michih thangpai kawm a kuamah kham ngeilouh sawina a vaihawm sak zel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lei pumpi a khawla, a dai vungvunga; thakhat in la a sa khe guih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi, na tungthu ziak in meilahte a nuam ua, Lebanon tang a sidar singte toh. Hihniam a na om nungsiah phukpaitu ding himhim ka kiang uah a hongtou ngei nawn kei uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nuailam a kipan Sheol nang hondawn ding in, nangmah ziak in a buai lutlut hi; misi, lei a makai tengteng nangmah ziak in a tokthou a; namchih kumpipa tengteng a mangtutphah ua kipan a kaidingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai tengteng in nangmah bia in, na kiang ah huchi in a gen ding uh. Nang leng kou bang a hatta lou na hi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na thupi mahmahna Sheol a pikhiak suk ahita, na kaihging lunglungte toh; tangtel na nuai ah a phah ua, than in nang a hon khuhta uhi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sun Aksi aw, Zingsang tapa, bangchidan ahia van a kipan na kiaktak maimah! Namchih hihpukpa, bangchidan ahia lei a satkhiak suk a na om maimah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na lungtang in, Van ah ka kah ding a, Pathian aksite tunglam ah ka mangtutphah ka tawisang ding; huan, kikhopna tang, mal tawp a om ah, ka tu ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meipi sang a sang ah ka kah ding a; Tungnungpen bang mai in ka om ding, na chinak vial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh, Sheol ah, kawkhuk tawp ah, pikhiak suk a om ding na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hon mu peuh in a hon lim et ding ua, hiai mi maw lei hihling a, gamchih kising sak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khovel gamdai bang a bawl a, a khua omte hihmang a, a salte a inn lam ua paidia pawtsak ngeilou? chi in, na tanchin a sut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Namchih kumpipa tengteng, avek un, amau inn chiat uah thupitak in a ihmu ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang bel a hunlou a piang kihhuaitak bang in leh, galthah, namsau a sut pailet, kawkhuk a thante lak a paisukte puansilh bang in na han in a kipan gamlapi a paih khiak in na om zawta hi; luang sikden bang mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na gam na hihsiat a, na khua na tuite na thah ziak in a lak ua vui in nang zaw na omkei ding hi. Thil hoihlou hihmite suante min tangtawn in a lou ngeikei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kisak ua, lei a neih ua, leitung khopi a a dimsak louhna ding un, a pipute uh khelhna ziak in a tate uh thah ding ngaihtuah un, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan, “Amaute sual ding in ka kisa ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi, Babulon a kipan min leh, a omlaisunte leh, tapa leh tapa’ tapa ka hihmang ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sakuh ading in gou in ka bawl ding a, dilte ah leng ka bawl ding; hihmanna munphiat in ka phiat lai ding” sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichibang a gen in a kichiamta, “Pellou in ka ngaihtuah bangtak in a hongtung ding; ka seh bangtak in leng a om ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka gam ah Assuria mi ka hihse ding a, ka tangte ah ka chil ek ding a chih bang in; huai hun chiang in a hakkol uh amau a kipan a mangta ding a, a puakgik uh a liangzang ua kipan in a mangsam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huai ahi, lei pumpi a thuseh, huai mah ahi, namchih tung a khutzak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n a septa ngal a, kuan a sut dia? A khutzak in a omta, kuan a laknawn sak dia?” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaz sih kum in hiai puakgik a hong omta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Philistia gam pumpi aw, nangmah vuakna chiang a kitan tak ziak in kipak ken: gul zung a kipan in guldekpak a pawt ding a, a gah gul kuang leng thei a honghi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi genthei tamasate’n a ne un a ta ding ua, mi tagahte leng bittak in a om ding uh; nang a zung bel kial in ka that ding a, nang a omsunte thah in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kongkhak aw, mau tuaituai in; khopi aw, kikou in; Philistia aw, na pum in na zulmang khinta; mallam a kipan in lah meikhu a hongpawt ngal a, a hun seh uah tuantual himhim a om ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Philistia nam palaite bangchibang in i dawng ding ua? Toupa’n Zion lah a tungdinga, a mite lak a gentheite’n bitna a mu uh, i chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab gam puakgik. Zan khat thu in Moab gam a Ar khua suksiat in a om a, bangmahlou a bawl in a omta hi; zan khat thu in Moab gam a Kir khua suksiat in a om a, bangmahlou a bawl in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dibon tanu, mun sangte a kap ding in a hoh touta a; Moabte’n Nebo leh Medeba a kahkhum ua, a lu tengteng uh a giau vek a, a khamul teng uleng met in a om vekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kongzingte uah saiip puan a teng ua: a intungte uah leh a kholak uah michih nakpi’n a mau tuaituai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Heshbonte leng a kikou ua, Elealehte toh; Jahaz kholam in leng a aw uh a za uhi: huaiziak in Moabte galvan a kivante ngaihtak in a kikou ua; a hinna uh asung uah a ling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moabte ziak in ka lungtang a kikou a; a mi hoihte uh Zoar leh Eglath shelishijah khuate ah a tai ua: Luhith tou ah kap kawm in a paitou ua; Horonaim lampi ah siatna kikou in a kikou khia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimrim tuite hihsiat a om ding ahi: loupa a vuaikhinta; loupa selnoute a vuai a, thilhing a omta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in, a sum neihsunte uleh a koih hoihte uh Muisum Lui gal a kai mang pih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kikou husa Moab gamgi kim ah a thang ngal a; a mau tuaituai husa Eglaim khua a tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dimon tuite sisan in a dim vek ngal a: Dimon tung ah thil thupi sem tungsak ding ka hi, Moabte lak a taikhiate tung ah leh, huai gam a omsunte tung ah humpinelkai ka tungsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gam vaihawmmi ading in belamnoute Sela khua gamdai a om a kipan in Zion tanu tang ah khak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in, Moab tanute vasa a bu a kipan dalh a lengleng bang in Arnon lui kainate ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thu honhilh inla, vai hon hawmsak in: na lim sunlai in zan bang in bawl inla; delhkhiakte sel in; taimangte mansak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab lak a mi delhkhiak a omte na kiang ah om uhen; amau ading in hihsemi mel a kipan bukna mun hi hen: lepgumi lah bangmahlou a bawl in a omta ngal a, hihsiatna a daita a, nuaisiahnate gam a kipan a hih manthat in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in mangtutphah hehpihna a hihkip in a om ding a, huai tung ah, David puanin ah, mi khat, vaihawm in, vaihawmna diktat zong in, thil diktat kintak a hihpah in, chihtaktak in a tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moabte kisaktheihna thu, a kisathei mahmah uh chih, ka za ua: a suahngal dan uleh, a kisaktheih dan uleh, a hehdanthu uh; a kiawtsaknate uh bangmah ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in Moab tung ah Moab a mau tuaituai ding ua, michih a mau tuaituai ding uh: Kir hareseth grep beu khase tuntun in na kah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Heshbon loute lah a tulkhinta a, Sibmah grepgui toh: namchih Kumpipate’n a kung hoih tata a kitansak phengphung ua: Jazer khaw tanpha in a zam ua, gamdai ah a zamlut ua; a hiangte a zamdalh sengsung ua, tuipi ah a zam galkahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in Sibmah grepgui Jazer kah in ka kah ding a: Heshbon leh Elealeh aw, ka khitui in ka hon buak ding: na nipi gahte tung leh na buh tung ah kisual kikou husa a keta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kipahna laksak in a omta, lou hoihtak a kipan in leng nopna laksak in a omta a; grephuan ah lasak himhim a omta kei ding a, husa noptuak himhim leng a omnawn sam kei ding: grep sukna khukte ah chil a sukmi himhim in uain a chilkhe takei ding uh; grep la a kikou ka daisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka gilte lah Moab hehpihna in pekging bang in a ging a, ka gilsung lah Kir hareseth hehpihna in pekging bang in a ginglai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in, hichi ahi ding a, Moab a kilat chiang in mun sang a kihihgim a, thum ding a a Mun Siangthou a a hongpai chiang in a vuaksuak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaite Moab tungthu Toupa’n tuma a a gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin bel Toupa’n , kilohmi kum sim a kum thum sung in Moab, thupina, a mipi thupitakte nasan in, muhsithuai a omsak in a om ding a; a omsunte tawmchik mahmah, gen thamlouh ahi ding uh, chi’n a genta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Damaska khaw puak gik, Ngai in, Damaska khopi hi nawnlou ding a lakmang ahita, huchi in inn chimsia koihkhawm lel ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aroer khote taisan in a omta; belamhonte omna ding ahimai ding, huaite lah a om ngei ding ua, kuamah in a lausak kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ephraim a kipan kulhpi a mang ding a, Damaska a kipan gam a mang ding, Suria gam a omsunte leng a mang ding uh; Israel suante thupina banglel in a om ding uh, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, Jakob thupina hihgawn in a om ding a, a sa thauna leng a hong gawngta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in buh lapan buh a lak a, a vuite a lak bang mai ahi ding a, ahi, Rephaim guam ah min buh maihkhakte a tom bang mai uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh, olive singgah lohkhit a a zikpi dawn a gah nih hiam thum hiam omlai bang leh, singgah hiang hoih li hiam nga hiam a omsek bang in, maihkhak top ding a omlai ding, Toupa Pathian in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in min a Bawlpa uh lam a enta ding ua, a mitte un Israelte Mi Siangthou a zahtakta ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maitam, amau khutsuakte lam a en nawnta kei ding ua, amau khut a bawl Asherim hiam, gimlim maitamte hiam a zahtak nawnta kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in a khopi kiptakte uh gammang leh tang vum a mun taisan sa, Israel suante ma a a taisansa bang uh, ahi ding; huchi in munloih ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang hon hondampa Pathian na mangngilh a, na hatna Suangpi lah na theigige kei hi; huaiziak in singkung kilawm taktakte na suan ding a, asung ah hiang tuamte na vut paisuak ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na suan ni’n na khang sak a, zingsang in thil chil ah na paksak a; himahleh gahloh lah lungngaihna leh natna thupitak ni’n a mang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A! mipi tampi ging zuazua, tuipite ging zuazua bang a ging zuazuate leh namchih ging hawhaw, tui thupitakte ging hawhaw bang a ging hawhawte na tung uh a gik hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Namchih lah tuipi tampi ging hawhaw bang in a ging hawhaw ding ua; himahleh aman a taihilh ding a, huchi in gamlapi ah a taimang ding ua, tang a buhsi huih mut bang leh leivui huihpi mut leng lunglung bang in delh in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nitaklam in, ngai in, thil mulkimhuaitak a om a; huan, khovak ma in lah a om nawn kei uh. Huai gallak a hon laksak mite tan ahi a, hon guksak mite tuam leng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ethiopia gam khen a luigal a om, a khazap ging hawhaw gam tung a gik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuipi ah, tui tung a tolh longte ah palaite sawlpa! Misawl hattakte aw, nam sang zehzoh mam hethot kiang ah, a pawt tung ua kipan tutan a mi kihtakhuai takte kiang ah, hoh un; nam in gam a hawm ua, a palpuk uhi, a gam uh luite’n a hawmzak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khovel a om tengteng leh lei a tengte aw, tangte a chiamtehna a takkhiak chiang un en un; pengkul a mut chiang un ngaikhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah hichi in a chi hi, Ka om kinken ding a, ka omna ah ka en gige ding a; nisatlai a kholum huthut bang leh buhlak kholum lai a daitui mei bang in, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Grep loh hun ma a, a pak a bei a, a pak grep puam a a hongom chiang in, a hiang noute theikung attanna temta in a attan sin ngal a, a hiang zam dalhte a lamang in a sattan lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaite tang a vasa sa ne chite ading in, lei a sate ading in nutsiat in a om ding uh; huchi in vasa sa ne chite’n amaute nipi sung in a ne ding ua, lei a sa tengteng in phalbi sung in a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in, sepaihte Toupa min omna mun, Zion tang ah, sepaihte Toupa kiang a piak ding in mi sang zehzoh nam, mam pekpokte’n, kipahman a hontawi ding ua; nam a hih ua kipan kihtakhuai tak leh pautuam nei ahi uhi. Huai nam in gam a hawmzel ua, a palpuk behlap lai ua, a gam ulah luite’n a hawmzak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta gam puakgik, Ngai in, Toupa meipi hattak tung a tuang in, Aigupta gam a hongtungta, Aigupta gam milimte a ma ah a ling vonvon ding ua, Aiguptate lungtang lah asung uah a zulmang mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aigupta mite Aigupta mite mah sual ding in ka tokthou ding a; huchi in michih in amau unau sual in michih in amau invengte sual in, a kidou ding uh; khua leh khua a kidou ding ua, gam leh gam a kidou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in, Aiguptate kha asung uah bangmahlou a bawl in a om ding a; a thusawm uh ka hihse ding; huchi in, milimte leh, bumsiamte thu a dong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta mite heutu tatsetak khut ah ka pekhe ding a; huchi in kumpipa hangsan in a tung uah vai a hawmta ding, Toupa , sepaihte Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi tuite a kang ding ua, luite luang mang in a kangtatta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Luite a namsia ua; Aigupta gam tuiluangte a kiam hiaihiai ding ua, a kangtat ding a; phailuangte leh tui loupate a vuai khin ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nile lui kiang a Nile lui gei mahmah a, gantatna pawnte leh, Nile lui kiang a thil chin tengtengte a hong keu vek ding a, taihmang in a om ding a, a om nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngamanmite leng a kap ding ua, Nile lui a ngakuai khaimi tengteng in a awm uh a kitum ding ua, tui a lenpi zakte a thadahgawpta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huailou in leng jija hiahsiang khoih mite leh puanngou gan mite a zahlak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A suangkhuamte hihzan in a om ding a, kilohmite a lungsim un a lungkham ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zoan khua a miliante a hai ding ua, Pharo mi pil pente lemtheihna sa lemtheihna banglel a hong hita: Pharo kiang ah, mi pil tapa, nidanglai kumpipate tapa ka hi, bangchidan a chi sek na hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mipilte koi a om ahi ua? Amau honhilh pah ngal uhen; Aigupta gam tung a thil tung ding, sepaihte Toupa sehte, thei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zoan khua a miliante mihai a hong hita ua, Noph khua a miliante khem in a omta uh; Aigupta namte ning a suangte’n Aiguptate a vakmang sakta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n Aiguptate lak ah phengphitna kha a omsakta; huchi in zukham mi a luak a a hoi doidoi bang in Aiguptate a nasep chiteng uah a paikawi sakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aiguptate ading in lutang in hiam, mei in hiam, tumnah hiang in hiam, pumpeng in hiam a sepsak theih a om nawnta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Aigupta numeite bang ahi ding ua: Sepaihte Toupa khut sin a tung ua a kisin ziak in a ling un a lau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah gam a omte Aiguptate ading in mulkimhuaitak a hong hita ding ua, a min uh a lohna peuh uah a kihta ding ua, amau tung a tung ding sepaihte Toupa thuseh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Kanante pau a pau leh, sepaihte Toupa kiang ah kichiamna thuchiam sekte, Aigupta gamsung ah khaw nga a om ding a: khat tuh Ni Khopi a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Aigupta laitak ah Toupa ading in maitam a om ding a, a gamgi ah Toupa ading in suangphuh a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai Aigupta gam a sepaihte Toupa ading in chiamtehna leh theihna ahi ding: nuaisiahte ziak in Toupa a sam ding uhi, huchi in aman hondampa leh humbitpa a sawl ding a, aman amaute a honkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa tuh Aiguptate theih ahita ding a, Aigupta mite’n huai ni chiang in Toupa a theita ding uh: ahi, kithoihna leh thilpiak in a be ding ua, Toupa kiang ah thu a chiam ding ua, a tangtun lai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Aiguptate a vaw ding a, a vaw ding a, a hihdam lai ding; huchi in Toupa kiang ah a kiknawn ding ua, aman a ngetnate za in amaute a hihdam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Aigupta gam a kipan in Assuria gam pha in lamlian a om ding a; huchi in Assuria mite Aigupta gam ah a hoh ding uh; Aigupta leng Assuria gam ah a hoh ding uh. Aigupta mite’n Assuria mite toh Pathian a be khawmta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Israelte Aiguptate leh Assuriate toh a thumna ahi ding ua, lei laizang tak ah vualzawlna ahi ding uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n , ka mi Aiguptate leh ka khut suak Assuriate leh ka goutan Israelte vualzawl in om uhen, chi in, a vualzawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa Sargon sawl Tartan Ashdod khua ah a hong a, Ashdod khua a sual a, a lak kum in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n Amoz tapa Isai kam in, “Kuan inla, na kawng a saiip puan phel inla, na khe a na khedap koih in” chi in, a gen hi. Huchi in, huchibang in a hih a, vuaktang leh khevuak in a paipai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n , “Ka sikha Isai Aiguptate tung ah leh Ethiopiate tung ah chiamtehna leh thillamdang ding a kum thum sung a vuaktang leh khevuak a a pai bang in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa’n Aigupta matte leh Ethiopia salte, a neu a lian in, vuaktang leh khevuak in leh taw dawk in Aiguptate zahlakna ding in a pimang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in, a lamet pen uh Ethiopiate leh a thupina pen uh Aiguptate ziak in mangbang tak leh zahlaktak in a omta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, huai ni chiang in hiai tuipi gei a mi in, ‘Ngai in, i lamet pen, Assuria kumpipa lak a hon humbit ding a, a hon panpihpa ding a i taina ulah hichi ahita a eite bangchi’n i suakta ding ua? a chi ding uh,’ ” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuipi gamdai puakgik, Sim gam a pingpei a paisuak bang in gamdai a kipan in, gam lauhuaipi a kipan in a honghi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kilakna thu khauhtak ka kiang ah theihsak ahita; lepchiahtak a hihmi in lepchiahtak in a hih a, lokmi in a lok hi, Elamte aw, paitou un, Mediate aw, um un; a thumna tengteng uh ka daisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka kawng natna thupitak in a dim a, numei nauvei natna bang a natna in a hon manta; bil a za theilou khop in na ka thuak a; khaw mutheilou khop in ka mangbang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lungtang a ha huaihuai a, thil mulkimhuai tak in a hon hihlau a; nitak ninem ka ngaklah sek kei ding in linna a hongsuakta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dohkan a bawlkhol ua, galvengmi a vengsak ua, a ne ua, a dawn ua; mi liante aw, thou unla, lum thau nuh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah huchi in a gen hi, Kuan inla, galvengmi vengsak in, aman a thilmuh gen hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sepaih a pawlte, sakol tungtuang a kopkop a paite sabiltung pawlte, sangawngsau pawlte, a muh chiang in pilvangtak in a ngaikhe kilkel ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan, amah humpinelkai bang in a kikou a; Toupa aw, sun in galven buk tung ah ka ding a, zan khua in ka venna ah n’on omsak gige a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai in, hiai lai ah mihing pawl, sakol tungtuang a kopkop a pai a hong uh, chi in. Amahmah in Babulon khua a pukta, a pukta, a milim pathian bawltawmte tengteng uh lei ah hihzan in a omta, chi in, a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw ka buh vuaksa, ka phual a buh; sepaihte Toupa , Israelte Pathian a kipan a ka zak na kiang ua pulak ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dumah puak gik. Min Seir tang a kipan in a honsam ua, “Galvengpa zan bangchi ahita a? Galvengpa, zan bangchi ahita a?” chi in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Galvengpa’n, “Zingsang hi ding ahita, zan leng; na dot nop uleh dong un; kihei nawn unla, hongpai un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Arabia gam tung a puakgik, Dedante khualzin pawlchihte aw, Arabia gam a gamnuai ah na giak ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dangtak kiang ah tui a hontawi ding ua, Tema gam a omte’n a an un taimangte a na dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amau lah namsaute a kipan, namsau dohsa a kipan leh, thalpeu laisa a kipan leh, kidouna thupitak a kipan a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa’n lah huchi in ka kiang ah a chi ngal a, Kilohmi kumsim a kum khat sung in Kedarte thupina tengteng a mangkhin ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thalkapmi, Kedar suante lak a mi hattak omsunte, tawmchik ahi ding uh; Toupa Israelte Pathian in, huai a genta hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kilanna guam puak gik, Bang na chi ua a mai, in tung a na kal touh vek uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw kikou husa a dim, khopi chiak vengvung, khaw kipaktak, na sung a a thahte uh namsau a thah ahi kei ua, kidouna a si leng ahi sam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na vaihawmmi tengteng a taimang chiat ua, thalkap mite gak in a om ua, gamlapi a kipan a hong taimangte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaiziak in ken, hon enlou in lehlam en un, nakpi’n ka kap ding; ka mite tanu gallak a a lak thu uah hon nem vanglak dah un, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa , sepaihte Toupa a kipan in kilakna guam ah buaina leh sikdenna leh mangbatna ni lah ahi ngal a; kulhpi bang hihsiatna leh tangte sapna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, Elamte’n thalbawm a tawi ua, mihing tuanna kangtalaite leh sakol tungtuangmite toh; Kirte’n lum tuamna lah a phel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, na guam hoihpente lah kangtalai in a dimta a, sakol tungtuangmite lah kulh kongkhak bul ah a kiphu noinoi uh. Huan, Judahte khuhna a lamang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judahte khuhna a la mangta. Huchi in huai ni’n gammang inn a galthuamna lam na enta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David khopi kulhpi siatnate leng na en ua, a tam chih na thei uh: huchi in dil khangnung zaw tuite na luangkhawm sak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem innte na sim ua, kulhpi bang bawlhoihna ding in innte na phel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dil lui tui omna ding in kulhpi nih kikal ah tuichin khawmna na bawl ua; himahleh huai hihmi lam na en kei ua, nidanglai a a na bawlpa na limsak hetkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai ni’n Toupa , sepaihte Toupa’n , kap ding leh awm kitum ding leh lugiau sak ding leh saiip puan teng ding in a sam a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh, ngai in, nuamna leh kipahnate, bawng thahna leh belam thahnate, sa nekna leh uain dawnnate a om zawta a, ne ni, dawn ni, zingchiang a si ding i hi ngal ua, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in sepaihte Toupa tuh ka bil ah a kilak a, Pellou in hiai khelhna na sih masiah uh na lak uah silsiang ahita kei ding, Toupa , sepaihte Toupa’n a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa , sepaihte Toupa’n , hichi in a chi, Kuan inla, hiai sumkempa kiang ah, Shebna, inn tung a heutu a om kiang ngeingei ah, hoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kiang ah huchi in gen in, Hiai a bang hih na hia? Hiai ah kua na nei a, han hiai a na khuak vial? Amah ading in sangpi a a han a khuak a, amah ading a suangpi a omna a bawl vial!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa’n nang a paih in a honpai ek ding, mi hat in a paih bang in; ahi, a tun in nang a hontun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pellou in aman nang lum bang in a honpei ding a, gam zapi ah a honvawk lut ding: huai ah na si ding a, huailai mah ah, nang, na pu inn sung zahlaksakpa, na thupina kangtalaite a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na nasepna a kipan k’on delhkhe ding a, aman heutu na hihna a kipan a honkai khesuk ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai ni’n hichi ahi ding a, ka sikha Eliakim, Hilkiah tapa, ka sam ding a; amah na puanaktual ka silh sak ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na kawnggak in ka hihhat ding a, na vaihawmna amah khut ah ka kem sak ding: Huchi in Jerusalem a omte adin leh Judah inkuanpihte ading in pa ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan, David inkuanpihte tahbi a liangzang ah ka koih ding a: aman a hong ding a, kuamah in a khak kei ding uh: a khak ding a, kuamah in a hong kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah kilhna mun kiptak a a kilh ngiungeu bang un, ka hihkip ngiungeu ding a: huchi in amah a pa inkuanpihte ading in mangtutphah thupi mahmah a ding ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah ah a pa inkuanpihte thupina tengteng a bang vek ding ua, a tate leh a suante, tuium-belsuan neu chiteng, belhbu tuium-belsuan a kipan tui koihna tuium-belsuan tengteng tan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huai ni’n, kilhna, mun kiptak a kilh ngiungeu a om in a nangzou kei ding a; satkhiak a om in, a keta ding a, a tung a thil gik om lah hih manthat in a omta ding a; Toupa’n huai lah a genta ngal a, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tura khaw puakgik. Tarsish long liante aw, mau tuaituai un; innte omlou khop leh lutna ding omlou khop a hihsiat in a omta hi; huai lah Kittim gam a kipan in a kiang ua hihlat in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuikulh a omte aw, dai sipsip un; Sidon khaw sumsin tuipi a paite’n a hon kiningchin sak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihor apan buhchi tuipite tung ah honpua a, Nile lui a buh, a punna hi a, namchih sumsinna mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sidon aw, zum in; tuipi kulhpi in, thu a genta ngal a, “Nau ka vei ngeikei a, ka nei ngei sam kei, tangval lah ka vak ngei sam kei a, nungak leng ka khanglian sak ngei sam kei hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuthang Aigupta gam a tun hun chiang in Tura thuthang a nak vei mahmah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tarsish ah va hoh unla; Tuikulha omte aw, mau tuaituai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiai maw na khaw kipak uh, a upat a upa, a khe in gamlapi a om ding a a pi sek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lallukhu khusaktu khua Tura tung ah kuan ahia hiai tung ding a sep? Huailai a sumsinmite lah miliante ahi ua, huailai a sumsinmite lah lei a mi zahtakhuaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n , thupina tengteng kisaktheihna nawngkai sak ding leh, lei a mi zahtakhuai tengteng muhsithuai a omsak ding in, a sep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tarsish tanu aw, Nile lui bang in na gam ah luang let in; na kawnggakna himhim lah a omta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuipi tung ah a khut a zak a, gamte a lingsak a; Toupa’n Kanaan gam tungtang ah thu a pia a, a kulhte hihse ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman, “Sidon tanu nungak aw, mi nuaisiah, nuam na sa nawn kei ding; thou inla, Kittim gam ah galkah in; huai ah leng khawlna himhim na mu tuankei ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En in, Kaldaite gam; hiai mite a omta kei uh; Assuria mi in gamdai a gamsate ading in a septa hi; a insangte uh a lam ua, huai a inpite a hihmang ua, in sia in a bawlta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tarsish longpite aw, mau tuaituai un; na kulhte uh hihsiat in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai ni’n hichi ahi ding a, Tura khua, kumpipa khat kum sim a, kum sawmsagih sung mangngilh in a om ding; kum sawmsagih beinung in kizuak la a a gen bang un Tura khaw tung ah a hongtung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang kizuak mite mangngilhsa nung, kaihging la inla, khaw kim ah vak in, kaihging kai inla, theih a na om nawn theihna ding in la tampi sa in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, kum sawmsagih a beinung in hichi ahi ding a, Toupa’n Tura khua a pha ding a, huchi in huai minu a loh delh in a om nawn ding a, leitung a khovel gam tengteng lak ah kizuak in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sum muhkhiak leh a loh Toupa ading in thil siangthou ahi ding; huailah kholkhawm in hiam, koihkhawm in hiam a omkei ding a, a sum muhkhiak Toupa ma a omte ading in ahi ding a, niang leh tai a a nekding uleh, puansilh thupitak a neih theihna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa’n lei a awngsak in, a sesak ding a, a lumlet ding a, a omte a dalhsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan, vantang tung a om bang in siampu tung ah leng a om ding; sikhapa tung a a om bang in a pu tung ah leng a om ding; sikhanu tung a om bang in a pi tung ah leng a om ding; a leimi tung a a om bang in, a khawngmi tung ah leng a om ding; leitawisakmi tung a a om bang in, leitawimi tung ah leng a om ding; a pung delh a leitawisakmi tung a a om bang in, a kiang a a pung pemi tung ah leng a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lei lah awnsak keuhkeuh in leh hihsiat dimdem in a om ding; Toupa’n a chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lei lah a kap in a tul a khovel lah bah in a tul a, lei a mi tungnungte a bah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lei lah a ommite nuai ah a buahkhinta; dante ah a talek ua, thuseh lah a hihlamdang ua, tangtawn thukhuna a tatlek ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in hamsiat in lei a nekhina, a ommite lah siam louh tansakin a omta uh: huaiziak in lei a ommite lah a kanglum ua, mi tawmchik kia a omlai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uain thak lah a kap a, grepgui lah a bah a, lungtang nuamte tengteng a mau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuangtate kipahna lah a dai a, kaihging nuamsa ging lah a daita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lasa kawm in uain a dawn kei ding uh: zu lah a dawnmite ading in a kha mahmah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Buaina khopi chipsak in a omta: kuamah a lut louhna ding un in chih khak in a omta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uain ziak in kongzingte ah kap husa a om a: nuamna tengteng mialsak in a om a, hiai gam nopna a mangta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khopi ah siatna nutsiat in a om a, a kulh kongkhak vuak siat in a omta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lei laitak ah michih lak ah huchi in a om ding hi, olive sing vuak nung a gah a omlai bang in leh, grep loh nung a grep maih loh ding a omlai bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaite’n a aw uh a suah ding ua, a kikou ding uh; Toupa thupina ziak in tuipi a kipan in ngaihtak in a kikou ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa tuh Suahlam ah pahtawi un. Toupa , Israelte Pathian min mahmah, tuipi tuikulh gamte ah pahtawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kawlmong tawp a lasak i za, Mi diktatte kiang ah thupina om hen, chih la. Himahleh, ken bel, Ka gawng huaihuai a, ka gawng huaihuai a, ka tung gik hi! Lepchiahtak a gamtamite’n lepchiahtak in a hih ua; ahi, lepchiahtak a gamtamite’n lepchiahtak in a hih uhi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lei a om aw, lauhuainate, kawkhukte, thangte na tung ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in hichi ahi ding a, lauhuai husa a kipan a taipa kawkhuk ah a ke ding a; kawkhuk sung a kipan a pawt khetou mi thang ah a awk ding; tunglam a tohlette lah hon in a om ngal a, lei kingaknate lah a ling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lei lah a kitam gawpvek a, lei lah hihman in a omvek a, lei lah nakpitak in a ling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lei lah mi zukham bang in a hoi dongdong ding a, bawkta hawt bang in a kihot ding; a tatlekna lah a tung ah giktak in a om ding a, huchi in a puk ding a, a thou nawnta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan, huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, Toupa’n tunglam a mi tungnung pawl lian pipite a gawt ding, lei a lei kumpipate toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hentate kawkhuk a pikhawm a a om bang un huaite pikhawm in a om ding ua, suangkulh a khum in a om ding uh, ni sawttak nung in gawt in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in tung a kha zumtakin a om ding a, tung a ni zahlaktak in a om ding; sepaihte Toupa lah Zion tang leh Jerusalem khua ah leh, a upate ma ah, thupitak a kumpi a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang ka Pathian na hi a; k’on pahtawi ding, na min ka phat ding; thillamdang tak, nidanglai a vaihawmte, ginomtak leh thutak in na hih ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khopite lei vum in na suaksak a; a kulhte uh leng na hihsia hi; gamdang mite kumpipa in leng khua lou in na bawl ngal a; chik chiang mah a lam in a om nawnta kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in mi hat mahmahte’n a hon pahtawi ding ua, nam kihtakhuai mahmah khopi in a honkihta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi kihtakhuaite hu huihpi in bang a sawn okok lai bang a a hongom chiang in, nang zaw mi genthei ading in bukna, tagah mangbang lai ading in bukna, huihpi lak a kihumbitna, nisa liahna na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mun keu a khaw lum na daisak zel bang in, gamdang mite husa na daisak hi; kholum meiliah a daihsak a a om bang in, mi lauhuaite thom daihsak ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan, hiai tang ah sepaihte Toupa’n michih ading in thil thaute, uainte a te toh kidiah, thil thau mahmah guhngek a dim, uainte a te toh kidiah hoihtak a khit siang in Ankuang a lui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan, khuhna mi tengteng tung a khiak, puanzak nam tengteng tung a zak hiai tang ah a hihse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sihna a valh denta; Toupa Pathian in mi tengteng mai a kipan khitui a nulsiang ding a; a mite min siatna lah leitung luah tengteng a kipan in a lamang ding: Toupa’n huai a chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai ni’n, Ngai un, hiai i Pathian ahi; amah i ngakngak ua, huchi in a hon hondam ding: hiai Toupa ahi; amah i ngakngak ua; a hotdamna ah i kipak in i nuam ding uh, a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai tang ah Toupa khut a kinga ding a, Moab, buhpawl ek kua a sikden a a om sek bang in, amah mun ah sikden a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in tuiliaumi in tuiliau ding a a khuat bang in, huai lak ah a khut a zakkhe ding a: a kisaktheihna lah a khut lepchiahna toh in Toupa’n a koihniam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, na kulh bangte insang kulhpi hihchim in, a koihniam a, lei ah, leivui pha hial in a puksakta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Judahte gam ah hiai la a sa ding uh. Khopi kiptak i nei ua: aman hotdamna kulh bangte leh kulhpite a ding in a sep ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nam diktat thutak zui nam a lut theihna ding in kulh kongkhakte hong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na tung a lungsimnga mi, nangmah a honmuan ziak in, muanna kim in na kem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa tangtawn in muang un: Toupa , Jehovah ah lah tangtawn suangpi a om ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman sangpi a omte a hihniam a khopi sangpi mah: a koih niam a, lei pha in a koih niam a, leivui pha hial in a puksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khe in a sikden ding; gentheite khe leh tagahte kalsuan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi diktat lampi lah dikna ahi a; nang lungtang diktat pu in mi diktat lampi na hihmam sek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi, Toupa aw, na vaihawmna lampi ah k’on ngak uhi: kou hinna deih zaw na min loh leh nangmah theihgigena ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zan chiang in ka hinna in nangmah a hon ngai a; ahi, zingkhang in ka sung a ka kha om in ka honzong ding hi: na vaihawmnate lei a a hongom chiang in khovel a omte’n diktatna lah a sin zel ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi thulimlou deihsak in om mahleh, diktatna a sin tuansam kei ding: dikna gam ah diklou tak in a hih ding hi. Toupa thupina a mu tuankei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa , na khut lah zak in a om a, himahleh amau a mu tuankei ua: himahleh mite adia na phatuamngaihna a mu ding ua, a zumta ding uh; ahi, nang hondoute mei in a kangmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa nang lemna n’on sehsak ding: nang ka nasep tengteng uh n’on sepsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian uh aw, nang kia hilou in kumpipa dangte’n leng ka tung uah thu a neikhinta ua, himahleh nangmah mah panpih in na min ka louta ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amau lah a sita uh a, a hing nawn kei ding uh; a mangta ua, a thou nawn kei ding uh; huaiziak in nang amau gawt in na hihsia a, a theihgigena teng uleng na hihmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiai nam na pungsakta a, Toupa aw, hiai nam na pungsak a: nang pahtawi in na omta: hiai gam a gamgite na hihlian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa , a dahlai un a honzong ua, a mau na thunun chiang in a thum zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Numei naupai, neih hun naita bang in; Toupa aw, kou na ma ah ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nau ka pai ua, ka na ua, huih banglel ka nei uh; lei ah lah tatkhiakna lam himhim ka ngahkei ua; khovel a omte lah a puksam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na misite a hing nawn ding ua; ka mi luangte a thou nawn ding uh. Leivui a omte aw, halh unla, nuamtak in lasa un: na daituite khovak daitui bang ahi a, lei in misite a paikhe ding hi, chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kisa un, ka mite aw, na dantan sungte ah lut unla, na kongkhakte uh kikhak khum un: lunghihlouhna a ven masiah mitphiatkal lel leng bu un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngai un, Toupa , a gitlouhna ziak ua lei a omte gawt ding in a omna a kipan a hong pawtkhe ding hi: lei mah in a sisan a hihlang ding a, a mi a thahte uh a khuhta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Toupa’n , a namsau hoihtak a hiam, lianpi, muanhuaitak in, leviathan gulpi hattak leh leviathan gulpi kivial ngeingoi a gawt ding a, tuipi a dragon om leng a that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in: Uain grephuan khat, huai pahtawi in lasa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei Toupa lah a vengpa ka hi a; mitphiatkal teng in tui ka buak ding a, kuamah in a khoihlouh ding un sun leh zan in ka veng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei ah hehna a omkei hi: loulingnei leh khaulingneite’n hondou in honsual le u aw! Amau sual din ka kuan ding a, mun khat ah ka halkhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihkeileh, hon kileppihna ding in ka hatna len hen: ahi, hon kileppih hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hun hontung ding ah Jakobte’n zung a kha ding ua; Israelte’n zung a kha ding ua; Israelte a mum un a pak ding uh: huchi in leitung gah in a dimsak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah vawte a vuak bang in amah a vaw sam ahia? Ahihkeileh, amah thahte thahna bang in amah thah in a om hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah na paimangsak lai in a hunlel in amah na sel a: suahlam huihnun ni’n a hu thupitak in amah a mutlengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in hiai in Jakobte thulimlouhna silsiang ahi ding a, hiai a khelhna uh pai mangpihna gah ngen ahi: Asherim hiam, gimlim maitamte hiam ding nawnlou ding khop in maitam suang tengteng suangpak den khap bang in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khua kulhpi nei lah a lungzuang a, omna nutsiat leh paisan, gamdai bang ahi: huai ah bawngnou a ta ding a, huailai mah ah a kual ding a, a selte a ne ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hiangte lah a vuai chiang un khiah in a om ding a; numeite a hongpai ding ua a hal ding uh: amau lah theihtheihna himhim neilou mi ahi ngal ua: huaiziak in amau bawlpa’n amaute a hehpih kei ding a, amaute sutuahpan amaute deihsakna himhim a neikei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai ni’n hichi ahi ding a, Toupa’n , Lui a kuang dim a luang zoizoi a kipan in, Aigupta luita pha in, a gah a satkhe ding a, huchi in, Israel suante aw, khatkhat a pikhawm in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai ni’n hichi ahi ding a, pengkul lianpi a mut ding ua: Assuria gam a mangthang dekdekte leh, Aigupta gam a delhkhiak a omte a hongpai ding ua: Jerusalem khua a tang siangthou ah Toupa a be ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraimte zukhamhatte kisaktheihna lallukhu tung leh, a kilawmna uh thupi pak tullel laitak, uain thazoh a omte guam hausa tak lutang tung a om a tung a gik hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa’n mi hat thilhihtheitak a nei a: aman, gial thupitak ke phuakphuak, huihpi thil hihse lemlum bang leh, tuilian thupi let zuazua bang mai in, lei ah a pai ek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ephraimte zu khamhatte kisaktheihna lallukhu lah sikden in a om ding a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kilawmna uh thupi paktul laitak, guam hausatak lutang tung a om, nipi ma a theipi min masapen, a en mi in a muh a, a khut a a omtak a a nekkhit sek bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in sepaihte Toupa tuh, thupina lallukhu leh, kilawmna lukhute, a mi omsunte ading in ahi ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaihawm ding a tu ading in vaihawmna khate, kulh kongkhak bul a hon sualte nangkikmite ading in hatna ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh huaite leng uain ziak in a kipekpek ua, zu ziak in a hoihoi ua: siampute leh zawlneite leng zu ziak in a kipekpek ua, uain valhkhit in a om ua, zu ziak in a hoihoi ua: kilakna thute ah a kipekpek ua, vaihawmna thu ah a hoihoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mun siang mahmah omlou khop in dohkan tengteng lah luak leh thilnin in a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman theihna lam a kua ahia a sinsak ding? Thukhah leng aman kua ahia a theihsak sin laitei? Nawinek tawptungte leh nawi neksak nawnlouhte ahi ding uam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuzohna thu tung a thuzohna thu chian touh, thuzohna thu tung a thuzohna thu chian touh: dan tung a dan chian touh, dan tung a dan chian touh: hiai ah tawmchik, huai ah tawmchik chih ngenta a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi, muk lamdang pumi zang in, pau tuam in hiai mite kiang ah thu a gen zawta ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai lah khawlna ahi a, tawlte khawlsak un: hiai lah kihihhalhna ahi, a chihte: himahleh amau a ngaikhe nuam kei ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in, a pai ua, a thal a a puk ua, a kitap gawp ua, thang a a awk ua, mat a a om theihna ding un, Toupa thu amaute ading in, thuzohna thu tung a thuzohna thu chian touh, thuzohna thu tung a thuzohna thu chian touh, dan tung a dan chian touh: dan tung a dan chian touh; hiai ah tawmchik huai ah tawmchik chih ngen a ahi mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in, mi muhsithatte aw, hiai mite, Jerusalem khua a omte, vaihawmsakte aw, Toupa thu za un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sihna toh thu i khungta, Sheol ah thu i kichiamta; vuakna tuilian a luansuak hun chiang in leipha in zaw a luang kei ding; zuauthute i kihumbitna ding in i zang ua, zuau nuai ah lah i buta ngal ua, na chih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi ding; Ngai in, suang, suang ettelsa, a kil a suang manphatak phum kip mahmah, Zion ah suangphum ding in ka lem hi; a gingtami zaw a kin kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaihawmna diktat a tansakna khau ding in ka zang ding a, diktatna lah a ulum khai ding in ka zang ding a, gial in kihumbitna zuau thute a phiatmang vek ding a, tuite’n lah bukna a tum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan, sihna toh na thu khun uh a kiphel ding a, Sheol toh na chiam uleng a piching kei ding, vuakna tuilian a luan suak hun chiang in. Huai hun chiang in a sik den in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A luan suak peuhmah chiang in nou a hon lazel ding; a zingsang a zingsang in, sun leh zan in, a luang suak sin ngal a; thukhah omdan theihsiam lah thil mulkimhuai ngen ahi ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lupna lah khekhuanna ding in a tom lozen a, puan thuah lah lukhuhna ding in a neu lua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A nasep, a nasep lamdang a sep theihna ding leh, a thilhih, a thilhih lamdang a zuih theihna ding in, Toupa Perazim tang a a thou bang in a thou sin ngal a, Gibeon guam a a heh bang in a heh sin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in mi muhsit chingte hi nawn kei un, huchilou in zaw na kolbutte uh muanhuaitak in a bawl kha ding uh; tawpna, tawpna tung ngei ding a seh, lei pumpi tung a a tunsak ding. Toupa , sepaihte Toupa a kipan in ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bildoh unla, ka aw za un; ngaikhia unla, ka thugen za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leiletmi in chi thehna ding in lei tatlaklou in a let ngei ahia? A lei khalte tatlaklou in a khenkham in a hihzan ngei ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A tung a tohtam khit in mohurite a thehdalh ka hia? Zirate leng a theh ka hia? Buhte a vual in, huitbuhte leng a mun sehsa ah, vaibuhte leng a nawlzul ah a tuh sek ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A Pathian in lah amah diktak in a thuzoh in a sinsak ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mohuri lah buh chilna khawl in a chil ngei ngal kei ua, zira tung ah leng kangtalai khe a tuksak ngeikei uh; mohuri zaw chiang in a khen ua, zira bel khetbuk in a khen zaw sek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tanghou bawlna buh gawizan in a om a, aman tangtawn in a vaw kei ding a, a kangtalai khe leh a sakolte’n dalhsak mahleh, a gawizan sak ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huaite leng sepaihte Toupa , lemtheihna a mi lamdang mahmah leh pilna a mi hoih mahmah a kipan a pawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ariel, Ariel, David puanin kaihna mun! kum ah kum gawm inla; ankuangluinate hongtung nawn hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in Ariel ka lungzing sak ding a, huchi in sunna leh kahna a om ding; huan amah kei ading in Ariel bang ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, nangmah sual tum in na kim ah k’on giahkhum ding a, nangmah sual ding in umsuakna insangte ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in, puksak in na om ding a, leinuai a kipan in thu na gen ding a, na aw lah leivui lak ah awlawl in a gingkhe ding; na aw dawi aisansiam zawl aw bang in leinuai a kipan in a pawt ding hi, na pau leivui lak a kipan in a hongpawt siausiau ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh nang hondou mipite zaw leivui nel mahmah bang in a om ding uh, mi kihtakhuai mipite leng buhsi mangthang sekte bang in a om ding uh; ahi, huai mitphiatkal lou in a hongom guih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vangingte, zinlingte, ging thupi mahmahte, pingpeite, huihpite, hulmang thei mei in amah sepaihte Toupa gawt in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Ariel dou nam tengteng mipite, amah leh a insang sualmi tengteng leh amah hih lungzingte tengteng, ihmu mang banglel ahi ding uh, zan a kilakna banglel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi gilkial in mang a neih in an a ne a, himahleh a khanglou a a bahlai in tui a duhlai bang ahi ding hi; Zion tang sual, nam leh mipite, huai bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ding kinken unla, lamdang sa un, kituam unla, mittaw in om un; a kham ua, himahleh uain ziak ahi kei; a hoihoi ua, himahleh zu ziak ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n ihmut limna kha na tung uah a sungbua a, zawlneite na mit uh a mitsi sak a, na lu uh, mutheite, a khuhta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in kilakna himhim nou ading in laibu bilhkhum bikbek bang ahita, mite’n laisiammi kiang ah, hehpih in huai sim in, chi in a pia ua, aman, ka sim theikei, bilhkhum bikbek ahi, a chi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, laibu tuh laisiam loumi kiang ah, Hehpih in hiai sim in, chi in a pia ua, aman, laisiam ka hi kei, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in, Toupa’n , hiai mite’n a hongnaih ua, a kam un leh a muk un a hon pahtawi ua, himahleh a lungtang uh kei a kipan in a gamla a, a hon launa uleh mihingte thupiak min a sinsak lel uh ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai mite lak ah thillamdang ka hih behlap ding, thillamdang, thillamdang mahmah; huchi in a mipilte uh pilna a mang ding a, a mi teite uh teina sel in a om ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thutup uh Toupa lak a sel ding a thuktak zongmite tung a gik hi! a thilhihte ulah mial nuai ah a om a, kuan a honmu dia? Kuan a honthei dia? a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thilte na lumlet vek uh! Belvelpa bellei banglela seh in a om sin ahia. Thil bawl in a bawlpa tung ah, amah honbawl ka hi sam a, a chih? Ahihkeileh, thil suktuaha om in a sutuahpa tungthu ah, theihna himhim a neikei, a chih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sawtlouchik nung in ahi ka hia, Lebanon lei hoih tak mun a suahsak in a om sina, lei hoih tak mun lah gammang a seha a om sin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai ni’n bengngongte’n laibu thute a bil un a za ding ua, mittawte’n mial nuai leh mial lak a kipan in a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thunuailutte’n leng Toupa ah a nopna uh a khangsakta ding ua, mihingte lak a gentheite Israelte Mi Siangthou ah a kipakta ding uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi lauhuai bangmahlou a bawl ahita a, mi simmohhat a daita, thulimlouhna ngaklah tengteng hih manthat in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huaite’n thu in mite thil hihkhial in a bawl ua, kulh kongpi ah taihilhmi awkna ding in thang a kam ua, mi diktat bangmahlou in a nawlkhin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa , Abraham tan pen, Jakob inkawte tungthu ah hichi in a chi hi: Jakobte zaw tuin a zahlak takei ding ua, a mai uh a mual nawn sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ta uh, ka khut suakte, a lak ua a muh un, ka min a siangthousak zawta ding uh; ahi, Jakobte Mi Siangthou a siangthousak ding ua, Israelte Pathian lah a kihta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kha a vakmangte’n leng a hon theisiamta ding ua mi phunhatte’n sinsak thu a sinta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n , ta helhatte a tung uh a gik hi! Huaite’n mi a dong ua, kei lah a hon dong kei uh, a khelhna tung ua khelhna a behlapna ding un, khuhna in a khuh ua, ka kha thu in lah a khuh tuankei uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pharo hatna a kihatsak ding in leh, Aigupta lim bel ding in, ka kam dong tuanlou in Aigupta gam a paisuk tum in a kuan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in Pharo hatna noute zahlakna ahita ding a, Aigupta lim na belh ulah na maizumna uh ahita ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A miliante lah Zoan khua ah a om ua, a palaite lah Hanes khua a tungta ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau adia phattuamna himhim neilou mi, huhna hilou, phattuamna neimi leng hilou, maizumna leh minsiatna hizawte, avek un a zumpih ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sim gam a sate puakgik, buaina leh lunglauna gam, humpinelkainu leh humpinelkaipa, guldekpak leh gul kuangleng thei pawtna, a sum uh sabiltung nou tungte ah, a gou uh sangawngsau nungvumte ah pawsak in, amau adia phattuamna neilou mite kiang a piak ding in, a pai ton dapdap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aigupta in lah phatuam lou tak leh panna neilou tak in a panpih zel ngal a; huaiziak in ahi, amah, Rahab tu kinkennu, ka chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin pai inla, huaite a ma ua laigelhna pek ah gelh inla, laibu ah leng gelh in, tunung a tangtawn donga ding a hihtheihna din.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaite lah mi helhatte, ta zuautheite, ta Toupa dan ngaikhe nuamloute ahi ngal ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mutheimite kiang a, mu kei un, zawlneite kiang a, Thildikte honhilh kholkei un, thil nuam lam ka kiang uah gen un, khemna thu gen un, khemna thu gen khol un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lampi lou ah pai un, lamsik ah pial un, Israelte Mi Siangthou ka ma ua kipan hihmang un, chi ngitngette.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in Israelte Mi Siangthou in hichi in a chi a, hiai thu na muhsit ziak un leh nuaisiahna leh phengphitna na muan ua, a tung ua na kingak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hiai thulimlouhna noute ading in suangbang sangpi selai, chim dekdek, puak eng ong, thakhat a mitphialkal lou a segawp ding bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in belvelmi bel a kitam gawpsak bang un, hawi om hetlou a keknen in, a themnen lak ah belpei thuk a mei lakna ding hiam tuikhuka tui dipna ding omlou khop in, a kitam nensak ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa Pathian Israelte Mi Siangthou in hichi in a chi hi, Kiknawn a khawl a om in hotdam in na om ding ua; muangtak a omna ah leh ginna omna ah na hatna uh a om ding, chi in; himahleh nou na ut kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hilou e, sakol tung a tuang in i tai zozot ding uh, na chi zawsop ua, huaiziak in na tai zozot ngei ding uh; Thil hattak tung ah i tuang ding, na chi ua; huaiziak in nou hondelh ding lah hattak ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi khat phawn in sang khat a taikek ding ua; mi nga phawn in na taikek ding uh; a tawp in mualvum a puankhai khai bang leh, tang tung a chiamtehna om bang a nutsiat in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak in noute Toupa’n a hon hehpih theihna ding in a honngak ding a, huaiziak in noute a hon lainat theihna ding in pahtawi in a om ding; Toupa lah vaihawm diktatna Pathian ahi ngal a; amah ngakte tengteng in nuam a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mite Jerusalem a Zion ah a om ding ahi ngal ua; na kap nawn kei ding uh; na kahna husa uah aman a hon hehpih mahmah ding a; a zaktak in a hon dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa’n lungkhamna tanghou leh haksatna tui nou honpe mahleh, nou hon sinsakmite a kibu nawn kei ding ua, na mit un nou hon sinsakmite a mu zawta ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan, taklam a na pial un hiam, veilam a na pial un, na bil un na nunglam ua thu, "Hiai lampi ahi, hiai ah pai un," chi in, a za ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na dangka uh milim bawl dangka chi a zepna leh, na dangkaeng uh, milim sun dangkaeng tui a luanna na buahsak ding ua; thil nin bang in na paita ding ua, a kiang ah, Paimang in! na chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in, aman na buhchi uh lei a na tuh ding uh ading in vuahtui a pe ding a; lei a thilpoute leng an din a peding, huai lah hoihtak pung tak ahi ding; huai ni chiang in na ganta uh gantatna mun zapi ah a ta ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawngtal leh sabengtungnou leilette’n an chisoh, ninluahna leh phazah a hihsiangsa a ne ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kithahna thupitak ni a galvenna singte a chip ni’n, tangsang teng ah leh mualvum sangteng ah luipite leh luite tuiluang a hongom ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huailou leng Toupa’n a mite kihehna a tuam a, a liamna ma uh a damsak ni chiang in, khavak nivak pha in a omta ding a, ni vak a mun sagih in, ni sagih vakpha in a omta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa min, a hehna kuang zuazua in, meikhu sahtak in a zamtou lak ah, gamlapi a kipan in a hongpai hi; a mukte lunghih louhna in a dim a, a lei thil katmanghat mei bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A hu lah, manna lawhpi a namchih sep ding in, lui ngawng chiangpha hial a a kuang a let bang ahi; michih kam ah pikhelh sakna kaihgingna khau a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zan a zehtan siangthou a zeh a tanlai ua la a sak bang un, la a sa ding ua; Toupa tang a Israelte Suangpi kiang tung ding a tamngai toh a pailai ua lungtang nopsakna a nei bang un lungtang nopsakna leng a nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in, Toupa’n a aw thupitak a kizasakta ding a, a hehna thupitak leh thil katmang ching meikuang in, a huihpi leh vuahpi leh gial in, a khut khakdan a ensakta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Toupa aw ziak in Assuria mi, khetbuk a mi khen nakpa, kitapzan sak a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amah lah chiang sehsa a Toupa’n a zep peuhmah chiang in khuangtate leh kaihgingte toh a zep ding; a chianglik a kisualnate ah amau a sual ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tophet khat lah tuma a na bawlkholhsa ahi ngal a; ahi, kumpipa ading in bawlzoh siang ahi a; thutak zatakin a bawl a; a thil sekkhawm mei leh sing tamtak ahi a; Toupa hu, kat luiluang bang in, a kangsak zuazua hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta gam a panpihna zong ding a hohsuk a, sakolte tung a muang a, a tam ziak ua kangtalaite leh a hat mahmah ziak ua sakol tungtuang mite muang a Israelte Mi Siangthou lam enlou a, Toupa leng dongloute zaw a tung uh a gik hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dong kei mahle uh amah leng piltak ahi, thil hoihlou a hon tungsak ding a, a thute a khel nawn kei ding, thil hoihlou hihmite inkuan sual ding in a thou zaw ding a, khialte panpihna dou ding in a thou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta mite zaw, Pathian ahi kei ua, mi lel ahi uh; huchi in Toupa’n a khut a zak hun chiang in a panpihtu pen a pai ekek ding a, a panpihpen leng a puk ding a, avek un a mangthang khawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n lah huchi in ka kiang ah a chi ngal a. Humpinelkai leh humpinelkai lunlai in sa a khamlai in belamchingmi tamtak a sual ding in a sapkhiak in om mahle uh, a aw uh a lau kei ding ua, a bil ap ziak ua a kihtak tuanlouh ding bang in, sepaihte Toupa zaw Zion tang ah a mual tung a sual ding in a hong paisuk ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vasate a bu tung ua a lengleng bang un sepaihte Toupa’n Jerusalem khua a veng ding; a veng dia a tankhe ding a, a Paikan in a humbit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel suante aw, nakpitak a na helsansa lam uh nga nawnta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai ni’n michih in amau dangka milimte, amau dangkaeng milimte, khelhna ding a amau khut a na kibawltawmte uh lah a paimang ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in Assuria mi bel, mi namsau a puksak hilou in, namsau hihpuk sak hilou in, namsau hihpuk in a om ding a; namsau mite a hilou in, amah a gai ding; huan, namsau lak a kipan a taimang ding a, a tangvalte lah siahliaumi a hong hita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in, a suangpi lah thil mulkimhuai ziak in a mang ding a, a miliante lah chiamtehna ziak in a buaita ding, chi in, Toupa , a mei Zion a om leh, a haltuina mei Jerusalem a om in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai in, kumpipa khat diktattak in kumpipa in a tu ding a, mi liante’n vaihawmna diktak in vai a hawm ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in, mi khat huihpi lak a bukna mun bang, vuahpi lak a bitna mun, mun keu a tui luangte bang, gam tultak a suangpi lianpi nuamsa tak bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in a mute mit a mial kei ding a, a zate bil in a ngaikhe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi ngongtatte lungtang in theihna thu a theisiam ding a, dang-awkte lei teltak in a pau thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Migilou mi thilphal a chi nawnta kei ding uh, milepchiah misiam a chi nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian zahlouhna thilhih ding leh, Toupa hekna dia thu diklou gen ding in, gilkialte sung hawmsak ding leh, dangtakte dawn ding hihmang ding in, migilou in lah gitlouhna thu a gen dia, a lungtang in thil a hihkhial ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi lepchiah vante zaw hoihlou ahi a; tagahte’n thudik a gen un leng mi gentheite zuauthu a hihmang ding in aman lah thil gilou hih a ngaihtuah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi thilphal bel thilphal in thil liante a ngaihtuah a: huchi in thilphal lam thilte ah a om gige ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Numei mawk omte aw, thou unla, ka aw ngaikhia un; tanu pilvangloute aw ka thugen ah bildoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Numei pilvangloute aw, kum khat leh ni bangzah hiam nung in na buaita ding uh; grep loh ding lah a om ngalkei ding a, grep lohkhawm ding ah leng bangmah a suak sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Numei mawk omte aw, ling un: mi pilvangloute aw, buaitak in om un; kisuah unla, vuaktang in kibawl unla, na kawng uah saiip puan teng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lou deihte ziak leh grep guigah nuamte ziak in a awm a tumtum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite gam loulingnei leh khaulingnei in nopsakna inn tengteng leh nopsakhuai khopi tengteng tung ah a buak ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa inn paisan a om ding ahi ngal a; a mualpawng leh a galvenbuk tangtawn kawhawm ding leh, gam sabiltung kipahnate, ganhon tatna munte ahi ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tunglam a kipan a kha ka tung ua sun a a om a, gamdai leihoihtak mun a suah a, leihoihtak mun lah gammang bang a sim a hih mateng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai hun in vaihawm diktatna gamdai ah a teng ding a, diktatna leihoihtak mun ah a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, diktatna nasep kituahna ahi ding a, diktatna a thilpawt lah tangtawn a muangtak a omna leh kitheihchetna ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in ka mite bel galmuanga omna ah leh inkiptak leh khawlna mun muanhuaite a omta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh gammang bel hihpuk ding in gial a ke ding a; khopi hihniam in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tui luanna piau a chi theh zel, bawngtal leh sabiltung khahzel te aw, nuam na sa uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang loh tuak ngeiloupi, a lok a pang, lepchiahtak a bawl tuak ngeilou pi, lepchiahtak a pang, na tung a gik hi. Mi loh na tawp hun chiang in nang leng loh na tuaksam ding hi; lepchiahtak a na hihkhit chiang in, na tung ah lepchiahtak in a hih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon hehpih in; k’on ngak nilouh uhi; zingsang teng in ka ban uh honghi inla, buai hun chiang in leng hon hondampa honghi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lum vengvung husa in michih a taimangta ua; nang na kisak hial chiang in namchih hihdalh in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na sum uh gallak a lak ding lung in thil a nek dundun bang in nekgaih in a om ding; khaupete a tawm duamduam uh bang in amaute sum tung ah a tawm duamduam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa tunglam ah tawisang in a omta hi; aman Zion vaihawm diktak leh diktatna in a dimsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na damsung in omkipna a om ding a, hotdamna, pilna, theihna a om kikeih ding; Toupa launa a gou ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, a pasalphate uh pawlam ah a kikou ua; kituahna palaite a kap hawhaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lamliante a mualta ua, mizin vialvakte a om nawn kei uh; aman thukhun a bohsia a, khuate a musit a, mi khawk a sa kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gam a kap in a gim a; Lebanon a zum in a vuai a; Sharon gamdai bang ahita; Bashan leh Karmel in a nah uh a singkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n , tuin ka thou ding a, tun ka kisa ding a, tun tawisang in ka omta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lou keu naupai in na pai ding ua, buhpawl na suang ding uh; na hu uh noumau kangmang ding mei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Michih lah chinai suang hal bang, loulingnei vatsa mei a a paih bang uh, a chi ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gamlapi a omte aw, ka thilhih bil in za un; naichik a omte aw, ka thilhihtheihdan thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zion a migilou omte’n a lau ua; Pathian zahlou mite linna in a manta hi. I lak ua kua ahia thil katmang ching mei kiang a om ding? I lak uah kua ahia tangtawn a kang zoizoi kiang a om ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Diktattak a om a, diktak a gen mi; nuaisiahnate punna himhim bangmah a ngailou a, golhna la nuamlou a bil hum a, gilou himhim en nuamlou a mitsi zel mi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai mi tunglam ah a om ding a; a kidalna munsang suangpi kidalnate ahi ding; a an a kiang a piak ahi ding a, a tuite a om ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na mite’n kumpipa a kilawmna in a mu ding a, gam kiphalh zatak a hon en ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A simmi koi a omta ahia? Siahliau tehmi koi a omta ahia? Galven insangte simmi koi a omta ahia? chi in, na lungtang in thil mulkimhuai mahmah na ngaihtuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihangtak, pau giltak na theihtheih louh a pau mite, pau tuam na theihsiamlouh a pau mite, na mu nawnta kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I zehtanna khopi Zion en dih; na mit in Jerusalem omna muanhuaitak, puanin chikchiang a leng suanlouh ding, kaihgakna khet chikchiang a leng bohlouh ding, a kaihna khau himhim kitatlou ding bang, a mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huai ah Toupa , lui zapipi leh luitate omna mun, thupitak in i kiang uah a omzaw ding; huai tui tung ah kidouna long lianpi kalhna chiang neite a pai kei ding a, long lian thupitak in leng a kheng sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa lah i vaihawmpa ahi a, Toupa lah dan hon pepa ahi a, Toupa lah i kumpipa ahi; aman a hon hondam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na khaute kolsak in a om ding a; a puanzak peu bul uh a kipsak theikei ua, puanzak lah a zak theikei uh; huaitak in gallak sum tampi hawm in a om a; khebaite’n leng gallak sum a lata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huai khua a mi om in, ka chi a na, a chi kei ding a, asung a mite khelhna ngaihdam in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Namchihte aw, bil a za ding in hongnai un; michihte aw, ngaikhia un; leitung leh asung a om tengteng in bil in za uhen; khovel leh asung apat pawt tengteng toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n nam chiteng tung a lungkimlouhna nei in a sepaihte uh tengteng tung ah lah hehna a nei ngal a; amau a hihmang vek a, thah din a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lak ua thah a omte paihkhiak in a om ding ua, a luang namsia uh a paitou vutvut ding a, tangte a sisan ua zulsak in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Van a omte tengteng hihman in a om ding ua, laibuzial a zial bang un van zial in a om ding a, a omte tengteng, grepgui a kipan a nahvuai a pulh bang in leh, theipi kung a kipan a nahvuai a pulh bang in a vuai khin un a pulh vek ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka namsau in van ah taitak in a dawnta ngal a, ngai in, huai vaihawm ding in Edomte tung ah leh ka hamsiat mite tung ah a ke ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa namsau sisan in a tai ding a, thauna a thausak in a omta, belamnoute leh kelte sisan in, belampa gilthaute in; Toupa’n Bozrah khua ah kithoihna a nei a, Edom gam ah leng thahna thupitak a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gam bawngtalte leng kituak a satpaih in a om ding ua, bawngpate bawngtalte toh, a gam un sisan a kham ding a, a leivui uh thauna a thausak in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa phulak ni lah ahita ngal a, Zion selna lam thu a thukna kum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A luituite longnai dia suahsak in a om ding a, leivuite mei leh kat a suak ding a, a gam longnai kang a suak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sun leh zan in mihsak ahi kei ding a; a meikhu lah tangtawn in a tungkah ding a; suan omlai siah a sia in a om nilouh ding a; tangtawn in leng kuamah in a ngap kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuivagik leh sakuh in huai gam a tang ding ua; simbu leh va-ak huai ah a teng ding uh; siatna khau leh siatgawpna ulum a tung ah a khai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mi hoihte uh gam uk ding in a sam ding ua, himahleh huai ah kuamah sap ding a omkei ding uh; a milian tengteng uh bangmah ahi kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kumpipa uh inn ah loulingneite a pou ding a, a kulhpi sung uah dailing leh lingnok a pou ding; sehalte tenna ding leh vasa ngawngsaute ading in inn umsung intual ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, gamdai a, gamsate ngiate toh a kituak ding ua, sathak in a lawm a sam ding; ahi, zan thil lauhuaipi in huai ah omna a bawl ding a, amah ading in khawlna mun ding a mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai ah simbu thupi in bu a bawl ding a, a tui dia, a keuh ding a, a op khawm ding; ahi, huai ah mute koppih neichiat in a omkhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa laibu ah zong unla, sim un; huaite lak ah khat leng kimlou a omkei ding a, khat leng koppih neilou a omkei ding; amah kam ngei in thu a pia a, a kha ngei in huaite a pikhawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman lah amau ading in ai a sansak a, a khut a khau a teh in huai gam a hawmsak chiat a; tangtawn in a nei ding ua, suan omlai teng huai ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gamdai leh phaksap gam a kipak ding a; gamkeu in nuamsa in pawn pak bang in a pak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pak lun ding a, kipaktak leh lasa in nuam a sa ding hi; Lebanon thupina a kiang ah piak ahi ding, Karmel leh Sharon kilawmna toh; Toupa thupina a mu ding ua, i Pathian kilawmna toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khut hatloute hatsak unla, khuk zawte kipsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungtang dawilokte kiang ah, hattak in om unla, lau kei un; ngai un, na Pathian uh phulakna toh a hongpai ding a, a hon hondam ding, chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in mittawte mit hahsak in a om ding a, bengngongte bil hihvak in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in khebaite sakhi bang in a tawm ding ua, pautheiloute lei in nuamsatak in la a sa ding; gamdaite ah tuite a hong phulkhe ding ua, gam keute ah luita tui a hong phulkhe biabia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in piaunel sa mahmah munte dil a hongsuak ding a, lei dangtak mahmah tuinak a hongsuak ding; sehalte tenna a, a lupna uah, loupa, maute leh sikhapat toh a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan, huai ah lamlian a om ding, kongpi toh, huai siangthouna Lampi a chi ding uhi; mi thanghuai in lampi a tawn kei ding; himahleh huai mite ading in ahizaw ding; mi vialzinte, ahi, mihaite leng, huai ah a mang kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Humpinelkai himhim huai ah a omkei ding a, sa hing ne himhim huai ah a paitou sam kei ding uh, muhphak in leng a omkei ding; Tatsate bel huai ah a paitou ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa tatsate a kiknawn ding ua, lasa kawm in Zion a tung ding uh, tangtawn a kipahna a lu tung uah a omta ding a; nuamsakna leh kipahna a ngah ding ua, lungkhamna leh thumna a mang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Hezekiah kum sawmlehli kum in hichi ahi a, Assuria gam kumpipa Sennakerib tuh Judah gam a kulhnei khua tengteng sim ding in a va hohtou a a lata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa’n Rabsakeh sepaihhon tampi piin Lakish khua a kipan Jerusalem khua a kumpipa Hezekiah kiang ah a sawl hi. Huan, dil saknung tuilakna kiang a puansawpmi pawn lamlian ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa inkuanpihte tung a heutu a om Hilkiah tapa Eliakim, Laigelhmi Shebna, tanchin gelhmi Asaph tapa Joah a kiang ah a hongsuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan Rabsakeh in a kiang uah, “Hezekiah kiang ah huchi in gen un: Kumpipa thupitak Assuria kumpipa in hichi in a chi, Na muanna kingakna bang ahi mai a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kidouna ding a na lemtheihna leh na hatna zaw thu lel ahi, ka chi; Kua muang a, ka tung a hel na himai a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai in, hiai sialluang chiang kitan Aiguptate muang neive; huai mi na muan leh, na khut ah a sun ding hi; Aigupta kumpipa Pharo ah zaw amah muangte tung ah huchibang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihkeileh, ka kiang ah, Toupa i Pathian uh ahi ka muan uh, na chihleh, amah pen Hezekiah in Judahte kiang ah leh Jerusalem kiang ah, Hiai maitam ma ah kia na biak ding uh ahi, chi a, a munsangte leh a maitamte lakmangsakpa hilou hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in, hehpih in, ka pu Assuria kumpipa kiang ah thu chiam in, huchi in ken sakol sang nih k’on pe ding, nang a tung ua tuangdingte na muh theihpeuh ding leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangchi’n, kangtalaite leh sakol tungtuang mite thu ah Aiguptate tung a na muanna nga a, ka pu sikha neupente lak a heutu khat leng na nan zoh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, hiai hihse ding a sim ding in Toupa panglou a hong paitou ka hi ahia? Toupa’n , ka kiang ah, Huai gam sim ding in hohtou inla, hihsia in, a honchi chi un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eliakim leh Shebna leh Joahte’n, Rabsakeh kiang ah, “Hehpih in na sikhate Suria pau in hon houpih in; huai ka theithei ngal ua; kulhbang tung a mite zak in Judah pau in hon houpih nawn ken” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh Rabsakeh in, “Ka pu in na pu kiang kia ah leh nang kiang ah hiai thu gen ding in honsawl ahia? Kulhbang tung a tute, noute toh amau ek ne ding leh amau zun dawn dingte kiang ah, a honsawl ahizaw kei maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in, Rabsakeh ading a, Judah pau in ngaihtak in a kikou a, “Kumpipa thupi Assuria kumpipa thute ngaikhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa’n hichi in a chi: Hezekiah khem in om nuam dah un; aman lah a hon humbit theikei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘Hezekiah in, Toupa’n pellou in hon humbit ding; hiai khopi zaw Assuria kumpipa khut a piak in a omkei ding, chi in, thu gen mahleh, Hezekiah gen ziak in Toupa muang nuam tuandah un’.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hezekiah thu ngaikhe kei un; Assuria kumpipa’n lah hichi in a chi ngal a, Thilpiak in hon kituahpih unla, ka kiang ah hong paikhia un; michih in a grepgui apan leh michih in a theipi kung apan ne chiat unla, michih in a tuikhuk apan tui dawn chiat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hongpai a, noumau gam bang a buh leh uain omna gam, tanghou leh grephuante omna gam a k’on paipih ma tan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n hon humbit ding, chi a, Hezekiah in a honkhem khak leh pilvang un. Namchih pathian lak a mi himhim in a gam uh Assuria kumpipa kiang ah a humbitta ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hamath leh Arpahte pathiante koi a om ahita ua? Sepharvaimte pathiante koi a om ahita ua? Huai Samaria khua kei a kipan in a humbitta ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai gam pathian tengteng lak a kuate’n ahi a gam uh kei a kipan a a humbit uh? Toupa’n Jerusalem khua kei a kipan in a humbit mahmah ding maw? chi in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amau bel a daidide ua, “Thu khat lel in leng a dawng kei uh; kumpipa thupiak, amau dawng kei un” chih ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa inkuanpihte tung a heutu a om Hilkiah tapa Eliakim, Laigelhmi Shebna, tanchin gelhmi Asaph tapa Joah ten a puansilh uh botkek in Hezekiah kiang ah a hongpai ua, Rabsakeh thugente a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, kumpipa Hezekiah in huai a zaktak in a puansilhte a botkek a, saiip puan a silh a, Toupa inn ah a lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A inkuanpihte tung a heutu a om Eliakim leh, Laigelhmi Shebna leh siampute upate saiip puan silh in Amoz tapa zawlnei Isai kiang ah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amau a kiang ah, Hezekiah in hichi in a chi, “Tuni mangbatna leh muhsitna ni ahi; naupangte lah a pian hun uh ahita a, amau piangsak ding in hatna lah a om nawn kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rabsakeh a pu Assuria kumpipa’n Pathian hing gense ding a a sawl thugente, Toupa na Pathian in a bil in a za lai ahi kha ding, huchi in a thugen, Toupa na Pathian in a bil a a zakte ah, a honsal ding hi; huaiziak in a omsunte ading in na thumna lan in” a chi hi, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Hezekiah sikhate Isai kiang ah a hongpai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isai in a kiang uah, “Na pu kiang uah hichin na chi ding uh ahi, Toupa’n hichi’n a chi, Na thu zak, Assuria kumpipa sikhate’n a hon gensiatnate uh, kihta ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, asung ah kha banghiam ka omsak ding a, huchi in thuthang a za ding a, amah gam ah a kiknawn ding; huchi in amah gam ngei ah namsau a puksak in ka omsak ding, a chi” chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Rabsakeh a kiknawn a, Assuria kumpipa in Libnah khua a douna a kipan a paikheta chih a theikhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa Sennakerib in Tirhak Ethiopia kumpipa tungthu, “Nang honsim ding in a pawtta” chi in mi gen a za hi. Huchi in huai a zaktak in Hezekiah kiang ah palaite a sawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichi in Judahte kumpipa Hezekiah kiang ah na chi ding uh ahi, “Na muan Pathian in, Jerusalem khua Assuria kumpipa khut ah piak ahi kei ding, chi in, honkhem kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai in, Assuria Kumpipate’n gam tengteng hihsevek in a tung ua a thilhihte uh na bil in na za hi, huchi in nang penpen humbit in na om tuam ding hiam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Namchih pathiante’n, Gozan, Haran, Reseph, Eden ta Telassar khua a omte, ka pipute sukmante, a humbit ua hia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath kumpipate, Ivvah kumpipate koi a om ahita ua?” chi in, a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hezekiah in palaite khut a kipan in lai a mu a, a sim a, huchi in Hezekiah Toupa inn ah a va lut a, Toupa ma ah a phahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekiah Toupa kiang ah a thum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Sepaihte Toupa , Israelte Pathian aw, cherubte tung a tupa, nang, nang kia, leitung luah gam tengteng Pathian na hi; nangman leitung leh van na bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa aw na bildoh inla, ngai dih ve; Toupa aw na mit hak inla, en dih ve; Pathian hing gense ding a mite sawlpa Sennakerib thu tengteng ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa , Assuria Kumpipate’n gam tengteng leh a lei uh a hihse ngei ua, a pathiante uleng mei ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaite zaw Pathian ahi kei him ua, mihing khut a bawl sing leh suang, ahizaw uh; huaiziak in a hihmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa ka Pathian uh aw, nang, nang kia, Toupa na hi chih leitung luah gam tengteng in a theihna ding un amah a kipan in hon humbit in” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huailai in Amoz tapa Isai in Hezekiah kiang ah mi a sawl a, hichi in a chi a, “ Toupa Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi hi, Assuria kumpipa Sennakerib siatna ding nangawn a ka kiang a na thum ziak in hiai a tungtang thu Toupa’n a gen ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Zion tanu nungak in a hon musit a, a hon nuihsan hi; Jerusalem tanu in a lu a hon sinkhum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kua ahimai a na minsiatsak a na gensiat? Kua tung ah ahia na aw na puamsak a, na mit na san sak? Israelte Mi Siangthou tung ah ahi kei maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na sikhate zang in Toupa na min sesak a, ka kangtalai tampi toh tangsang sanna, Lebanon gam kil ah k’ong tungtouta hi; a sidar sing sangtakte leh a meilah sing hoihte ka phuk ding; A mun sangpen, a lei hoihna gammang ah ka lut ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuileh ka let a, tui ka dawn zel a, ka khepek nuai in Aigupta lui tengteng ka kangsak vek ding” na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ken nidanglai apat in huai ka hih ahi a, tuma lam a kipan a ka suktuah ahi chih na za ka hia? Khua kulhneite inchim khawm banglel a hihsepa na hih theihna ding in tuin ka tungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huaiziak in asung a omte a hat law kei ua, a lau ua, a zahlak uhi; pawn loupa banglel leh, loupa hing banglel, intung loupa hing banglel, intung loupa bang leh, lou buh hoih mah bang lel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ken bel na tut, na pawt, na lut leh ka tung a na hehdan ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka tung a na heh ziak leh, na uangpau ka bil a a honglut touh tak ziak in ka nakbulh nang nak ah ka bulh ding a, ka sikkaihna leng na muk ah ka bulh ding hi, na hongpaina lampi mah ah k’on kiksak nawn ding, chih, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huan, hiai pen nang ading a chiamtehna ding ahi ding; tukum in buh sang na sen ding ua; kum nawn in leng huai buhsang mah na sen ding uh; a kum thumna ah buh tuh unla, at unla, grephuante bawl unla, a gah ne un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huan, Judah inkuanpihte lak a damsunte bel a suklam a zungkai a, a toulam a gah in a omnawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A omsunte Jerusalem a kipan in a pawt ding ua, damlai dingte Zion tang a kipan in a pawt ding uh; sepaihte Toupa phatuamngaihna in huaite a hih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Huaiziak in Toupa’n Assuria kumpipa tungtang thu ah hichi in a chi, Amah hiai khopi a hong tungkei ding a, hiailai ah a thal leng a kap sam kei ding a, lum toh a kiang ah leng a hongpai sam kei ding, a simna ding in lah leikulh a bawl sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A hongpaina lampi ah huai mah ah a kiknawn ding a, hiai khopi a hongtung kei ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kei ziak leh ka sikha David ziak in hiai khopi ka humbit ding hi” chi in, a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa angel a vapawt a, Assuriate giahmun ah mi nuai khat leh sing giat leh sang nga a sisak a; huan, zing khang a mi a thoh uleh, ngai in, misi luang ngen a na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchi in, Assuria kumpipa Sennakerib a pawt a, a paikik a, Ninevi khua ah a om nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huchi in, hichi ahi a, a pathian Nisrok inn a pathian a biak lai in a tapa Adrammelek leh Sarezerte’n namsau in a satlum ua; huchi in a taimang ua, Ararat gam ah a lut uhi. Huchi in, a tapa Esarhaddon in a sik in vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huailai in Hezekiah muanmawh in a chi a na hi. Huchi in Amoz tapa zawlnei Isai a kiang ah a hong a, a kiang ah, “ Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Na inkuan omdan ding gelsak in; dam khelou in na si ding hi” chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Hezekiah bang lam nga in a om a, Toupa kiang ah a thum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“ Toupa aw, na ma a thutak leh lungtang hoihkim pu a ka om zel dan leh na mitmuh a thil hoih ka hih zel dan, hehpih in theigige in” a chi hi. Huchi in, Hezekiah a kap huphup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa thu Isai kiang ah a hongtung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kuan inla, Hezekiah kiang ah gen in, Toupa, na pu David Pathian in hichi in a chi, Na thumna ka za a, na khituite leng ka mu a: ngai in, na damsung nite ah kum sawm le kum nga ka behlap ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan, nang leh hiai khopi Assuria kumpipa a kipan ka humbit ding a: hiai khopi ka hum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n a thil gen a hih ngei ding chih, hiai nang ading in Toupa a kipan chiamtehna ding ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />En in, inlim chial a lim, Ahaz dakbi theihna a niamkiaksa, inlim chial sawm tan in ka kiksak nawn ding” a chi hi. Huchi in, ni a niamna dakbi theihna ah inlim chial sawm tan in a kiknawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Hezekiah china, a dam nawn nung a a laigelh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka damsung nite sunlaitak in han kongpi ah lut ding in ka kisa a: ka damsung kum omlai dingte suh in ka omta, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa , Toupa ngei, mihing gam ah ka mu nawnta kei ding a: khovel a omte lak ah mihing ka mu nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka omna suan in a om a, belamchingmi puan in bang in ka kiang a kipan a lakmang in a omta hi. Puan gan min a puan a zial bang in ka hinna ka zial a; aman siambu a kipan a hon teptan ding a; ni khat leh zan khat thil thu a hon hihtawp maimah ding nei ve ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zingsang tan ka dai teitei a; humpinelkai bang in ka guh tengteng a sutan vek a: nang ni khat leh zan khat thil thu a hon hihtawp mai ding neive.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lensiam hiam, vakang hiam bang in ka hamham a, vakhu bang in ka thum hi, tunglam etna in ka mit a vaita hi; Toupa aw, nuaisiah a om ka hi, nang ka tang in ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bang ka gen dia? Aman a hon houpih a, amahmah in a hihpah hi: ka hinna ningkitelna ziak in ka damsung kum teng awl khakha in ka paikhiankhianta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa aw, hichibang thil ziak in mihingte a hing zel uh, huaite kia ah ka kha hinna a om zel hi: huaiziak in hondam sak nawn in hon hingsak nawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai in, ka lungmuanna ding in ahi, ningkitelna thupitak ka na neih: himahleh nang, ka hinna na it ziak in, siatna kawkhuk a kipan in na humbitta; ka khelhnate tengteng lah na nunglam ah na pai vekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Han in lah honphat thei ngal kei a, sihna’n leng a hon pahtawi thei sam kei hi: kawkhuk a kumte’n na thutak a lamen theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing in, mihing in, amau ngei in tuni a ka hih bang in a honphat ding uh: pa’n a tate kiang ah na thutak a theisak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa bel hon hondam ding in a mansa gige hi: huaiziak in i damsung tengteng in, Toupa inn ah, ka late tumging guineite toh i sa ding.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isai in, theipi gah lomkhat la henla, damdawi a tat a tatte ding in a meimatum ah tuamkhum hen, huchi in a dam ding, a na chi khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hezekiah in leng, Toupa inn ah ka hohtou nawn ding chih theihna bang chiamtehna hongom ding ahia? a na chikhinta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huailai in Baladan tapa Babulon kumpipa Merodakbaladan in laite leh kipahman Hezekiah kiang ah a khak a: a chi a na chih leh a damnawnta chih a zak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Hezekiah a tung uah a kipak a, a kiang uah a thil manphate koihna inn dangkate, dangkaengte, gimlim bangbang hiamte, sathau manphate, a galvan koihna inn sung tengtengte, a gou hoih lak a om tengtengte a ensak hi: A inn leh a gamsung a om himhim Hezekiah in a kiang ua a etsaklouh a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huailai in zawlnei Isai bel kumpipa Hezekiah kiang ah a hong a, a kiang ah, “Den a mite’n bang ahia a gen uh? Koi a kipan in ahia na kiang a a hong uh?” a chi hi. Hezekiah in, “Gam gamlapi a kipan, Babulon a kipan in, ka kiang a hongpai ahi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in aman, “Na inn ah bangbang a en ua eita?” a chi a. Hezekiah in, “Ka insung a om tengteng a envek uh: ka gou hoihte ka etsak louh bangmah a omkei” chi in, a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Isai in Hezekiah kiang ah, “Sepaihte Toupa thu thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai in na insung a om tengteng leh tuni tan a na pipute’n a kholkhawmte uh Babulon khua a paipih in a omvek ding; bangmah nutsiat in a omkei ding; huchibang nite a hongtung ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan, na tapa, na gil a hong gah ding, na suan dingte ngei lak a mi, a paimang pih ding uh; amau Babulon kumpipa inn ah michilgeh ding in a om ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Hezekiah in, Isai kiang ah, “ Toupa thu na gen a hoih hi” a chi hi. Amahmah in, “Ka damsung in lemna leh thutak a om ding hi,” a chilai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungmuan un, ka mite lungmuan un, na Pathian un a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem kiang ah lungmuan lamsang in thugen unla, a galdouna uh hih zoh ahita a, a khelhna uh ngaihdam ahi a, a thil hihkhelh teng gun ding in Toupa khut a kipan a mun nih in a muta uh chih hilh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua! Kikou aw in, “Gamdai ah Toupa lampi bawl unla, gamkeu ah i Pathian ading in lamlian kilualsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Guam chih sansak ahivek ding a, tangchih mualchih niamsak ahi ding: lampi kawite tansak ahi ding a, a phokna lailai hihlual ahi ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa thupina hihlat ahi ding a, mi tengteng in huai a mu chiat ding uh chih Toupa kam in lah a genta ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua aw in, Kikou in, a chi. Mi’n, bang gen in ka kikou dia? a chi hi. Mi tengteng loupa bang ahi ua, a thupina tengteng uleng pawn a pak bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa hu in a mut ziak in loupa a vuai a, a pak a tul nak: mite zaw loupa bang ahi mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Loupa a vuai a, a pak a tul zel: i Pathian thu bel tangtawn in a om gige ding, chi in, a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zion kiang a a tanchinhoih hilhmi aw, tangsang mahmahte ah vahohtou in; Jerusalem kiang a tanchinhoih hilhmi aw, ngaihtak in na aw suah in; suah in, lau ken; Judah khuate kiang ah, En un, na Pathian uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En un, Toupa Pathian mi hattak bang in a hongpai ding hi; a ban in vai a hawm ding: En un, a kipahman a kiang ah a om a, ditna leng a ma ah a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman belamchingpa bang in a belamhon a vak ding a, belamnoute a ban in a pomkhawm ding a, a ang sung a koih in a paipih ding a, nou kailaite bel awlawl in a pi hiathiat ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuan ahia tuite a khutpek sunglel a teh a, tung a van khap lel a teh a, lei a leivui tehna khat lel a thunvek a, tangte lah khaina a khai a, mualpawngte bukna lel a buk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kuan ahia Toupa kha thilhih dan ding kawkmuh? Ahihkeileh kua ahia amah lemsehsak hi a amah chil?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman kua a dong a, kuan ahia amah theisak a, vaihawm lampi ensak a, theihna hilh a, theihsiamna lampi ensak ngei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai in, namchih baltin a tui tak khat banglel ahi ua, bukna a banghiam nen banglel a seh ahi ua, ngai in, aman tuikulh gamte thilneu neuchikte bang in a dom zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lebanon nangawn khul tham ahi kei a, a gam a gante leng haltum a kithoihna tham ahi sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Namchihte lah a ma ah bangmahlou bang ahi ua, amah ngaihtuah in bangmahlou sang a tawm zaw, huihkhua lel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian kua toh teh na hi ua? Ahihkeileh, bang lim ahia amah toh na teh ding uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Milim bawltawm zaw, nasem mi in asung a, dangkaeng sek mi’n dangkaeng in a luan khum a, huai a ding in dangka khainiangte a sunsak zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchibang thilpiak pe zoulou a, genthei law mahmah in sing muat lou ding a telzel, milim bawl tawm, ling lou ding, amah adia bawlkhiak sak ding khutsiam mi a zongzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lungsim un na thei kei ua hia? Na bil un na za kei ua hia? A tung a kipan in honhilh kei ua hia? Lei pianchil apan na theisiam kei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amah zaw lei kualkhumna tung a tupa ahi, amah mitmuh in leitung a omte khaupe banglel ahi uh, amah zaw tung a van puanin tung bang a kaipalh a, Puan in omna ding a zak a, miliante bangmahlou suaksakpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah leitung a vaihawmmite bangmahlou a bawl nakpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi, a suan ahi kei ua; ahi, a tuh ahi kei uh; ahi, a kung un lei ah zung a kai kei: huailou in aman amau a mut a, a vuai ua, pingpei in buhsi a lakmang bang in a lamang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kua toh honteh a, kua kimpih a honsep na hi ua? Mi Siangthou in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tunglam ah na mit uh hak unla, huai thilte kua siam hiam en un; aman sepaihte kizomzom in a pikhia a, a min chiat un a sam a; a hatna thupina ziak leh thilhihtheihna a a hat ziak in khat leng kimlou a om ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jakobte aw, Bang achia hiai chi na hi ua, Israelte aw, bang achia hichibang a thugen na hi ua, Ka lampi zaw Toupa lak a sel ahi a, A vaihawmsakna ka Pathian lak a lakmang ahi, chih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na lungsim un na thei kei ua hia? Na bil un na za ngeikei ua hia? Tangtawn Pathian, Toupa kawlmong Siampa, a bah lou a, a gim ngeilouh dan; a theihsiamdan zonkhiak vual ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bahte kiang ah thilhitheihna a pia a, hatna himhim neiloute a hatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuailaite nangawn bah in a gim ding ua, tangvalte leng a pukzou ding uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Toupa ngakte’n zaw a hatna uh a thaksak nawn ding ua; muvanlai bang in kha in a lengtou ding ua; gimlou in a tai ding ua; bah lou in khe in a pai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuikulh gamte aw, ka ma ah dai sipsip unla; michih in a hatna uh thaksak nawn uhenla: hongpai nai chiat le uh; huaikhit chiang in gen uhen: vaihawm ding in paikhom ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Suahlam a kipan mi khat, diktatna ziak a khe bul a a sap, kuan ahia kai halh? Aman namchih a ma ah a pia a, kumpipate tung ah vai a hawmsak a; leivui bang in a namsau kiang ah a pia a, buhsi huih mut leng bang in a thalpeu kiang ah leng a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman amaute a delh a, bittak in a pai a; a khe a a pai nailouhna lampi ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tung a kipan suan tengteng sam in, kuan ahia sem a, hih khin? Kei Toupa , a masapen leh a nanungpen, a hihpa kei kia ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuikulh gamte’n a mu ua; a lau ua; kawlmongte a ling ua: a honnaih a, a hongpai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Michih in amau lawmte a panpih ua; michih in a unaute uh kiang ah, Khamuangtak in om un, a chi chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in, a bulhkipna lam thu ah, A hoih hi, chi in, khutsiam mi in dangkaeng sekmi a hanthawn a, sek a sekmum mi in sekdou sekmi a hanthawna: a linlouhna ding in kilhnate in a kilh kipta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh nou Israelte ka sikha, Jakobte ka mitel, ka lawm, Abraham suante aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nou, lei tawpna a kipan a ka mipi, a nawl a kipan a ka misap, ka sikhate na hi ua, hon paikhe lou in k’on tel zaw ka honchihte aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lau kei un, kei lah na kiang uah ka om ngal a; mangbang kei un, kei lah na Pathian uh ka hi ngal a: k’on hatsak ding a; ahi, k’on panpih ding; ahi, ka diktatna khut taklam in ka honlen gige ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai in, na tung ua lungkimlou tengteng zahlaktak leh zumtak in a om ding uh: nou honselte lah bangmahlou bang ahi ding ua, a mang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nou honselte na zong ding ua, na mu tuankei ding uh: nou hon doute lah bangmahlou bang ahi ding ua, thil omlou banglel ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei Toupa na Pathian un, Lau kei un, k’on panpih ding, chi in, na khut taklam uh ka len ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nou Jakob tangtel leh Israel mite aw, lau kei un, k’on panpih ding, Toupa’n a chi, nou hon tanpa Israelte Mi Siangthou ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai in, buhsukna khawl thak mahmah, hiam mahmah, ha nei in k’on bawl ding; tangte chil in na khen zan ding ua, mualte buhsi bang in na bawl ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na zap ding ua, huih in a mut leng ding, pingpei in a hih dalh ding a, huan, noute Toupa ah na kipak ding ua, Israelte Mi Siangthou n’on suang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi genthei leh tagahte’n tui a zong ua, a omkei a, a lei uh dangtak in a hulkhin hi; kei Toupa’n amau ka dawng ding a, kei Israel Pathian in amau ka paisan kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tangsang giau ah luite ka luangsak ding a, guam laizangte ah tuinak ka suaksak ding: gamdai dil in ka bawl ding a, gamkeu leng tuinak in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gamdai ah sidar singte, singgite, muite, thausingte ka suan ding a, gamkeu ah meilah singte, phante, singgelh chite ka suan khawm vek ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa khut in huaite a hih ahi chih leh Israelte Mi Siangthou in a siam ahi chih a muh ua, a theih ua, a ngaihtuah ua, a theihsiam theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na thu uh hong gen un, Toupa’n a chi; na paulam pen uh sulang un, Jakobte Kumpipa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaite sulang uhenla, thil hongtung dingte i kiang uah gen uhen; i ngaihtuah theihna ding leh a tawpna ding i theih theihna ding in, tuma thilte bang ahia gen un; ahihkeileh, thil hongtung dingte hon theisak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />pathiante na hi uh chih ka theihna ding un tunung chiang a thiltung dingte gen un; ahi, i mangbat chiatna ding un leh i et chiat ding un thil hoih hiam thil hoihlou hiam hih dih ua le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngai un, bangmah na hi kei ua, na thilhih uleng bangmah ahi kei; nou hontelpa mi kihhuai a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mallam a kipan mi khat ka dingsak a, amah a hongtung a; ni suahna a kipan ka min loupa; aman suang bulhkipna bawl bang in vaihawmmite a bawl ding a, belvelmi’n bellei a chil bang in a chil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I theihtheihna ding un kuan ahia a tung a kipan gen ngei? Amah zaw a dik i chih theihna ding un kuan ahia gen khol ngei? Ahi gen himhim a om kei uh, ahi, theisak himhim a omkei uh, ahi, na thugente uh za a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ken Zion kiang ah, En in, amau en dih, ka chi masa ding a, Jerusalem kiang ah tanchinhoih hon tunmi khat ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka et in leng mi himhim a omkei ua; amau ka dot in leng, a lak ua lemtheimi, thu khat leng dawng thei, kuamah himhim leng a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />En un, a nasepte uh bangmahlou ahi a, thil omlou ahi: a milim sunte ulah huih leh huihkhua lel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka sikha, ka let gige, ka tel, ka lung in a pahtak mahmah en dih ua: a tung ah ka kha ka koihta: Jentelte kiang a piak ding in vaihawmna thu a hongpawt ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kikou kei ding a, a aw a suaksak sam kei ding, kongzing ah a aw a kiza sak sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sialluang gawpsa a kuaitan kei ding a, Meikuang liakliak a mitsak kei ding: thudik in vai a hawm zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitung a vaihawmna a omsak masiah, amah a bah kei ding a, a lungdong sam kei ding; tuikulh gamte’n a dan thu a ngak nilouh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian, Toupa , van siampa leh phalhpa, lei leh asung a kipan a pawt tengteng hihlianpa, a tung a mite kiang a hatna pepa leh a tung a paite kiang a kha pepan hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei Toupa in diktatna in ka honsam a, na khut ka len ding a, k’on humbit ding, mite thukhun ding leh Jentelte hihvakpa ding in k’onsep ding a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mitdelte mit hihvak ding leh mitangte suangkulh a kipan pikhe ding leh, mial lak a tute suangkulh a pan a pikhe ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa ka hi; huai ka min ahi: ka thupina midang kiang ah ka pe kei ding a, phat ka lohna leng milim bawltawmte kiang ah ka pe sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai un, tuma thilte a hongtungta, thil thakte gen ka hi: a pou ma in nang k’on hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuipi a hohsukte leh, asung a om tengteng leh, tuikulh gamte leh, a tung a om tengteng aw, Toupa pahtawi in la thak sa unla, kawlmong a kipan in leng amah phatna la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gamdai leh a khote’n a aw uh suaksak uhen, Kedarte omna khuate’n; Suangpi khua a omte’n nuamsa in la sa uhenla, mual dawn a kipan kikou uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa hih thupi uhenla, tuikulh gamte’n a phatna thu gen uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa lah mihat mahmah bang in a pawt ding a, galdoumi bang in mullitna a tokthou ding: a kikou ding a, ahi, ngaihtak in a kikou ding; amah doute tung ah hattak in a gamtang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sawtpi ka daita a; ka om kinken in ka kidek teitei; tun zaw numei nauvei bang in ka kikou tuaituai ding a; ka nak honhon in ka nak huhu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tang leh mualpawngte ka hihse ding a, a niam tengteng ka keusak vek ding; luite tuikulh gam in ka bawl ding a, dilte ka kangsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mittawte a theih ngeilouh lam ah ka honpi ding a, a theih ngeilouh uh lampi ah ka pi ding: a ma uah mial vak in ka bawl ding a, lam kawinate leng ka tangsak ding. Huai thilte ka hih ding a, amau leng ka nuse kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Milim bawl tawmte muang a, milim sunte kiang a, Ka pathian uh na hi uh, chite kiheisak in a om ding ua, nakpitak in a zahlak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bengngongte aw, bil in za unla; mittawte aw, na muh theihna ding un en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka sikha loungal kua mit a taw a? Ahihkeileh, ka sawltak sawl bang in kua beng a ngong a? Hon kithuahpih mi bang in kua mit a taw a? Toupa sikha bang in kua mit a taw a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil tampi na mu a, himahleh na lungsim in na vom gige kei; a bilte a kihong a, himahleh a zakei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dan lah a diktatna ziak a letsak a pahtawisaka om Toupa’n hoih a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh hiaite zaw guta guksak leh lohtuak mite ahi ua; guam a ahivek ua, suangkulh a khum mangte ahi ua; sal ding ahi ua, kuamah in lah a humbit ngal kei ua, gallak a lak ding ahi ua, kuamah in, penawn in, a chi kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lak uah huaite bildoh ding kua na om ua? Hun hongtung ding adia ngaikhia a za ding kua na om ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kua in ahia Jakobte gallak a lak ding a pia a, Israelte gutate kiang a pia? Toupa , a tung a i khelhnapa un, a piak hilou hia? Amah lampi ah a pai nuam ngal kei ua. A danthu a mang sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huaiziak in a heh mahmahna leh kibawlna tha amau tung ah a sungbua a, huai in amaute a kang a himahleh a thei sam kei uh; huai in amaute a hul a, himahleh a lungsim un a ngaihtuah tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin zaw, Jakobte aw, Toupa nou honsiampa leh, Israelte aw, nou hon bawlpa’n, hichi in a chi; Lau kei un, k’on tanta hi; na min un k’on sam a, kei a na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuite na ngah tan lai un na kiang uah ka om ding a; luite na ngah tan lai un leng a hontum kei ding hi: mei a na pai tan lai un leng a honhul kei ding a; meikuang in a honliau kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei, Toupa na Pathian uh, Israelte Mi Siangthou, nou hon humbitpa ka hi ngal a; noute tatna ding in Aigupta gam ka pia a, Ethiopia leh Sheba gam na sik un ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ngaih in manpha mahmah na hi ua, mizahtakhuai mahmah leng na hi uhi, it leng ka hon it ziak in, na sik un mite ka pe ding a, na hinna sik ding un michih ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lau kei un, na kiang uah ka om ngal a: na suante uh suahlam a kipan ka honpi ding a, tumlam a kipan ka honpi khawm ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mallam kiang ah, khah un, ka chi ding a; simlam kiang ah, len kei un, ka chi ding; ka tapate gamlapi a kipan honpi unla, ka tanute kawlmong a kipan honpi un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka min paw peuhmahte leh ka thupina ding a ka siam peuhmahte; amau ka bawl a, ahi, amau ka suktuah ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mit nei ngal a mittawte leh, bil nei ngal a bengngongte, pi khia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Namchih kikhawm uhenla, michih omkhawm uhen: a lak ua kua ahia hiai gen thei a, tuma lam in thilte hon theisak thei? Siamtansaka a om theihna ding un a palaite uh honpi uhen: ahihkeileh bil in za uhenla, thutak ahi, chi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi theih a, mi upa, amah ka hi chih na theih theihna ding un, noute ka palaite na hi uh, ka tel ka sikha leng, Toupa’n a chi: ka om ma in Pathian bawl a omkei a, ka om nung in leng a omsam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei, keimahmah, Toupa ka hi; keimah loungal hondampa a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ken ka gen a, ka hondam a, ka theisak a, na lak uah gamdang Pathian a omkei hi: huaiziak in noute ka palaite na hi uh, Toupa’n a chi, kei Pathian ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi, ni om nungsang kei amah ka hi; huchi in ka khut a kipan honkhe thei kuamah a omkei uh; nna ka sem a, kuan ahia huai hei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa, nou hon tanpa, Israelte Mi Siangthou in hichi in a chi: Nou ziak in Babulon khua ah sepaihte ka sawl a, huchi in, avek un, Kaldaite, a kipahna longpi uah taimangmi pi in ka pi suk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei Toupa , na Mi Siangthou uh, Israelte Siampa, Na Kumpipa uh ka hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipi a lampi bawlpa leh, tui thupi mahmahte a paina ding bawlpa, Toupa’n hichi in a chi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kangtalai leh sakol, sepaihte leh thilhihtheihna a pikhepa’n, huaite a lumkhawm zengzung ua, a thou nawnta kei ding uh; a chimit khin ua, khawnvak puan mihsak bang in mihsak in a omta uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuma lam thilte zaw theigige kei unla, nidanglai thilte ngaihtuah sam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai un, thilthak ka hih ding; tua kipan in a dawnkhe ding; huai na theikei ding ua hia? Gamdai nangawn ah lampi ka bawl ding a, gamkeu ah leng luite ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gamsate’n leng hon pahtawi ding ua, sehalte, vasangawngsaute tan in: gamdai a tuite ka omsak ziak leh, gamkeu a luite ka omsak ziak in, ka mi, ka telte kiang a dawn ding a piak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hiai mite kei ading in ka bawl a; kei phatna a hihlang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh Jakobte aw, nou zaw n’on sam kei ua, Israelte aw, nou zaw nawn chimtak zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Haltum thillat gannoute n’on lak ngeikei ua; na kithoihnate un n’on pahtawi sam kei uhi. Thillat in na k’on semsak ngeikei a, begaw in k’on hihgim ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kawltu dangka in n’on leisak ngeikei ua, na kithoihna thaute un n’on taisak ngeikei uh: na khelhnate uh puak nasepte n’on semsak ua, na tatleknate un n’on hihgim zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kei, kei mahmah, keimah leh keimah ziak lel a, na tatlekna uh nulmangpa ka hi; na khelhnate uleng ka theigige nawnta kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hon theihpih un; ngaihtuah chiat ni: siamtansak a na om theihna ding un na thu uh gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na pu masapen uh a khial a, na thugen mite uh leng ka tung ah a talek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huaiziak in Mun Siangthou a miliante ka hihbuah ding a, huchi in Jakobte hamsethuak ding in ka bawl ding a; Israelte muhdah din ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin zaw, Jakobte, ka sikhate aw, ka tel Israelte aw, ngaikhia unla:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa nou hon siampa, sul apan nou hon bawlpa, nou hon panpih dingpa’n hichi in a chi: Ka sikha Jakobte aw, ka tel nou Jeshurunte aw, lau kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dangka tung ah tui ka sung ding a, lei keu ah tuiluangte ka sung ding; na suante uh tung ah ka kha ka sung ding a, na tate uh tung ah ka vualzawlna ka sung ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in amau, tui luanna kiang a singhiang kaite a pou bang in, loupa lak ah a pou ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi khat in, Toupa a ka hi, a chi ding a; midang Jakob min in a kilou ding a; midang in a khut a, Toupa , chi a gelh in, Israel min a beh min in a zang ding chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa , Israelte Kumpipa, amau tanpa sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Kei a masapenpa ka hi a, nanungpenpa ka hi; keimah loungal Pathian a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nidanglai a mite ka seh nungsang kei hih bang in kuan a sam dia, huaite kuan a gen dia, kuan ahia kei sik a kizom zel a hihlang ding? Thil hongtung dingte leh hongom dingte gen hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lau kei unla, kihta sam kei un; tuma lam in na kiang uah ka genkhin in k’on theihsak khin hilou hia? Noute ka palaite na hi uhi. Keimah lou Pathian a om hiam? Ahi, Suangpi himhim a omkei; khat lel leng a om ka theikei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Milim bawltawm bawlmite avek un huihkhua lel ahi ua; a thil deihlam uh a phatuam kei ding; a zahlakna ding un amau palaite un leng a mu theikei ua, a theithei kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kuan ahia Pathian bawl? Ahihkeileh, kuan ahia bangmah ding a phatuam loupi milim bawltawm sung?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai in, a pawlpi tengteng a zahlak ding ua; na semmite leng mihingte lak a mi ahi uh: Avek un kikhawm vek uhenla, ding uhen; a lau ding ua, a zahlak khawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siksek in heipi a sek zel a, meihol ah a tholh a sek ding bang in a sek a, a ban hattak in a sek zel; ahi, a gil a hong kial a, tha a hong zoizel; tui a dawn kei a, a bah nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Singlem bawlmi in khau a kai gak a, pensil in a hi ding a bawl a, nawt mamna in a hih dingdan a bawl a, bem bawlna in a hi ding a bawl a, mihing lim bang in a bawl a, inn a om ding in mihing kilawmna bang in a bawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sidarsingte a kiphuk a, sesing leh tosaw a la a, gammang sing lak a khat amah tuam a om ding in a hihkip a; meilahsing a suan a, vuahtui in a vak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huainung in mi ading a mei a khul ding ahita ding; huai a kipan in a la a, a kihihlum zel; ahi, a kuangsak a, tanghou a haizel hi: ahi, pathian a bawl a, a be zel hi; huai sing pen milim bawltawm ding in a bawl a, huai khupboh in a bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai sing khenkhat mei ah a khul a; a khenkhat sa nekna ding in a zang a; sa a em a, a tai hi; ahi, mei lum a awi a, Nuam e, ka lumta, mei mel ka muta e, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A val pathian ding in a bawl a, a bawltawm milim mah: huai khupboh a bia a, a kiang ah a thum a, Hon hondam in, ka pathian lah na hi ngal a, a chi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A theikei ua, a ngaihtuah sam kei uh; aman lah a mit uh a mitsisakta ngal a; a theihsiam louhna ding un a lungtang uh leng a khaksakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in kuamah in a theikhe nawn kei ua, Khenkhat lah mei ah ka khul a; ahi, a am ah tanghou bang in ka hai a; sa leng ka em a, lah ka ne ngal a: a val thil kihhuai ding in ka bawl ding hia? Sing a suak khupboh in ka be ding hia? Hih ding in amau ah theihna leh theihsiamna a om tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vut kia a ne zel a: a lungtang khem a om in, a hinna a kihumbit theihlouhna ding leh, Ka khut taklam ah zuau a om ka hia? a chih theihlouhna ding in, amah a kalsuan sakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jakobte aw, huai thilte theihgige un, Israelte aw, nou leng theigige un ka sikhate lah na hi ngal ua; kei bawl na hi ua; ka sikhate na hi uh: Israelte aw, ka mangngilh in na omkei ding uhi. Toupa , bangkim siamtu leh hondampa
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na tatleknate uh meipi hihmang bang in ka hihmang ta a, na khelhnate uh mei hihmang bang in ka hihmang na lai hi; ka kiang ah hongkik nawn un, nou lah k’on tanta ngal a, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vante aw, nuamsatak in lasa un, Toupa’n lah huaite a hihta ngal a; lei nuailamte aw, kikou un, tangte aw, gamnuai leh asung a sing om chiteng aw, la sakhe guih un: Toupa’n Jakobte a tanta a, Israelte ah a kipahtawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa , noumau hontanpa, sul a kipan nou hon bawlpan hichi in a chi: Kei zaw Toupa , thil tengteng siampa, keimah kia a van kaipalhpa, liansakpa ka hi; kua ahia ka kiang a om?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kei lah zuautheite chiamtehnate bangmahlou a bawl a, aisansiamte mihai a bawlpa, mipilte nunglam ngasak a, a theihna uh haihuai a bawlpa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A sikha thu hihkip a, a palaite lemtheih tangtungsakpa, Jerusalem tungthu a, Huai ah mi a om nawn ding uh, chipa leh Judah gam khaw tungthu a, Bawl in a om nawn chiat ding uh, a siatna lailai ka bawl nawn ding, chipa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tui thuk mahmah kiang a, Kangtat in, na luite leng ka kangtat sak ding, chipa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kura tungthu a, amah zaw ka belamchingpa ahi a, Jerusalem tungthu a, Bawl in a om nawn ding, chih leh, Pathian biakin kiang a, Na suangphum lep in a om nawn ding, chi khop hial in ka deihlam tengteng a hih ding, chipa ka hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n a thaunilh, Kura, namte a ma a phukpai ding leh, kumpipate kawnggakte phelsak ding a, a ma a kongkhakte honsak ding leh, kulh kongkhakte khak louh a omsak dingpa, a khut taklam ka letpa kiang ah, hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei na ma ah ka pai ding a, a phok lailai ka kibang sak ding: dal kongkhak ka hihse vek ding a, a kalhna siktawnte ka tansak ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa , na min a hon sampa, Israelte Pathian ka hi chih na theihtheihna ding in mial lak a goute ka honpe ding a, mun dai a sum selte leng ka honpe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakobte ka sikhate leh Israelte ka telte ziak in na min in k’on sam a; honthei ngeikei mahle chin na min k’on phuahsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keimah Toupa ka hi, a dang himhim a omkei; keimah loungal Pathian a omkei: hon thei ngeikei mahle chin na tai k’on gaksak ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keimah loungal a dang a omkei chih ni suahna lam a kipan leh tumlam a kipan a theihtheihna ding un: kei Toupa ka hi, a dang himhim a omkei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vak ka bawl a, mial leng ka bawl hi; kituahna ka bawl a, gilou leng ka bawl hi; kei zaw Toupa , huchibang thilte hih zelpa ka hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vante aw, tunglam apan takkhe sak un, van dumte’n diktatna sung suk uhen: hotdamna a dotkhiak theihna ding un lei kihong henla, diktatna toh poukhawm hen; kei, Toupa’n huaite ka bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah Bawlpa kinakpih mi tung a gik hi! Bellei in a velmi kiang ah, Bangdia hon bawlna hia? A chi dia hia? Ahihkeileh, nna nasep in, A khut in siam a neikei? A chi dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pa kiang a, Bang suang na hia? chi mi tung hiam, a nu kiang a, bang ahia na suan ding? chi mi tung hiam a gik hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa , Israelte Mi Siangthou, amau Bawlpa’n hichi in a chi: Thil hong tung ding thu hon dong unla; ka tapate leh ka khut nasepte ah thu honpia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lei ka bawl a, a tung a mihing omte leng ka bawl a: keimah in ka khut ngei in, van ka kai palh a, a sepaihte thu ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kura diktatna nei in ka dingsak a, a lampite teng ka tangsak ding: aman ka khopi a bawl nawn ding a, a tatna man uh deih ziak in hilou in, kipahman deih ziak leng hilou in, ka salte a pawtsak ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi, Aigupta semgimte leh Ethiopia sumsinmi leh Saviate mi sang pipite na kiang uah a hongpai ding ua, nou adin a om ding ua; nou a honzui ding ua; khainiang bun in ahi a hongpai ding uh: huchi in khupboh in, Pathian noumau ah a om hi; a dang himhim a omkei, pathian dang himhim a omkei, chi in, a hong thum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israelte Pathian aw, Hondampa, Pathian kisel nakpa na hi ngut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zahlaktak in a om ding ua, ahi, avek un zumtak in a om ding uh: milim bawlmite zumna ah a lut ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israelte bel tangtawn hotdamna a Toupa hotdam in a om ding uh: tangtawn in na zahlak kei ding ua, na zumsak kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa van siampa’n, amah Pathian, lei bawl a siampa ahi; aman lei a kipsak a, bangmahlou din a bawl kei a, mihing omna ding in a bawl a, hichi in a chi ngal a: Kei Toupa ka hi; a dang a omkei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A guk in, mun mial ah, thu ka gen ngeikei a; Jakob suante kiang ah bangmahlou ding in honzong un, ka chi ngeikei: kei Toupa’n diktatna thu ka gen zel a, thudik mahmahte ka gen zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kikhawm unla hongpai un; namchih lak a gawtna pelte aw, hongpai nai chiat un: a sing milim bawltawm tawi a, mi hondam theiloupi pathian kiang a thum zelte’n theihna himhim a neikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gen unla, hon pawtkhe sak un; ahi, kidong uhenla: tuma siah a kipan kuan ahia theisak? Nidanglai a kipan kuan ahia gen? Kei Toupa’n ka hih ahi kei maw? Keimah loungal Pathian dang a omkei; Pathian diktat leh hondampa ka hi; keimah loungal a dang a omkei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kawlmong a mi tengteng aw, kei lam hong nga unla, hotdam in om un: kei lah Pathian ka hi ngal a, a dang himhim a omkei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khuk chih ka ma ah a khukdin ding a, lei chih in leng ka kiang ah kichiam in thu a chiam ding chi in kei leh kei kilou in ka kichiamta, thu lah diktatna in ka kam a kipan in a pawtta a, a hongkik nawnta kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Min, Toupa kia ah diktatna leh hatna a om, chi in, ka tanchin a gen ding uh: amah kiang ah mi a hongpai ding ua, a tung a lungkimlou tengteng zahlaktak in a omta ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel suan tengteng Toupa ah ahi, siamtansak a a om ua, Toupa a suan ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bel a kun a, Nebo a kihihniam a; a milimte gamsa leh gan tung ah a na omta ua: na thil vakpihte uh vanpuak a bawl ua, gamsa bah a ding in vanpuak gik dia bawl ahi lel hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A na kihihniam un, a na kun chiat ua, vanpuak gik lah a humbit thei ngal kei ua, amau mah sal a pi in a om zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jakob inkuanpihte leh, Israel inkuanpihte lak a omsun tengteng aw, gil a kipan k’on puak a, sul apan a ka kithuahpihte aw, ka thu ngaikhia un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tekkun a na omtanpha un leng amah ka hi ding a, na lu ua kelsam a pou vek hun chiang in leng k’on pom ding hi: ken ka bawl a, keimahmah in ka paw ding; ahi, ken ka pom ding a, ka humbit ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kibang a seh ka hihna ding un kua toh n’on teh a, kua kimpih in n’on bawl a, kua toh n’on teh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zaip a kipan dangkaeng bungkhe zel dangka bukna a buk zelte’n, dangkaeng sekmi a chial ua, aman pathian in a bawl a, huchi in, a khupboh ua, ahi, a be zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A liangzang uah a pua ua, a paipih ua, a omna a kipan a suan nawn kei ding: ahi, min amah a sam ding ua, himahleh a dawng theikei ding, a mangbatna ua kipan a honkhe theikei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Talekmite aw, huai theigige unla, kipasal sak unla, theikhe nawn un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nidang a thil masate theigige un: kei Pathian ka hi a, a dang a omkei uh; kei Pathian ka hi, kei bang a omkei uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ken a tawpna ding uh a tung a kipan in ka gen a; pha ka sak a ding suak ding a, ka deihlam tengteng ka hihvek ding, ka chi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suahlam a kipan vasa duhgawl, gamlapi a an in ka miseh ka sam ding a; ahi, ka genta, ka tangtung sak ding; ka na tumta, ka hih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungsim kiuangsak, diktatna toh kigamlate aw, ka thu ngaikhia un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka diktatna ka hontawi nai a, gamla ah a omkei ding, ka hotdamna in leng sawt a hal kei ding; huchi in ka thupina Israelte ading in hotdamna Zion ah ka koih ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon tanu nungak aw, hongsuk inla, leivui ah tu in; Kaldai tanu aw, mangtutphah lou ah lei ah tu in: awm nou leh nuamsa honchi nawn lou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Buhgawizanna suangte la inla, tangbuang bawl in: na kikhuhna puan koih inla, na tentual lem inla, na khe hong inla, luite ngap galkah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na vuaktanna khuhlouh in a om ding a, ahi, na zahmoh a dawk ding: phu ka la ding a, mi kuamah ka kithuahpih kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hontanpa, a min sepaihte Toupa ahi, Israelte Mi Siangthou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kaldai tanu aw, daidide in tu inla, mial nuai ah lut in, Gamchih lalnu hon chita kei ding uh Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite tung ah ka heh a, ka goutan ka hih thanghuai a, na khut ah k’on pia hi: nang a tung uah hehpihna na langsak kei a; teklamte tung ah nangawn ah na hakkol giktak na nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei tangtawn in lalnu ding in ka om ding, na chi a: huchi in huai thilte na lungsim in na ngaihtuah kei a, a tawpna ding na theigige sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in nang nuamtat a om, awlmoh neilou a om, lungsim a, Keimah ka hi, keimah lou midang a omkei uh, meithai in ka tu kei ding a, tate tan thu ka thei sam kei ding, chinu, hiai thei in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai thil nih, tate tanna leh meithaina in, ni khat thu in mitphiatkal lou in a honpha ding a: na bumna zatna tamngial in, na kivenna tamkuam mahleh, huaite nakpitak in na tung ah a hongtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na gitlouhna muang a; Kuamah in hon muse kei uh, na chi vial ngal a; na pilna leh na theihna in hon hihsia hi: Keimah ka hi, kei lou midang a omkei, na lungsim in na chibehlap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in thil hoihlou na tung ah a hongtung dia; na veng siamkei ding: vangtahna in a hon buak ding a; huai na hihmang theikei ding: siatna leng thakhat in na tung ah hongtung guih ding a; huai na theikhol kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kikauna leh bumna na zatna, naupang nou na hih a kipan a na kisukgimnate, dinpih inla; na phattuampih theih ding phot a, na zohpih theih ding phot leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na lemtheihna a tam mahmah ziak in na gimta hi: tuin van thutheite, aksi enmite, kha teng a thugenkholmite ding uhenla, na tung a thil hongtung dingte lak a kipan in hon hong uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai in, buhpawl banglel ahi ding ua; mei in a kang ding; meikuang thilhihtheihna lak a kipan a kihumbit kei ding uh: hihlumna ding meihol bang ahi kei ding a, awi ding mei bang ahi sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchibang in na kihihgim nakna thilte nang ading in a om ding uhi: na naupan nou a kipan a na lak a sumsinmite amau lampi chiat ah a vak mang ding ua; hon humbit ding kuamah himhim a omkei ding uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Jakob inkuan, Aw Israel min kikoppih, Judah tuite apan a pawt, thutak hilou, diktatna ah hi sam lou, Toupa minlou a kichiam a, Israelte Pathian min lou zelte aw, hiai ngaikhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khopi siangthou a mi a kichi ngal ua, Israel Pathian tung ah ginna a nga ua; A min sepaihte Toupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tung a kipan in thil masate ka gen a; ahi, ka kam a kipan in a pawt a, ka theisak a; thakhat in ka tangtung sak guih a, a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi genhak na hi uh, na ngawng uh sik tha ahi, na tal uh dal ahi chih ka theih ziak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nidanglai a kipan na kiang uah ka genta; a hongtun ma in na kiang uah k’on theisakta hi: huchilou in zaw, Ka milim in a hih ahi, ka milim bawltawm leh ka milim sun in thu a piak ahi, na chi kha ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na zata uh; hiaite tengteng en un; noumau na genta kei ding ua hia? Tua kipan in thil thak k’on theisak ding a, thil kisel na theih ngeilouhte uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaite nidanglai a siam hilou in, tu a siam ahi; tuni ma in na bil un na za ngeikei uh; huchilou in zaw, Ngai in, huaite i theihsa ahi, na chi kha ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi, na bil un na za ngeikei ua; ahi, na lungsim un na thei ngeikei uh, ahi, nidanglai a kipan in na bil uh hon in a om ngeikei him hi: lepchiahtak in na hihzel uh chih leh, sul a kipan in talekmi a honchi him uh chih lah ka thei ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />K’on hihman louhna ding in ka min ziak in ka hehna ka hawi lai ding a, phat ka lohna ding in na tung uah ka kidek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai un, k’on hihsiang ahi, himahleh dangka hihsiang bang in ahi kei; haksatna haltuina mei ah k’on chian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei leh kei ziak in, ahi, kei leh kei ziak lel in ahi ka hih ding; bang ding in ka min suksiat in a om dia? Ka thupina midang kiang ah ka pe kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jakobte leh ka sap Israel aw, ka thu ngaikhia un: kei amah ka hi; a masapen ka hi, a nanungpen leng ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi, ka khut in lei kingakna a phum a, ka khut taklam in a vante a kaipalh a: ka sap tak in a ding khawm zel uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Noute aw, kikhawm unla, ngaikhia un; a lak uah kuan hiai thil a gen dia? Toupa’n amah a it a: aman Babulon tung ah a deihlam a hih ding a, a ban Kaldaite tung ah lik in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei, keimah ngei in, thu ka genta; ahi, amah ka sam a, ka pi a, a lampi zangsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Noute’n honnaih unla, hiai ngaikhia un; a tung a kipan in a sim in thu ka gen ngeikei; a om tung lai a kipan in huai ah ka om: tuin Toupa Pathian in kei leh a Kha a honsawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa , nou hontanpa, Israelte Mi Siangthou in hichi in a chi: Kei, Toupa na Pathian uh, na hoihna ding ua honchilpa, na paina ding lampi ua honpipa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw noute’n ka thupiakte na ngaikheta hi le uchin, na tung ua lemna lui bang mai a om ding a, na diktatna uh tuipi kihawtte bang mai a om ding hi ven maw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na suante uh piaunel zah pha ding ua, na gil ua gahte leng piaunel mal neu chikchik zah a pha ding ua; a min uh ka ma a kipan thaimang in a omkei ding, hihman in leng a omsam kei ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babulon a kipan pawt unla, Kaldaite taimang san un; hiai lasak husa in genzak in, hilh unla, kawlmong pha in gingsak un, Toupa’n a sikha Jakobte a tanta, chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gamdai a a pi lai in a dangtak kei ua: suangpi apan in amau ading in tuite a luangkhe sak a: suangpi a phelkhap a, huchi in tui a hong pawtkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n , mi thulimloute ading in muanna himhim a omkei, a chi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuikulh a te aw, ka thu ngaikhia unla, gamlapi a michih aw, ngaikhia un: Toupa’n sul apan a honsap ka hi; ka nu gilsung apan in ka min a genta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka kam namsau hiam bang in a bawl a, a khut ah a honsel a; thal nawttet vilvel in honbawl a, a thalbawm ah a honkhum a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kiang ah, Nang zaw ka sikha na hi; Israel pahtawi a ka omna ding, na hi, a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ken bel, a thawn in ka semgim a, bangmahlou ding leh huihkhua lel ding in ka thapai: himahleh pellou in ka tung a vaihawmna ding Toupa kiang ah ahi a om, hon ditna ding leng ka Pathian kiang ah ahi a om, ka chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan, tuin Toupa , Jakobte a kiang a pi nawnna ding leh, Israelte a kiang a pikhawm a a omna ding un, a sikha a om ding a sul a kipan a hon bawlpan a gen, Toupa mitmuh in mi zahtakhuai ka hi ngal a, ka Pathian ka hatna ahi behlap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi, aman, Jakob namte tundingna ding leh Israelte lak a humbitte a omsak nawnna ding in, ka sikha a na omzaw, thil neuchik mahmah a hilai: Jentelte vaksakpa ding in k’on sep ding, kawlmong pha a hondampa dia na om theihna ding in, a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa , Israelte tanpa leh a Mi Siangthou un, mite muhsitpa, namte kih tuntun, vaihawmmite sikha kiang ah hichi in a chi: Muanhuai Toupa , Israelte Mi Siangthou, nang hontelpa ziak in Kumpipate’n a mu ding ua, a thou ding uh; mi liante’n amah a be ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi, Hun kipahhuai ah k’on dawng a, hotdamna ni ah k’on panpih hi; k’on hawi ding a, mipite thukhunna ding in k’on pe ding, lei ding kipsak a, gouluah nutsiatsa luahsak ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suangkulh tangte kiang a, Pawt un, mial a omte kiang a, Hong kilang un, na chih theihna ding in. Lampite ah a ne zel ding ua, tangsang mai pengpong te ah a tatna mun uh a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A gilkial un a dangtak kei ding ua; kholum a bawlgim in ni in leng a hai sam kei ding hi: amaute itpa in a pi ding a, tui naknei kiang ah a pi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in ka tang tengteng lampi din ka bawl ding a, ka lamliante leng sansak in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />En in, hiaite gamlapi a kipan in a hongpai ding ua; en in hiaite mallam a kipante, tumlam a kipante in a hongpai ding uh; Sinim gam a kipan in a hongpai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vante aw, nuamtak in lasa un; lei aw, nuamsa in om in; tangte aw, lasa khe guih un: Toupa’n lah a mite a lungmuan ngal a, a mi haksa thuakte leng a hehpih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh Zion in, Jehovah in a hon paisan a, Toupa’n a hon mangngilhta, a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Numei in a tapa, a gilgah ngei, hehpih louhna ding in a nau nawinelai a mangngilh thei ahia! Thei e, huaite’n zaw a mangngilh uh ahi thei, himahleh ken zaw k’on mangngilh kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />En in, ka khutpek ah k’on gelh a; na kulhbangte ka ma ah a om gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na tate a kin ua, hon hihmang mite leh hon hihsemite’n a hon pawtsan ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dak inla, en vialvial inla, en in: hiai tengteng a kikhawm ua, na kiang ah a hongpai uhi. Ka hinna lou in, Nang pahtawina kisilh bang in hiaite na kisilh a, mou a kigak bang in hiaite in na kigak ngei ding, Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na mun sia leh nutsiatsate leh na gam hihmansa thu zaw tuin a omte ading in na neu lawta ngeingei ding a, nang honvalhte gamlapi ah a omta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na ta mansak nung a na ta neih nawnte’n, Mun kei ading in a neu lua a: ka omna ding in mun honpia in, chi in, na bil ah a hon gen ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in nang na lungsim in; Hiaite kuan hon suaksak ua eita? Ka tate ka mangsak a, keimah kia sal a, vialvak ka hi a: huchi in hiaite kuan a kem ua eita? Ngai in, keimah kia a nutsiat in ka om ngal a, hiaite koi a na om uh ahia? na chi ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi, Ngai in, namchih ading in khut ka zak in, mi chih ading in ka chiamtehna ka tak khe ding: huchi in na tapate angpom in na kiang ah a honpi ding ua, na tanute leng liangkawlou a suan a pi in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpipate na tate donpate ahi ding ua, kumpinute na tate donnu ahi ding uh: amau a mai ua leisi in a hon be ding ua, na khe a leivui a liak ding uh; huchi in kei Toupa ka hi chih na thei mai ding, hon ngakmite zahlak in a omkei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gallakte mi hattak a kipan suh a om in, sal lauhuaite hotkhiak in a om ding uam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Om nake, Toupa’n hichi in a chi, Mi hattak salte suh in a om ding ua, mi lauhuai gallakte hotkhiak in a om ding: nang hondoute dou ding ka hi ngal a, na tate leng ka hondam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang hon simmohte amau sa ka nesak ding; uain khum kham bang in amau sisan a kham ding uh: huchi in mi tengteng in, kei Toupa nangmah Hondampa leh nangmah Tanpa, Jakob Mi Hat ka hi chih, a thei ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi, Na nu uh makna lai, ka makna, kaw om ahia? Ahihkeileh, ka leibatnate a kuapen kiang ah ahia k’on zuaktak? Ngai un, na thulimlouhnate uh ziak a na nu uh mak a om ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bang ziak in ahia ka hongpai a mi himhim a omlouh uh? Bangziak in ahia ka sap a hon dawng ding omlouh uh? Ka khut tan theilou ding a tomsak in a om himhim ahia? Ahihkeileh, humbit ding in thilhihtheihna ka nei ka hia? Ngai un, ka salhna in tuipi ka kangsak a, luipite gamkeu in ka bawl hi: tui himhim a omlouh ziak in a ngasate a uih a, dangtak in a si uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Van mial in ka thuam a, saiip puan a khuhna ding in ka bawl zel, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi gimtak thu a ka tawldamsak siamna ding in sinsakte lei Toupa Pathian in a honpia: aman zingsang teng a phawng in, sinsakte a theih bang ua thei ding in ka bil a phawng zel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in ka bil a hon vangsak a, kei zaw ka hel kei, ka lehngat sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nungzang satmite ka doh a, ka biang mul botmite ka doh hi; zahlakna ah leh chilsiatna ah ka mai ka sel kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in a hon panpih ding a; huaiziak in ka zum kei a: huaiziak in meisahsuang bang in ka nga zel a, ka zahlak kei ding chih ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siam hon tangsakpa a nai hi; kuan ahia hondou ding? Ding khawm ni ung: hondou kua ahia? Honnaih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa Pathian in hon panpih ding; kuan ahia siamlouh hontang sak ding? Ngai in, huaite puansilh bang in a lui ding ua, kausi in a nese ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lak ua, Toupa kihta a, a sikha thumang, kua ahia? Mial a vak a, vakna himhim neilou in Toupa min muang henla, a Pathian ah kinga hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mei toh a, mei ekte a ki umte aw, ngai un: na mei kuang uah leh na mei ek halte u lak ah vak un. Hiai ka khut a kipan a na muh ding uh ahi hi: lungkham tak a na lupna ding uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Diktatna delh mite, Nou, Toupa zong mite aw, ka thu ngaikhia un: noute sekna suangpi lam leh noute tohkhiakna kawkhuk lam en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na pu uh Abraham lam leh noute hon suangnu Sarah lam en un: khat kia a hih lai in ka sam a, ka vualzawl a, mi tampi ding in ka bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na Toupa’n Zion a luangmuanta ngal a: a mun sesate tengteng a lungmuan a, a gamdai Eden bang in a bawl a, a gamkeu leng Toupa huan bang in a bawl hi; huai ah kipahna leh nopsaknate, kipahthugenna leh lasak husate a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mite aw, ka thu ngaikhia unla; ka namte aw, ka thu bil na doh un: kei apan in danthu a hongpawt ding a, michih vakna ding in ka vaihawmna ka kipsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka diktatna a nai a, ka hotdamna a pawtta, ka bante’n michih vai a hawmsak ding, tuikulhgamte’n a hon ngak ding ua, ka ban a muang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vanlam ah daktou unla, nuailam ah lei en un: van meikhu bang in a zammang ding a, lei puansilh bang in a lui ding, asung a omte huchi bang in a si ding uh: ka hotdamna bel tangtawn in a om ding, ka diktatna leng hihman in a omkei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Diktatna theimi, ka danthu lungtang a pai mite aw, ka thu ngaikhia un; mihing gensiatna lau kei unla, a hon tainate uh ziak in lunghimawh kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sim in puansilh a negawp vek bang in, amau a negawp vek ding, nget in samul a ne bang in, amau a ne ding: ka diktatna tangtawn in a om ding a, ka hotdamna suan tengteng tan in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na Toupa ban aw, halh inla, hatna kisilh in; nidanglai a, tang a suante omlai a na halh bang in halh in. Nang Rahab satzanpa, dragon sunpa na hi ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang tuipi, tui thuk zapi tui kangsakpa, tuipi taw tatte kanna lampi dia bawlsakpa na hi ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa tatsate a kiknawn ding ua, lasa kawm in Zion a tung ding ua; tangtawn a kipahna a lu tung uah a omta ding; kipahna leh nopsakna a mu ding ua, lungkhamna leh mauna a mangta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei, kei mahmah, nou lungmuanpa ka hi: si ding mihing kihta ding, loupa bang a bawl ding mihing tapa kihta ding nang kua na hi hiam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na Toupa nang hon Bawlpa, van kaipalh a lei kingaknate phumpa, mangngilh a, nuaisiahmi hihse ding a a ngimlai hehna ziak lel a nitum a lau? Nuaisiahmi hehna koi a om ahita a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sal pimang kintak a khah in a om ding a, suangkul ah a si kei dia, an nekding a tasam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei na Toupa na Pathian, tuipi kihot ging honhonte khen a tuipi tokletpa ka hi ngal a: ka min sepaihte Toupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Van ka kaihpalh a, lei kingaknate ka phum theih a, Zionte kiang a, ka mite na hi uh, ka chih theihna ding in ka thute na kam ah ka koih a, ka khut in ka honhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, Na Toupa khut a kipan a hehna nou dawnnu, halh inla, thou in; nang hoihoina nou a nengte na dawn a, na dawn siang sipsip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A tapa suan tengteng lak a pi ding kuamah a omkei ua; a tapa vaklet teng lak ah a khut a len kuamah a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hiai thil nihte’n a honphat ahi; kuan a hon kahpih ding ua? Gamna, leh siatna leh kial, leh namsau: bangchi in k’on lungmuan diam aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na tapate a bah ua, sathak len a awk bang in, kongzing lu lam ah a lum uhi; Toupa hehna leh na Pathian salhna in a dim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huaiziak in, nang hihgentheih leh uain kham hilou a mi kham, hiai za in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na Toupa Jehovah, na Pathian, a mite thu genpih pa’n, hichi in a chi, Ngai in, hoihoina nou, ka hehna nou belhbu ngei, na khut a kipan ka lakheta; na dawn nawnta kei ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in nang hon hihgentheite khut ah ka koih ding; amau na hinna kiang ah, K’on tot ding un khupboh un, a chi uh: huchi in a tawnmite kiang ah na nungzang lei leh kongzing bang in na doh, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion aw, halh in, halh in, na hatna silh in; Jerusalem aw, khopi siangthou, na puansilh kilawmtakte silh in: tuban zeksumlouh leh mi nin na sung ah a lutta kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, na tung a bang leivui sing in; thou inla, tu in: Zion tanu aw, sal a om, na ngawng gaknate phel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi ngal a: Bangmahlou a zuak na hi ua; huchi in dangka lou a tat na hita ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi, Ka mite a tung in Aigupta gam a om ding in a paisuk ua: Assuria mite’n a thu a la bei in a nuaisiah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in tuin, hiai ah bang ka hihdia? Ka mite bangmahlou a pimang in a om ua, Toupa’n a chi. A tung ua vaihawmmite nuam in a awng ua, Toupa’n a chi, ka min ni tumtum a gensiat in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka mite’n ka min a thei ding uh: huai ni’n a genpa ka hi chih a thei ding ua; ngai in, keimah ka hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tangte a tanchinhoih tun a, lemna thu tangkoupih a, thil hoih tanchinhoih tun a, hotdamna thu tangkoupih a, Zion kiang a, Na Pathian kumpi in a tu, chi mi khe a kilawm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua! na galvilmite aw! Aw a suah ua, nuamsatak in la a sa chiat uh; Toupa Zion a a hong kiknawn chiang in kimatuah a mu ding ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem mun sesate aw, nuamsa kheguih unla, nuamsatak in la sa un: Toupa’n a mite a lungmuanta a, Jerusalem a tanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n nam chiteng mitmuh in a ban siangthou a lemta; huchi in kawlmong a mi tengteng in i Pathian hotdamna a mu ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawt un, pawt un, huai a kipan in pawt un, thil nin himhim lawng kei un; asung a kipan paikhia un; Toupa belsuan tawite aw, siangthou tak in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kintak in na paikhe kei ding ua, taikek in na pai sam kei ding uh: Toupa’n na ma uh pi ding ahi ngal a; Israelte Pathian na nungdal uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai in, ka sikha in piltak in a hih ding, pahtawi leh tawisang in a om ding a, sangpi in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi tampi’n lamdang honsak bang un, a mel mihing mel sang in a siatsak ahi a, a piandan lah mihing tate piandan sang mah a hihsiat in a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in aman nam tampi tung ah sisan a theh ding; Kumpipate’n amah lak ah a kam uh a chih ding uh: a kiang ua gen ngeilouh a mu ding ua; bil a a zak ngeilouh uh a ngaisiam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I thugen uh kuan a um a? Toupa khut kua kiang ah ahia a kihil?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ma ah thilpou noutak bang in amah lah a dawnkhia, lei keu apan zung bang in a khangkhia hi: piandan hoihna leh mel kilawmna a neikei a; amah i muh un amah i deihna ding un kilawmna a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah mihingte muhsit leh deihlouh in a om a; dahnate neimi leh natna theimi ahi a; amah lak a i mai uh sel bang i hi ua, muhsit in a om a, en lah amah i ngaisang tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman i natnate pua in, i dahnate a pua a: himahleh en bel dahna khu, Pathian vuak, hihgentheih in i bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh i tatleknate ziak in amah liam in a om a, i thulimlouhnate ziak in vuak sidup in a om a: i lungmuanna ding in sawina a tung ah a kia a; a vuakna golhte a hihdam in i omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I vek un belam bang in i vakmang ua; eimah lampi tuam chiat uah i pialta uh; Toupa’n amah tung ah i vek ua thulimlouhna a nga ta hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah nuaisiah in a om a, himahleh a kingainiam a, a kam a ka kei; belamnou goh ding a pi uh bang leh, belam a mulmetmite ma a a daidide bang mai in; ahi, a kam a ka kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nuaisiahna leh vaihawmna a lakmang in a om a; a dam tonpihte’n houh kua in ahia mihing gam a kipan hihman a a om ngaihtuah mahmah? Ka mite tatlekna ziak a dahna khu a hih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan, hiamgam a hih ngeikei a, a kam ah zekhemna om ngeikei mahleh, a han migiloute kiang ah a sehsak ua, a sih nung in mihausa kiang ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n , amah vuak sidup a ut him ahi; a dahsakta ngei a: a hinna khelhna adia thillat dia na zat peuhpeuh chiang in, a chisuan a muta ding a, a damsung nite a sausak ding, Toupa deihlam a khut ah lohching in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kha nauvei gim gah a mu ding a, A lungkimta ding: ka sikha diktattak in a theihna’n mi tampi’n siamtang ding a, a thulimlouhnate uh a puaksak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in miliante tantuan amah ka hawm ding a, gallak sumte aman mi hatte a hawm sam ding hi; a hinna pen si khop hial a A sun buak a, talekte lak a simtel a a om ziak in: himahleh mi tampi khelhna a pua a, talekte a thumsak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ching, nang tanei ngeilou, nuamsatak in la sa in; nang, nauvei ngeilou, la sakhe guih in, kikou khia in: pasal neimi tate sang in lunglengnu tate lah a tam zaw ngal ua, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na puanin mun kek in, na omnate puanin tung kaipalh in; chil ken: na khaute sausak inla, na kaihgakna khette kipsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Taklam leh veilam ah na dalhza ding a; huchi in na chisuante’n namchih gou a luah ding ua, khopi loih sa nungte ah mi a omsak nawn ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lau ken, na zahlak kei ding hi; zum sam ken, na zahlak kei ding: na tuailai zahlakna na mangngilh in, na meithaina minsiatna na theigigeta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang hon bawlpa na pasal ahi a; a min sepaihte Toupa , Israelte Mi Siangthou nang hontanpa ahi; amah khovel tengteng Pathian a chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zi mak lungsim a lungkham tak, tuailai zi khensa, paihsa nung sapnawn bang in Toupa’n nang a honsam ahi, na Pathian in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mitphiatkal lel ka honma a; himahleh hehpihna thupitak in k’on pi nawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka heh dimlet in mitphiatkal na lak ah ka mai ka sel a; himahleh tangtawn chitna in k’on hehpih ding, Toupa nang Hontanpa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai lah kei ading in Noah damlai nite bang ahi a: Noah tuite’n leitung a tummang nawn kei ding, chi a, ka kichiam bang in, Na tung ah ka heh nawn kei ding a, k’on sal n’on kei ding chi in, ka kichiamta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangliante a paimang ding ua, tang neute leng suan in a om ding uh; ka chitna ahihleh nang a kipan in a pai mang kei ding a, ka lemna thukhun leng suan in a omsam kei ding, Toupa hon hehpihpa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw nang hihgentheih, tuikihawt sepsep, lungmuanna neilou, ngai in na suangte zehoih in ka lem ding, na suangphumte sapphir suang in ka lem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na tungzumte rubi suang in, na kongkhakte karbankul suang in, na kulh tengteng suang hoihte in ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na ta tengteng Toupa chil in a om ding ua; na tate lungmuanna thupitak ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Diktatna a kipsak in na om ding a, nuaisiahna apan gamlapi ah na om ding, na lau kei ding hi; thil mulkimhuai apan gamlapi ah na om ding a, a honnaih kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai in, a hong kikhawm uh ahi thei, himahleh ka thu ahi kei ding: nang sual ding a kikhawm peuhmahte nang ziak in a puk ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai in, ken siksekmi pumzap a nasepna ding vanzat sek zelmi ka siam a; kei mahmah hihse ding in hihsemi ka siam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang sualna ding a vanzat sek himhim a phatuam kei ding; lei chih thubuai a nang honlang siamlouh na tangsak ding a, Huai Toupa sikhate goutan ahi a, a diktatna uh ka kiang a kipan ahi. Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai un, dangtak peuhmahte aw, tuite ah hongpai un, dangka neiloute; hongpai unla, lei unla ne un! Ahi, hongpai unla, uain leh nawitui dangka pe lou in, a man leng pe lou in lei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An hiloupi a bang ding a dangka pai? Niang leh taina hilou a bang ding a na tha uh pai? Ka thu hoihtak in ngaikhia unla, thil hoih ne un, na hinna uh thil thau in nuamsa hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na bildoh unla, ka kiang ah hongpai un; za unla, huchi in na hinna uh a hing ding: na kiang uah tangtawn thu ka khung ding, David kiang a huai hehpihna chiamte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, mi chih ading in amah palai in ka sep a, michih ading in pipa leh heutu in ka sep ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai in, na theih ngeilouh na sam ding a, nang hon thei ngeilou nam na kiang ah hongtai ding uh, Toupa na Pathian ziak leh Israelte Mi Siangthou ziak in; aman a hon pahtawi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Muh theih a a omlai in Toupa zong unla, a nai lai in sam un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Migilou in a omdan tawpsan henla, mi diktatlou in a ngaihtuahnate tawpsan sam hen: Toupa kiang ah kiknawn hen, huchi in aman a na hehpih ding; I Pathian kiang uah kiknawn hen, aman a ngaidam mahmah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ngaihtuahte na ngaihtuahte ahi kei a, na omdante leng ka omdan ahi sam kei, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Van lei sang a a sangzaw bang in, ka omdante na omdan sang in a sangzaw hi, ka ngaihtuahte leng na ngaihtuahte uh sang in a sang lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vuah leh vuk van a kipan a zu a, huailam ah a kiktou ngeikei, lei a vak zaw hi, thil a pousak in a dawn sak a, buh chi thehmi kiang ah buh chi a pia a, nemi kiang ah nekding a pe zel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in ka kam a kipan ka thupawt a om ding: bangmah hih neilou in ka kiang ah a kiknawn kei ding a, ka deih bang a hihzou zaw ding a, thilhih ding a ka sawlna ah leng a lohching ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nuamsa tak a pawt in, lungmuangtak a pikhiak a om ding na hi ngal ua: tangliante leh tang neute’n na ma uah la a sa khe guih ding uh, gamlak sing tengteng in leng a khut uh a beng ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Loulingnei tang in meilah a pou zaw ding a, khaulingnei tang in muising a pou zaw ding: huai Toupa min hoihna ding leh tangtawn chiamtehna hihman a omlou ding ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi, Vaihawm zui unla, diktak in hih un: ka hotdamna a hong tungdek in, ka diktatna a hong tungdekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchibang hihmi leh, huaitak pomgeih mihing tapa in nuam a sa hi; khawlni tanglou lou a, tangzel leh, hoihlou hihlou ding a khut venghoih zel mi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan gamdang mi, Toupa toh kizommi in, Toupa’n a mite lak ah hon hihtuam ding, chi kei leh: michilgeh in, En in, singkeu ka hi, chi sam kei leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka khawlnite tang a, ka kipahpihlam thilte tel a, ka thukhun pomkip michilgehte tungtang thu ah Toupa’n hichi in a chi ngal a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kiang uah ka inn sung leh ka kulh sungte a tanu leh tapa neite sang mah in theihgigena hoihzaw leh min hoih zaw ka pe ding; a kiang uah tangtawn min, hihman nawn louh ding, ka pe ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gamdang mite leng, khawlni tanglou lou a, tang zel leh, ka thukhun pomkip peuhmah, Toupa nasem ding leh, Toupa min it ding leh, a sikhate a om ding a Toupa toh kizom peuhmahte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute mah ka tang siangthou ah ka pi ding a, ka thumna inn ah nuam ka sasak ding; haltum a a thillatte uleh a kithoihnate uh ka maitam a kipahpih in a om ding: ka inn mi chih ading a thumna inn chi ding uh ahi ngal a, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa Pathian, delhkhiak Israelte pi khawmpa’n, Amah a pikhawm a omte lou leng namdangte a kiang ah ka pikhawm lai ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamsa tengteng aw, ahi, gam nuai a sa om tengteng aw, ne ding in hongpai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A galvilmite a mit uh a taw a, theihna neilou ngen ahi ua; ui aw neilou ngen ahi ua, a na theikei uh; mang nei a, lum gige a, lup hai mi ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi, amaute uite huaihamtak ahi ua; hunsak chih a nei ngeikei uh; theihsiamna neilou belampu ahi ua, amau lampi pi, amau punna lam chiat, a nga ua, avek pi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hongpai un, uain ka la ding a huchi in zu in i kithundim ding; zingchiang tuni bang ahi nawn ding a, ni thupi mahmah ahi ding, a chi chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi diktat a mang zel ua, kuamah in a lungsim un a ngaihtuah kei uh, Pathian limsakmite lakmang in a om ua, mi diktat thil hoihlou hongtung ding a kipan lakmang ahi uh chih kuamah in a ngaihtuah kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungmuanna ah a lut ua; a lupnate uahte a lum tawldam zel uh, diktak a pai peuhmahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh nou bumsiamnu tapa, angkawm leh kizuak suante aw, hiai ah honnaih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nuihzabawlna dia na zat zel uh kua eita? Kua na maiphen khum ua, na leikhat khum ua? Tatlekna ta, zuautheihna suante na hi kei u maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nou tosaw lak a, singbuk nuai teng a milimte toh kithoh a suangpi kawllak nuai a guam sung a naupang that zelte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lui guam suang mam lak ah na tantuan a om a; huaite, huaite ngeingei na tantuan ahi: huaite ading in dawn thillat na sung a, thil piak na lan hi. Huai thil ah hih lungkim in ka om ding hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tang sang zou mahmah tung ah na lupna na koih a: huailai mah ah kithoihna lan ding in na hohtou zel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan, kongkhakte leh kongbiang liahte ah na theihgigena na tung a: kei din hilou in midang din na kisuah a, na hohtou ngal a; na lupna na kek a, a kiang uah thu na khung a; a lupna uh lah na muhna ah na it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan, sathau toh kumpipa kiang ah na hoh a, na gimlimte lah na bawl thupi diakdiak a, na palaite gamlapi ah na sawl a, sheol pha hial in na niamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na paina lampi sau ziak in na gim a; himahleh, Lametna himhim a omkei, na chi ngal kei a: na hatna halhsakna na mu a: huaiziak in na bahta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kua na kihta in na lau, zuau na gen nak a, kei n’on theihtak louh a, na lungsim a na ngaihtuah taklouh mai? Sawtpi ka daidide kei maw? Kihtak leng n’on kihtak louh, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na diktatna leh na thilhihte ka gen ding; bangmah lah na lohtak kei dia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kikou chiang in na lak khawmte’n hon humbit uheh; himahleh huih in amau a la ding a, hu in a mut vek ding: kei honmuang in bel gam a nei ding a, ka tang siangthou a luah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman, “Sung vum un, sungvum un, lampi bawl un, ka mite lampi bawl un, ka mite lampi a kipan pukna ding pai un,” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi tungnung, tawisang, tangtawn a om, a min Siangthou in hichi in a chi ngal a: “Kei mun tungnung leh siangthou ah ka om a, mi thunuailutte lungsim hihhalh ding leh kisik tuntunte lungtang hihhalh ding in mi lungsim a kisik tuntun a thunuailut tak kiang ah leng ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tangtawn a doulou ding ka hi, ka heh gige sam kei ding hi: huchikeileh mi lungsim ka ma ah a bah ding a, hinna ka bawlte leng a bah ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A huaiham a a thulimlouhna ziak in ka heh a, ka sat a, ka mai ka hum a, ka heh ahi: amah lah a lungtang omdan ngeingei in paupengtak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A omdante ka mu a, amah ka damsak ding: ka pi ding a, amah leh a sunpihmite kiang ah lungmuanna ka pe nawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ken muk gah ka bawl; Lemna, lemna, gamlapi a om kiang ah leh naichik a om kiang ah om hen, Toupa’n a chi, amah ka damsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi thulimloute bel tuipi kihot gige bang ahi uh; a om kinken thei ngeikei a, a tuite’n lah nin leh buannawi a vikkhe zel uh,” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka Pathian in, “Mi thulimloute ading in muanna himhim a omkei,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngaihtak in kikou in, kidam ken, pengkul bang in na aw suaksak loloih inla, ka mite kiang ah a tatlekna uh hilh inla, Jakob inkuanpihte kiang ah a khelhnate uh hilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zon zaw niteng in a honzong zel ua, ka lampi thute theih a kilawp ua: diktat tak a hih leh a Pathian uh vaihawmna tawpsan ngeilou nam bang in ka kiang ah vaihawmna diktat a hon ngen ua, Pathian naih leng a kilawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangziak in ahia an ka ngawl ua, na muhlouh? Bangziak in ahia ka kihihgentheih ua, na theihlouh? a chi nak uhi. Ngai un, na anngawl ni un noumau nuamsakna na bawl ua, na nasemmite tengteng na nuaisiah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai un, kihoutheihlouh leh kiselna ding leh, thulimlouhna khuttum a kitum ding in ahi, an na ngawl nak uh: na aw uh tunglam a zak ding in hiai ni’n an na ngawl ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchibang anngawlna ka deihlam ahi hia? Mi a kihihgentheihna ni ding uh ahi maw? Sialluang bang a a lu kun ding leh, a nuai a saiip puan phah a vut buah ding hia? Huaite anngawlna Toupa ading a ni kipahhuai na chi ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai anngawlna ka deih lam ahi kei maw? Thulimlouhna a gakna phelsak leh, hakkol khaute sutsak leh, nuaisiahte pawtsak leh, hakkol chiteng hihtan sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na an mi gilkialte kiang a hawm leh, genthei delhkhiakte na inn a pi ahi kei maw? Mi vuaktang muh a puan piak leh, nangmah tanaute a kipan a kisel louh ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in na vak zing nisuak bang in a hongsuak ding a, na damna ding a hong poukhe zok ding: na diktatna in na ma a kai ding a; Toupa thupina na nungdal ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in na sam ding a, huchi in Toupa’n a hon dawng ding; na kikou ding a, huchi in aman, “Hiai ah ka om,” a chi ding. Na lak ua kipan a hakkolte khutzung a mikawkte, mawkpaute na hihman a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gilkialte kiang a na deihlam pia a, hihgentheih mi na taisak leh, na vak mial lak ah a vakkhe ding a, na mial bikbek sun bang ahita ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n a honpi gige ding a, mun keu ah leng a hon taisak ding a, na guhte leng a hatsak ding; tui a vak huan bang leh, tuinak nei kang ngeilou bang na hita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in nang a kipan a hongpawt dingte’n mun lui sesate a lem nawn ding ua: suan tampi suangphum ding in na lem tou nawn ding; huchi in nang bel, a selai bawl hoihpa, Mi omna ding a lampite bawl hoihpa, a honchi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawlni tanglou lou ding a, ka ni siangthou a na deihlam hihlou ding a na khepek na ngat kiksak a, khawlni ni kipahhuai leh Toupa ni siangthou zahhuai na chih a, nangmah lampi tawnloua, nangmah nopsakna bawlloua, nangmah thu genloua, na pahtawi leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa tung ah na kipak ding a, lei munsangte ah k’on tuangsak ding; na pu Jakob gouluah thil in ka honvak ding: Toupa kam in huai a chita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai un, Toupa khut hondam theilou ding in tomsak in a omkei a; a bil leng za theilou ding in a ngong sam kei:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na thulimlouhnate uh noumau leh na Pathian kal ua kia in a honkhen ahi, bil a a zak nop louhna ding in na khelhnate un a mai a hon liahsak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na khutte ulah sisan a hihnit in a om a, na khutzungte ulah thulimlouhna a hihnit in a om hi; na mukte un zuau a gen a, na lei uh ginatlouhna thu gen in a phun nuanua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kuamah in diktak in thukhawk a gen kei ua, kuamah in thutak in thu a genpih ngeikei uh: huihkhua lelte a muang ua, zuau a gen nak uhi; thilhihkhelhna a pai ua, thulimlouhna a suang zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thangtom tuite a opkhum ua, maimom gil puan a gan uh: a tui nemite a si uhi, hihtap a om ah gul a hongpawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A maimon gil puante uh puansilh ding in a hong omkei ding a, a thilhihte uh leng a silh sam kei ding uh: a thilhihte ulah thulimlouhna thilhihte ahi a, hiamgamtak a hihna a khut uah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A khete uh thil hoihlou lam ah a tai a, gensiat bei sisan suah ding in a kintat nilouh louh uh: a ngaihtuahte ulah thulimlouhna ngaihtuahnate ahi a; gamna leh siatna a lampi uahte a om zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungmuanna lampi a theikei ua; a paina uah dikna himhim a om ngeikei: amau ading in lam kawi bang a bawl ua; huailai a pai peuhmah in lungmuanna a thei ngeikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in vaihawmna ei a kipan a gamlapi ah a om naknak a, diktatna in a hon phazou ngeikei: vak i ngak ua, himahleh, ngai in, mial a honghi a; vakna i ngak ua, himahleh mial bikbek mah ah i pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mittaw bang in bang i mai puampuam ua, ahi, mit neiloute bang in i mai puampuam uhi: khomialtung bang in sun in i kisui ua; mi hatte lak ah misi bang phet i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vompite bang in i vek un i ham dupdup ua, vakhute bang in nakpitak in i thum ngutngut uh: vaihawmna i ngak ua, himahleh, a om hetkei hi; hotdamna i ngak ua, himahleh gamlapi ah a hon omsan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I tatleknate I ma uah a khangta a, i khelhnate’n a hon hek gige hi: i tatleknate lah i kiang uah a om gige ngal a, i thulimlouhnate i thei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I takleknate, Toupa i theihmohbawlte, i Pathian i zuihlouh a i kiheisante, nuaisiah thu leh hel thu i gente, zuauthu i pai ua, lungtang a kipan i genkhiak zelte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in vaihawmna in nunglam a hong ngatsan a, diktatna in gamlapi ah a hondin santa: thutak lah kongzing ah a puk a, dikna a lut theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi, thutak a omta kei a; thil hoihlou tawpsanmi gallak in a kibawl zel: Huchi in Toupa’n huai a mu a, vaihawmna himhim omta lou in a lungkimsakta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, mi himhim a omkei chih a thei a, ngetsakmi mawngmawng a omlouh uh lamdang a chi a: huaiziak in amah ban mahmah in hotdamna a kibawla; amah diktatna mah in a kilenkip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Diktatna lum in a nei a, hotdamna lukhu a khu a; puansilh in phulakna puansilhte a silh a, puanaktual ding in phatuamngaihna a silh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thilhihte uh bang in, a thilhihte uh bang in a man a thuk ding, amah doumite hehna in, a melmate thukna in a thuk ding; tuikulhgamte thukna in a thuk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa min tumlam a kipan in a lau ding ua, a thupina leng ni suahna a kipan in a lau ding uh; amah lah tui khangguih, Toupa hu a mut luang zoizoi bang in a hongpai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zion ah Tanpa in a hongpai ding a, Jakobte lak a tatlekna tawpsanmite lak ah leng a hongpai ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ken zaw, hiai ahi a kiang ua ka thukhun, Toupa’n a chi: ka kha na tung a om leh, ka thu na kam a ka koihte’n, tuban tangtawn pha in na kam a pawtsan kei ding ua, na suante kam leng a pawtsan sam kei ding ua, na tusuan sawnte kam leng a pawtsan sam kei ding uh, Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thou inla, vak in; na vak a hongtung a, Toupa thupina na tung ah a hong suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai in, mial in leitung a khuh ding a, mial bikbek in mite a khuh ding ahi; himahleh na tung ah Toupa a hongsuak ding a, thupina na tung ah a hong kilang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in namchih na vak lam ah a hongpai ding ua, kumpipate leng n’ong suah vakna lam ah a hongpai ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dak inla, na mit in en vialvial in, en in, avek un a kikhawm ua, na kiang ah a hongpai uhi: na tapate gamlapi a kipan in a hongpai ding ua, na tanute a hong don ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in na mu ding a, na vakta ding a, na lungtang kipak in a ling ding, zat sak in a om ding; tuipi a hauhsakna in na kianglam a honnaih ding a, namte thahatna na kiang a hongtun ding ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sangawngsau tampi’n hontuam ding ua, Midian leh Ephah gam a sangawngsau tuaite’n; huaite tengteng Sheba gam a kipan in a hongpai ding uh: dangkaeng leh begaw a honpaw ding ua, Toupa phatna thu a theisak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kedarte ganhon tengteng na kiang ah a omkhawm in a om ding ua, Nebajoth a belamtalte’n na nna a sem ding uh: ka maitam ah kipak in a paitou ding ua, ka thupina in ka pahtawi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mei bang a leng leh, vakhu amau tohlet zuan a leng duamduam bang kuate ahi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman a hon pahtawi ziak in Toupa na Pathian min ding leh Israelte Mi Siangthou ading in na tapate a dangka uleh dangkaeng toh gamlapi a kipan a pi din pellou in tuikulhgamte’n a honngak ding ua, Tarsish long liante’n masakpen a tuh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, gamdang mite’n kulh bangte a lemtou nawn ding ua, a kumpipate un na nna a sem ding uh: ka heh in k’on sat a, himahleh ka hon deihsakna in k’on hehpih leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kongkhakte leng hon in a om gige ding ua; sun le zan in a khak kei ding uh; mite’n namchih sum na kiang a a hontawi ua, a kumpipate uh a honpi theih sam na ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na nna sem nuamlou nam leh gam a mangthang ding uhi; ahi, huai namte zaw suksiat in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka Mun Siangthou zem ding in Lebanon thupina na kiang ah a hongpai ding, meilahte, phante, singgelh chi a hong paikhawm ding ua Ka khe sikna mun ka thupi bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang honhih gentheite tapate kun in na kiang ah a hongpai ding ua; nangmah musitmite na khepek nuai ah a kun ding ua, nang bel Toupa khopi, Israelte Mi Siangthou Zion, a honchi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kuamah veh ngeilouh khopi, paisan leh huat a na om sang in tangtawn suanpen, suan tampi kipahna ding in k’on bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Namchih nawitui na tep ding a, kumpipate nawi leng na tep ding: kei Toupa zaw nang hon hondampa leh nang Tanpa, Jakob Mi Hat ka hi chih na honthei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dal tang in dangkaeng k’on la ding a, sik tang in dangka k’on la ding, sing tang in leng sumbelsik, suang tang in sik: lungmuanna na heutu ding in ka sep lai ding a, diktatna nang hon phutmi ding in ka sep ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiamgam a thilhih husa na gam ah zak ahita kei ding a, hiamgamna leh siatna husa leng na gamgi sung ah zak ahita kei ding; na kulh Hotdamna, na chi zaw ding a, na kongkhakte leng, Phatna, na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sun a nang hontan ding ni a hi kei ding a; kha leng vakna ding in a hon vaksak sam kei ding: Toupa bel nang ading in tangtawn vaksakpa ding in a om ding a, na Pathian leng na thupina ding ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na ni a tumta kei ding a, na kha leng a mangta kei ding hi: Toupa tangtawn vaksakpa ahita ding a, na lusun nite a tawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na mite avek un mi diktat ahi ding ua, na gam a luah tawntung ding uh: pahtawi a ka om theihna ding a amau a zung selkhia ka suan, ka khut suak ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi tawmpen sang khat ahi ding ua, mi neupen leng nam hatte ahi ding uhi, kei Toupa’n a hunhun in ka tungsak pahpah ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Liangvaite kiang a Tanchin hoih gen ding a Toupa’n thau honnilh ziak in Toupa Pathian kha ka tung ah a om; aman, lungtang khasiate tuam ding, salte kiang a pawtna thu leh saltangte kiang a tanin honna thu gen ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa lungkim kum thu leh i Pathian phulak ni thugen ding bang, lungkhamte lungmuan ding bang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vut tang a pakkhigui bang, lungkham tang a nuamna thau bang, nguina kha tang a phatna puansilh bang a kiang ua piak ding, Zion a lungkham a omte ading a seh ding bang in a honsawl ahi: Amah pahtawi a a omna ding in, diktatna sing Toupa suante chih, a hih theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mun lui sesate a lem nawn ding ua, tuma a khua sesate a ding hoih saknawn ding ua, khopi sesa, suan tampi gamnate, a bawlhoih nawn ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamdangmite’n na ganhonte uh ding in a vak ding ua, theihngeilouh mite na leiletmi ding un leh na grepgui uh kemmi ding in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nou bel, Toupa siampute, chih a loh in na om ding uh: mite’n i Pathian nasemmite a honchi ding uh; namchih sum na ne ding ua, a thupina uh na suang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na zahlakna gun uh a lehnih na mu ding ua; na zum gun un na tantuan uah nuamsa in la na sa ding uh; huaiziak in na gam uah a zahnih na luah ding ua; tangtawn nopsakna nou a ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei Toupa’n vaihawmna dik ka deih a, thulimlou tak a hiamgam zaw ka hua hi; huchi in amau ka thukna chihtak ngial in a kiang uah ka pe ding a, a kiang uah tangtawn thu leng ka khung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in a suante uh namchih lak a theih ahi ding ua, a tate uh michih lak a theih ahi ding uh: amau mute’n Toupa vualzawl chi ahi uh chih a thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa ah nakpitak in nuam ka sa ding a, ka hinna Pathian ah kipaktak in a om ding; mouneipa ding pakkhigui a kizep bang leh, mou ding a kivatnate a a kivan zel bang in, ama’n hotdamna puansilhte a hon silhsak a, diktatna puanaktual in a hon tuamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leitung in a thil dawn a pawtsak bang leh, huan in asung a thil chinte a dawnsak bang in, Toupa Pathian in diktatna leh phatna nam chiteng ma ah a dawnkhe sak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A diktatna uh vakna bang a suah a, amah hotdamna khawnvak kuang bang a a suah masiah, Zion ziak in ka dai nilouh kei ding a, Jerusalem ziak in ka om kinken kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in na diktatna a mu ding ua, kumpipa tengteng in na thupina a mu ding uh: huan, min thak, Toupa kam in a sak ding in, a honsam ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa khut a kilawmna lallukhu leh i Pathian khut a thupina lukhu na hi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lamdang, a honchi nawn kei ding uh; na gam leng, Hihsiat a chi n’on sam kei ding uh; Hephzibah, a hon chita ding ua, na gam leng Biulah, a chi ding uhi: Toupa na tung ah a kipak ngal a, na gam in pasal a nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangval in nungak zi a a neih bang in na tapate’n zi in a hon nei ding uh: mou neimi mou tung a a kipah bang in, na Pathian na tung ah a kipak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, na kulhtung ah galvilmi ka vilsak a; sun leh zan in chiklaimah in a dai kei ding: nou Toupa theihpih ding a omte aw, om kinken hetkei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah leng om kinken sak kei un, Jerusalem a hihkip a, lei a phathuai a a bawl masiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n a khut taklam leh a banhat lou a a kichiam in, na buh nang hon doumite an ding in ka pe nawn kei ding a: gamdang mite’n na sepkhiak uain a dawn nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A buh late’n a ne zaw ding ua, Toupa a phat ding ua a loumite’n ka Mun Siangthou huangsung intual ah a dawnta ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawt unla, kulh kongpite ah pawt un; mite din lampi bawl unla; sungvum un, lamlian sungvum un; suangte tomsiang unla; mite ading in chiamtehna takkhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai un, kawlmong pha in huchi in a theisak ahi, Zion tanu kiang ah hichi in gen un, En in, nangmah hotdamna a hongtung ding; en in, a kipahman a kiang ah a om hi, a ditna leng a ma ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in amau, Misiangthoute, Toupa tatte, a chi ding uh; nang zaw Zonkhiak, Paisan louh khopi a honchi ding uh, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Edom gam a kipan hongpai, Bozrah khua a kipan puansilh diahsan silh kua ahia? A puansilh a thupitak, a hatna a thupidan bang a hongpai? Kei Toupa diktattak a thugen a, hotdam lam a mihat mahmah ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangziak a na puansilh san a, na silhlehtente leng grep sukna khuk a chiltaimi silhlehten bang a om ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimah kia in grep sukna khuk ah ka chiltai a; michih lak a mi khat lel leng ka kiang ah a omkei uh; ahi, amau ka heh a ka chil a, ka heh a ka pal a: huchi in a hinna sisan uh ka puansilhte ah theh in a om a, ka puan tengteng ka hihninta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Phulak ni ka lungtang ah a om a, ka tatsa mite kum leng a hongtungta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in ka en a, panpih ding mi a omkei ua; len ding mi a omlouh uh lamdang ka sa a: huaiziak in keimah ban mahmah in hotdamna honpuak a; ka hehna in a hon lenkip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, michih ka heh in ka sikden a, ka heh in ka khamsak a, a hinna sisan uh lei ah ka bawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n thil bangkim a honvuh bangzel in Toupa chitdanthute leh toupa phatna thute ka gen ding a; a hehpihnate leh a chitna thupidante bangzel a Israel inkuanpihte lak a a hoihna thupi mahmah a a tung ua a vuh thu leng ka gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman, Ka mite, hitaktak hi ua, zuautat lou ding tate ahi uh, a chi hi. Huchi in amaute hondampa din a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mangbatna tengteng uah amah a mangbang a, angel, a ma a om in, amaute a humbit a: a itna leh a hehpihna in a tanta a; nidanglai ni tengteng ah amaute a pua in amaute a pom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh a hel un, a Kha Siangthou a lungkhamsak ua: huaiziak in amau dou ding in kilehheisak in a om a, amau a sualta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huailai in a mite’n Mosi nidanglai nite a theigige ua, hichi in a chi uh, Tuipi a kipan a a belamhon chingmite toh amaute pi Toupa koi a om ahia? A Kha Siangthou a lak ua koihpa koi a om ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ban thupitak Mosi taklam a paisakpa koi a om ahia? Tangtawn min kibawl nadia a ma ua tui kikhensakpa koi a om ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kisuihlouhna ding ua tui thuktak a, gamdai a sakol pi bang a, amaute pikaipa koi a om ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Guam a gan paisukte bang in Toupa Kha in amau a khawlsak a: huchibang in, min thupitak na kibawl na ding in, na mite na pi hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa , Van a kipan in hon ensuk inla, na siangthouna leh na thupina omna a kipan in hon en in: na phatuamngaihna leh na thilhih thupitakte koi ah? Na lungtang a n’on ngaihna leh n’on hehpihna, kham a omta hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abraham in hon theilou in, Israel in leng hon limsak keimah leh, nang zaw ka Pa uh na hi a: nang zaw, aw Toupa , ka Pa uh na hi a; na min tangtawn a kipan in kou Hontanpa na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang bangziak in ahia na lampi a kipan a hon vakmangsak na hia? Na sikha, na gouluah namte ziak in hongkik nawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na misiangthoute’n sawtlou chik kia a nei ua: hondoute’n lah na min siangthou a sikgawpta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A tung ua vai na hawm ngeilouhte, na min pu ngeiloute namte ka bangta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw tangte na ma a a luankhiak zoizoina ding un, van botkek in hong kumsuk teitei lechin aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Namchih na ma a a linna ding un nang hondoute kiang a na min theihsakna ding in, mei in sing nen a kuangsak a, mei in tui a sousak bang in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lamet louh uh thil mulkimhuai na hihlai in na hongsuk a, tangte na ma ah a luangkhe zoizoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nidanglai a kipan in mite’n, nangkia loungal, amaute ngak ding a, sepsak zelpa Pathian a thei ngeikei ua, bil in lah a za ngeikei ua, mit in leng a mu ngei sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang zaw, nuamtak a om a diktat tak a hih mi, na lampite a nang hon theigigete, na don a; ngai in, nang na heh a, kou thil ka hihkhial ua; huaite ah sawtpi ka omta ua, huchi in hotdam in ka om thei lai ding uam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi nin bang in ka na om vekta ngal ua, ka diktatna teng uh leng puansilh nin bang ahi: ka vek un nah bang in ka vuai ua; ka thulimlouhnate un huih bang in a hon mutmang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in na min lou a, nang honlen ding a kihihhalh kuamah a omkei uh: kou a kipan in na mai na selta ngal a, ka thulimlouhnate uh zang in n’on mangsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin zaw, aw Toupa , nang ka pa uh na hi; kou bellei ka hi ua; nang kou honvelpa na hi; huchi in ka vek un na khutsuak ka hi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa aw, heh kenla, thulimlouhnate leng tangtawn in theigige ken: ngai in hehpih in hon en inla, ka vek un nangmah mite ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na khopi siangthoute gamdai a hongsuak ua, Zion gamdai a hongsuak a, Jerusalem mun nawtsiat a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka inn siangthou uleh ka inn kilawm tak uh, ka pipute un nang a honphat zelna uh, mei a hal ahi; ka thil deihhuaite tengteng ulah hihsiat in a omvekta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa aw, huai thilte ah na kidek thei ding ahia? Na dai nilouh in n’on hihgenthei nilouh ding ahia?
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei hondeih ngeiloute zon in ka om; hon zong ngeiloute muhkhiak in ka om: ka min pulou nam kiang ah, “Hon en un, hon en un” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi helhatte ading in nitum in ka bante ka zak, huaite bel amau ngaihtuahnate bangzel a lampi hoihlou a paite ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huante a kithoih a, teklei tungte a banghiam gimlim hal a, ka maitang mahmah a hon hihheh nakte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Han lak a te tu a, mundaite a giak zelte, voksa ne a, a belte ua thil kihhuai tuichik om zelte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang kia in ding in, hon naihken, nang sang in ka siangthou zaw hi, chite ahi uh: huaite bel ka nak a meikhu om, nitum a mei mitlou om gige nakte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai in, ka ma ah gelh in a om: ka dai nilouh kei ding a, ka thuk ding, a angsung uah ka thuk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noumau thulimlouhna leh na pute uh thulimlouhnate, Toupa’n a chi, huaite’n lah tangliante tung ah gimlim a hal ua, tang tungte ah ka min a gensia uhi: huaiziak in a nasep uh a masapen in a angsung uah ka tehsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi, Grep bawm ah uain thak a mu ua, min, Hihse ken, huai ah lah vualzawlna a om ngal a, a chih bang un, ka sikhate ziak in ka hih sam ding, avek ua ka suksiatlouna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan, Jakob a kipan in chi khat ka pawtsak ding a, Judah a kipan in ka tangte luah ding ka pawtsak ding: huchi in ka mitelte’n huai a luah ding ua, ka sikhate huai ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, ka mi, kei hon zongte ading in, Sharon belamhonte huang ahi ding a, Akor guam bel bawnghon kualna mun ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh nou Toupa paisan a , ka tang siangthou mangngilh a, Vangphatna pathian ading a dohkan bawl a, Tanhun ngaihtuahsaknu ding a dawn thillat lante aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />K’on saplai in n’on dawng nuam kei ua, thu ka gen lai in na za utkei ua, ka mitmuh in thil gilou na hihzaw ua, ka kipahpih louh thil na telzawk ziak un namsau in na tanhun uh k’on ngaihtuahsak ding a, na vek un thahna ah na kunvek ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi a, Ngai un, ka sikhate’n a ne ding ua, nou bel gilkial in na om ding ua: Ngai un, ka sikhate’n a dawn ding ua, nou bel dangtak in na om ding uh: ngai un, ka sikhate’n nuam a sa ding ua, nou bel na zum ding uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai un, ka sikhate lungtang a kipah ziak un la a sa ding ua, nou bel lungtang a na lungkham ziak un na kap ding uh, kha a na vui ziak un na mau vungvung ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan, na min uh kichiamna ding in ka mi telte kiang ah na nuse ding ua, Toupa Pathian in a honthat ding hi; huan, a sikhate min dang in a samta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in, lei a amah ki vualzawl tawm mi bel thutak Pathian ah a ki vualzawl ding a; lei a a kichiammi in thutak Pathian lou in a kichiam ding; nidang a lungkhamnate mangngilh a a omtak ziak in leh ka mit a kipan a sel a a omtak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai un, van thakte leh leithak ka siam ahi; nidanglai thilte zaw theihgige in a om nawn kei ding a, lungsim ah leng a lut nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh ka thilsiam ah tangtawn in kipak in nuamsa un; ngai un, Jerusalem nuamsakna ding in ka siam a, a mite kipahna din ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem tung ah nuam ka sa ding a, ka mite tung ah leng ka kipak ding: asung ah kap husa zak ahi nawn kei ding a, mau husa leng zak ahi nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai a kipan a pawtzaw naungek ni sawtlou chik dam a omkei ding ua, putek a damsung nite tangtun lou leng a omkei ding uh; naupang lah kum za a upa in a si ding ua, mikhial kum za lel dam zaw hamsethuak ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan, innte a lam ding ua, huaite ah a om gige ding uh; grephuan a bawl ding ua, a gah leng a ne ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Midang omna ding in inn a lam nawn kei ding ua, midang nek ding in grephuan a bawl nawn kei ding uh; sing damsung nite bang in ka mite damsung nite lah om ding ahi ngal a, ka mi telte zaw sawtpi a sepkhiak tung uah a kipak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangmahlou in a semgim kei ding ua, vangtah lel ding in ta a neisam kei ding uh; Toupa vualzawlmi suante ahi ngal ua, a tate uh a kiang uah a om nilouh ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi ding a, amau honsap ma un ka dawng ding a; thu a gen sanlai un leng ka bil in ka za ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngia leh belamnou a gamta khawm ding ua, humpinelkai in bawngtal bang in buhpawl a ne ding; leivui gulpi an ahi ding. Ka tang siangthou ah a kihihna nawn kei ding ua, a kihihse nawn sam kei ding uh, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi, “Van ka tutphah ahi a, lei ka khe ngakna ahi: inn bangchibang ahia n’on lamsak ding uh? Koilai ahia ka khawlna ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai thil bangkim lah ka khut a ka bawl ahi ngal ua, huchi in hiai thil bangkim a hong omta ahi, Toupa’n a chi: himahleh hiai mi genthei tak a om, lungsim a kisik tuntun, ka thu a ling zelzaw ka en zaw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawngtal goumi zaw mi that bang ahi a; thilpiak lanmi zaw vok sisan lanmi bang ahi a; begaw halmi zaw milim vualzawlmi bang ahi: ahi, amau lampi a telta ua, a thilkihhuaite uah a lungsim uh a kipak zel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka saplai a kuamah in hon dawn kei ua, thu ka gen lai a bil a a zak louh ua, ka mitmuh a thil gilou a hih zawk ua, ka thil kipahpihlouh lam a tel ziak un ken leng amau khemna dingte ka telsak ding a, a kihtak lam uh a tung uah ka tungsak ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thu a lingte aw, Toupa thu za un: na unau uh, nou hon hawpa leh ka min ziak a nou hon delhkhete’n, Na kipahman uh ka muhtheih na ding un, Toupa hih thupi in om hen, a chi ua, himahleh a zum zawta ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua! Khopi a lum vengvung husa! Biakin husa eive! a melmate thukpa Toupa husa eive!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman vei manlou in nau a nei a; na manlou in pasal naupang a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchibang kuan a za ngei a? Huchibang kua ahia a mu ngei? Ni khat in gam a piangguih ding ahia? Thakhat in nam suan in a omguih ding ahia? Zion in nau a veitak in a tate a neipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pian hun tungsak ngal in ka neikei ding ahia? Toupa’n a chi: kei neisak zelpa’n ta ka neisak phal kei ding ahia? Na Pathian in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem itte tengteng aw, Jerusalem nuamsakpih unla, kipahpih un: amah sunte tengteng aw, kipah ziak in nuamsak pih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tep ua, a lungmuanna nawite a na tai theihna ding un leh, na tep peng ua, a thupina tampi a na kipah theih na ding un, chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi ngal a, ngai un, lemna luipi bang mai in a kiang pha in ka luangsak ding a, namchih thupina luita a kuang a let zoizoi bang mai in a kiang pha in ka luangsak ding, huchi in huai na tep ding uh; hon angpom ding a, a pheipi tung ah a hon tawmsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi, a nun a lungmuan bang in k’on lungmuan ding; huchi in Jerusalem ah lung muan in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huai na mu ding ua, na lungtang un nuam a sa ding a, na guhte uh leng loupa hing dipdip bang in a pha lihliah ding: huchi in Toupa khut a sikhate lam ah a om chih a thei ding ua, a melmate tung ah a lungkim kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai un, a hehna thangpaihna a thuk ding leh, a salhna meikuang a thuk ding in Toupa mei toh a hongpai ding hi, a kangtalaite pingpei bang mai ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mei in ahi, Toupa’n a ngaihtuah ding, a namsau in ahi mi tengteng a ngaihtuah ding: huchi in Toupa hihlupte zaw tampi ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huante ah a hoh ua, a lai a mi nung a om khepkhup ding a kihihsiangthou leh kisiangsak zelte, voksa leh thil kihhuai leh chikpi nete, a mangthang khawm ding uh, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thilhihte uleh a ngaihtuahte uh lah ka thei ngal a: namchih leh pauchih ka pikhawm hun a hongtung sin; huchi in a hongpai ding ua, ka thupina a mu ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan, a lak uah chiamtehna ka omsak ding a, huchi in a lak ua gawtna pelte peuhmah namchih kiang ah Tarsishte, Pulte, thangpeu laite Lud kiang ah, tuikulhgam gamlapi, ka minthanna za ngei nailou Tubal leh Javante kiang ah, ka thupina mungei nailoute kiangte ah ka sawl ding; huchi in namchih lak ah ka thupina thu a gen ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in, Israel telte’n a thillat uh belsuan siangthou tak a Toupa inn a a honglutzel bang un, Toupa kiang a thillat ding in namchih teng lak a kipan na unaute tengteng uh sakol tung, kangtalaite, zawnnate, sabiltung tungte, sangawngsau tungte ah, Jerusalem ka tang siangthou ah a honpi ding uh, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan huaite lak a kipan in siampu dingte leh Levimi dingte ka la ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka bawl ding van thakte leh lei thak ka ma ah om gige ding bang in, na suante uh leh na min uh leng a om gige ding ahi, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi ding a, kha thak a kipan a kha thak dang tan in, khawlni a kipan a khawlni dang tan in mi tengteng ka ma a hon be ding in a hongpai zungzung ding uh, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A paikhe ding ua, ka tung a talekte luang a en ding uh: a thante uh a si kei ding a, a meite uh leng thah in a omsak kei ding hi; mitengteng ading in thil kihhuai mahmah ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
